&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer - Distributed Systems (ODP Governance)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ODP Governance is a cross platform team working in the biggest Datadog products (Metrics, Logs, APM) with the mission of giving customers governance tools to control costs and data hygiene of their telemetry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team builds cost controls and governance tools that help Datadog’s enterprise customers manage data ingestion, reduce unwanted data, and prioritize the telemetry that delivers the most value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our scope spans multiple Datadog products, including Metrics, Events, Logs, and APM. As a backend engineering team, we partner with these product teams to address recurring customer challenges that create operational friction, increase costs, and contribute to churn.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also identify opportunities to extend successful capabilities across products—for example, adapting a control developed for Logs to support APM.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships that it builds, the creativity it brings to the table, and the collaboration of being together. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our employees can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build performant high scale distributed systems to handle the load of Datadog’s biggest products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships across teams and independently seek out the information needed to move work forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become productive in unfamiliar systems and navigate ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate technical dependencies and integration challenges early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognize when a solution could benefit another product and take the initiative to explore it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect engineering decisions to customer value, cost efficiency, and usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 6+ years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant backend programming experience in one or more languages (Go, Java, Rust, C++)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed systems engineer with experience building high performance large scale systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills (English).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High proactivity and cross-team collaboration experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited about leveraging AI tools to enhance how you code, solve problems, and build – or eager to learn how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: You’re motivated to push the boundaries of how AI can improve software engineering best practices and contribute to building AI-enabled products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our Internal panel discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;At Datadog, we process millions of monitors every minute, alerting our customers when configured thresholds are crossed. Engineers across the world trust us to alert them when necessary, so our Alerting stack needs to be reliable and scalable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Alerting Platform Automation team’s main goal is to improve the processes and tooling that let our Alerting developers operate the platform efficiently. We design and operate automation systems that replace manual actions, from creating environments to deploying and testing safely. We build test environments that give engineers and their AI coding tools fast, reliable feedback, so changes can be validated in minutes rather than days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team is looking for a Senior Software Engineer to help us maintain and scale the Alerting platform. In this position, you’ll work daily with our users, understanding their needs, defining solutions, building the necessary tooling and communicating with all our stakeholders appropriately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships and collaboration it builds and the creativity it brings to the table. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our Datadogs can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build automation systems that create and manage Alerting environments, with a focus on fast, realistic test environments that shorten the feedback loop for engineers and AI-assisted development workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with SRE, Core Infrastructure and the Alerting engineering teams to understand their needs and provide solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead infrastructure projects and improve our CI/CD and developer tooling, including our deployment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify reliability bottlenecks, then design solutions to mitigate or eliminate them, including load testing and testing of infrastructure configuration before it reaches production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve infrastructure isolation and make our services scale automatically with load.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re interested in ops and infrastructure challenges, and you’re comfortable writing the code that automates them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can analyze a problem, identify its root cause and propose short-term and long-term solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a team player, able to work easily with your team members and with many other development teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate appropriately to your audience, from fellow devs to top management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work autonomously across multiple technologies owned by different teams, and you like to discover and learn new ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think that infrastructure and code are equally important.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about how AI-assisted development changes the way we build and test software, and you enjoy making tooling that works well for both humans and agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That’s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our Internal panel discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive global benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Artefact is an international consulting and engineering company specialising in data and AI, and a European leader in its field. Our headquarters is located in Paris. For the past 10 years, we have focused on designing and deploying artificial intelligence technologies and data-driven solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Paris, we are now present in 24 countries across all continents, with 1,700 employees worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission is to help businesses unlock the full potential of AI and data by developing bespoke solutions tailored to their specific business challenges. As pioneers in this domain, we combine technological expertise with operational excellence, working closely with leading players in the market. Our clients span all key sectors of the economy – including industry, retail, luxury, FMCG, healthcare, and finance – and include major international groups.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond consulting, we are strongly committed to promoting ethical and accessible AI. We have launched the School of Data to support career transitions into tech roles, and established an AI Research Centre in both Paris and Shanghai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the context of Artefact’s accelerating growth, we are looking for a B2B Marketing Intern to join our Marketing team starting in &lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about B2B marketing in the Tech area and want to work in an environment where your impact on business growth is recognised?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, and you’re ready to step-up your career and level of responsibility, then you might just be our next &lt;strong&gt;B2B Marketing Assistant Intern.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Marketing team at Artefact directly contributes to the business by engaging with existing clients and prospects to convert them as leads to generate sales. We do so by working closely with the heads of departments &amp;amp; consultant teams, as well as using KPI to make sure we create the right marketing deliverables and use the right channels to drive engagement, and ultimately leads and revenue.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We do this through &lt;strong&gt;demand generation campaigns&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;events/webinars’ organisation&lt;/strong&gt;, combined with &lt;strong&gt;PPC &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;social advertising &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure brand and lead-gen campaigns support business objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be working closely with the rest of the Artefact’s worldwide Marketing team, that’s why fluently speaking in English to share your best practices and train your peers is also required. You will be collaborating with the Marketing Specialists Global and France of the team, who report to the CMO of the Group, all based in Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using our marketing automation tool (Pardot) to conceive and roll-out mailing and lead nurturing campaigns (mailings, newsletters, landing pages) to drive customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping to organize events (webinars, business breakfasts, podcasts, participation in trade fairs &amp;amp; conferences with booths and speaking slots) and ensure a multi-channel attractive communications of these events through our website &amp;amp; landing pages, mailing series and social media (LinkedIn and Instagram).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing LinkedIn advertising campaigns according to objectives (awareness, acquisition) mixing organic and paid approach, to support and generate leads for the management team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copywriting for PPC ads (LinkedIn) and landing pages thanks to engaging and attractive communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating with our design team and briefing them to craft impactful and visually appealing assets that effectively communicate our key messages on social media every day..&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyzing our Marketing Performance dashboards to understand and improve how our inbound marketing activity turns into and converts customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building effective stakeholder relationships (the Growth Tribe (Consulting Partners &amp;amp; Directors) freelancers, agencies, Tech Partners), ensuring all parties are kept informed throughout the campaigns and post activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The candidate will be an enthusiastic and hardworking young professional, excited to join our fast paced marketing team. You will be a confident communicator, have a passion for lead generation and a genuine interest in the tech industry and BtoB marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master in Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management and multitasking skills in a deadline-driven environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRM and Marketing Automation automation systems such as Salesforce.com and Eloqua/Pardot/HubSpot etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn expertise in organic and paid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills (copywriting, editing and presentation) and ability to easily interact with virtual colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to details&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A logical thinker, who’s proactive and results driven&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High level of motivation, confidence and resilience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player, able to collaborate and communicate with other marketing professionals around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Artefact, we recruit our employees solely based on our needs and the individual merits of each candidate. We are committed to developing their professional skills and responsibilities without any form of discrimination – including, but not limited to, beliefs, gender, age, disability, ethnic origin, sexual orientation, or affiliation with any political, religious, trade union, or minority group.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Stage) Assistant Project Manager Hackathons &amp;amp; Innovation - F/H&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage fin d&#39;études&lt;/strong&gt; (6 mois)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Début :&lt;/strong&gt; Janiver 2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris 9e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;Artefact Adopt AI&lt;/strong&gt;, nous propulsons &lt;strong&gt;l’innovation &lt;/strong&gt;à travers des &lt;strong&gt;événements&lt;/strong&gt; d’envergure : Ateliers d&#39;innovation participative, Programmes d&#39;intrapreneuriat, et notre format phare : des &lt;a href=&quot;https://adoptai.artefact.com/content/hackathons&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hackathons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Notre mission ? Connecter et faire collaborer un écosystème d&#39;acteurs clés — étudiants, experts Tech et métiers, décideurs, startups, chercheurs — autour des technologies actuelles et de demain :&lt;strong&gt; IA, Robotique, Quantique…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;En tant qu’Assistant Project Manager, tu co-pilotes ces programmes immersifs de A à Z pour faire émerger des prototypes et solutions, répondant à des problématiques réelles d’aujourd’hui et du futur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Tes défis au quotidien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion et suivi de projet &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu participes à la création et au suivi des supports de pilotage, ainsi qu’à la gestion des jalons clés de nos expériences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures une communication et une coordination fluides entre tous les acteurs du projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Animation digitale&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu pilotes le recrutement des participants, le ciblage des experts (mentors, jurys) et l&#39;animation de nos plateformes en ligne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestration J-J&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu gères la logistique des temps forts et participes activement à la facilitation, animation et à la coordination générale le Jour-J.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production de Livrables&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu conçois les supports de communication (slides, briefs, kits) et structures les synthèses post-événements pour valoriser nos réalisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤖 Ta mission bonus : AI Playground&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu testes et intègres des solutions IA/tech pour booster nos propres process et enrichir l&#39;expérience des participants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parcours :&lt;/strong&gt; Fin d&#39;études (Master 2) en École de commerce, Ingénieur, Université, IEP, Master Innovation, Management, Gestion de Projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu as une vraie rigueur d&#39;organisation, excellent relationnel, autonomie et force de proposition. Tu as une appétence forte pour l&#39;innovation, l&#39;écosystème Tech/IA, la gestion d&#39;événements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu sais opérer Canva, des outils visuels (Klaxoon/Mural), Lemlist et tu joues souvent avec des outils d&#39;IA Générative (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues&lt;/strong&gt; : Français et Anglais courants (contexte international).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Immersion&lt;/strong&gt; : Le meilleur spot pour comprendre concrètement les enjeux et usages de l&#39;IA, la Tech et l’innovation de rupture aujourd&#39;hui.Réseau unique : Tu seras en contact direct des acteurs clé étatiques, de la tech, des startups, des écoles et de l&#39;industrie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un cadre de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; au sein d&#39;une équipe à taille humaine, dynamique, bienveillante et responsabilisante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Gratification compétitive, tickets resto, télétravail flexible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comment postuler ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Envoie-nous ton &lt;strong&gt;CV&lt;/strong&gt; accompagné d’un &lt;strong&gt;support de motivation original &lt;/strong&gt;(libre cours à ta créativité – points bonus pour une utilisation appropriée de solutions IA !).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager - Agent Experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Paris, France preferred, open to London applicants (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Customer care&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary:&lt;/strong&gt; €46,000 – €55,000 / £47,000 – £59,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluency in French &amp;amp; English&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting To:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead Product Manager&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role requires an existing right to work in the EU. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end strategy for Kaluza Agent Experience (KAE) within the European market—grounded in global product goals but sharpened by local client needs and agent behaviors. Driving core operational metrics (AHT, FCR, CSAT, AI adoption, onboarding)ensuring capabilities improve agent/customer outcomes.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Journey Design &amp;amp; UX Consistency: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as guardian of agent UX across KAE to ensure coherence across the experience. Partnering with UX and domain teams to apply shared patterns consistently, reduce agent cognitive load, and maintain alignment and compliance with the design system as new automation and assistive/AI capabilities are introduced.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Integrations &amp;amp; Client Onboarding:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive technical and product integrations with third-party platforms and oversee spinning up new KAE instances end-to-end for incoming clients from discovery through go-live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Accessibility &amp;amp; Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; Champion EU accessibility regulations by design, translating regulatory and market-specific needs into actionable engineering requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engage Clients &amp;amp; Drive Value:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the trusted expert for clients on agent experience, advocating for platform-first configuration over bespoke builds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on Delivery &amp;amp; Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain active involvement across the entire Product Development Life Cycle (PDLC)—from agent discovery sessions to feedback loops—and produce materials to support successful client adoption.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;(Note: Travel to client sites e.g., Brussels, is expected at roughly 1–3 trips a month initially, tapering to 1–2 times a quarter.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally, you’ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact Centre &amp;amp; UX Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep experience owning end-to-end user journeys for high-frequency operational tools (e.g., agent desktops), with hands-on craft in user research, journey mapping, and usability testing with agents and supervisors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EU Accessibility &amp;amp; Platform Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong working knowledge of EU accessibility standards alongside proven experience integrating products with complex third-party platforms and vendor ecosystems.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Delivery &amp;amp; Market Expansion:&lt;/strong&gt; Successful track record implementing or localizing a product for external enterprise clients, taking solutions from zero to live through discovery, configuration, and change management.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Informed Judgement &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability using operational metrics (AHT, FCR, CSAT, agent effort) to defend product decisions, coupled with a platform-first mindset that prioritizes existing capabilities over custom code.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bilingual Capability:&lt;/strong&gt; Full professional bilingual fluency (written and spoken) in both English and French.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience leveraging AI tools, machine learning capabilities, or LLM integrations within product workflows to enhance platform intelligence and automation directly into customer service desktop environments.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience within SaaS platforms, the energy sector, or large-scale utility migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience to scale UI consistency across different product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience to scale UI consistency across different product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Five values guide how we work at Kaluza:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;Personal Buying experience&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior UX Researcher&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior UX Researcher (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To make this mission a reality, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers, and are key enablers of Store business. This is exactly where your mission comes in: unlocking a deep understanding of our in-store teammates to identify key pain points and turn them into clear business opportunities. Working in a dynamic omnichannel context, you will partner closely with product teams to guide the creation of simple, efficient, and field-adapted experiences—enabling our teammates to be as impactful as possible with our customers while bridging the gap between user needs, business goals, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;UX Researcher&lt;/strong&gt; to dive into In-Store behaviors and elevate the &lt;strong&gt;Personal Buying Experience&lt;/strong&gt;. Your mission will be to uncover the needs and friction points of our teammates on the floor, identify and build strong opportunities, while supporting our product team in their craft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;User Researcher&lt;/strong&gt;, you will enrich our &lt;strong&gt;User Knowledge&lt;/strong&gt; and drive the tangible impact of your findings on our in-store tools. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decode the field:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct in-store observations to map the real-world practices, workflows, and pain points of our store teammates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide decision-making:&lt;/strong&gt; Turn qualitative and quantitative data into actionable strategic insights to shape the product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Promote a User-first culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Feed our team&#39;s knowledge repository to align Designers, Product Managers, and Tech leads with the reality on the shop floor.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer / Researcher, you will act as a &lt;strong&gt;key partner with cross-functional product teams&lt;/strong&gt; to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;influence and enlighten decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build a &lt;strong&gt;shared understanding / empathy&lt;/strong&gt; of the current customer experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle &lt;strong&gt;the most relevant opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;build long-term impact&lt;/strong&gt; (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build and feed a long term &lt;strong&gt;user and customer knowledge strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Framing -&lt;/strong&gt; Support product decisions (product outcomes, opportunities, solutions) through research insights and Opportunity Solution Trees (OSTs) / Identify and prioritize research plans with stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Research / Problem Discovery -&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover and refine opportunities through qualitative and/or quantitative research / Map end-to-end journeys &amp;amp; opportunity spaces / Make your findings easily accessible and understandable to your stakeholders (readouts, documentation, etc.) / Support teams to setup continuous discovery “habits” (eg. regular &amp;amp; holistic insights gathering, insights library, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Discovery &amp;amp; Testing -&lt;/strong&gt; Support designers &amp;amp; product trios by actively contributing to design critiques &amp;amp; test sessions / Provide research methodology guidance when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusivity &amp;amp; Ethics -&lt;/strong&gt; Craft research methodologies &amp;amp; outputs that fully include the diversity of our users and tackle possible biases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence -&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, countries, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration (functional management) -&lt;/strong&gt; Involve your product teams and stakeholders throughout your research/design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration - &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute to elevate the research practices, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, InStore, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset -&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence&lt;/strong&gt; - Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration &lt;/strong&gt;- Involve your product team and stakeholders throughout your design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; - Contribute to elevate the design practice, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions (co-design, design critiques) with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; - Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join the In-Store adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few challenges you may tackle if you join the In-Store adventure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enhance the human bound&lt;/strong&gt; - Simplifying complexity and leveraging store teams and management, building more and more quality time spaces between our customer and our teammate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve Store efficiency&lt;/strong&gt; - Empower our teammates on the field, understand their pain-points and provide strong, efficient and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reinforce the end-to-end, omni experience&lt;/strong&gt; - Contribute to an high &amp;amp; amazing end-to-end experience for our customer, by designing the best digital experience for our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design the store of tomorrow&lt;/strong&gt; - Leverage on digital to support the store evolution, and design the futur of our actual main touchpoint with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Store might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to support the teammates, and be at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating with a wide variety of expertises &amp;amp; stakeholders (your product team, but also people from eCom, Business, Countries, Sports, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a lovely &amp;amp; united team, always ready to help each other or share good laughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in transforming Decathlon’s stores !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible working:&lt;/strong&gt; 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work locations:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille, Paris, or Nantes;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-quality gear:&lt;/strong&gt; Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global reach:&lt;/strong&gt; A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skill development:&lt;/strong&gt; Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation package:&lt;/strong&gt; Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Store layout&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Digital Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior Product Designer (IC3)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Lille&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Timing: ASAP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport and make wellbeing accessible for all. To align this mission with planet boundaries, Decathlon relies on In-Store teammates who embody the human touchpoint between our brand and our customers. This is exactly where your mission comes in: designing simple, efficient in-store experiences that make our teammates&#39; lives easier, enabling them to be as effective and impactful as possible with our customers. Within an omnichannel context, your mission will be to combine operational excellence with user needs, bridging the gap between operational requirements, business objectives, and technological opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital plays a pivotal role in the quality of the connection built during moments shared between customers and teammates. How? By ensuring every In-Store Decathlonian works in an efficient and adapted environment that seamlessly supports their daily tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a Senior Product Designer to elevate our digital strategy within the Store Layout domain. As part of a dynamic team, you will shape a digital solution that empowers central teams to deliver international and localized visual assets, while enabling stores to effortlessly manage their in-store communication. Your role is to establish a comprehensive end-to-end user experience connecting merchandisers with store staff, driving more performant store layouts and streamlined daily operations for 80,000+ users across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you will join a cross-functional team (Product, Engineering, Business, etc.) and have the responsibility to participate in the discovery process, to continuously improve and develop the new product and to help with the change management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Designer, you will act as a key partner with cross-functional product teams to&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;influence and enlighten decisions, whether long-term strategy, quarterly roadmaps or day-to-day tactics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ensure that we identify and tackle the most relevant opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;explore &amp;amp; de-risk solutions that are desirable… but also viable and feasible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;build long-term impact (outcomes) rather than features (outputs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Craft / Core skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategy - Support an holistic vision of &quot;Personal Buying Experience&quot; domain (omnichannel journeys and ecosystems)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem Discovery - Uncover and refine opportunities through qualitative and/or quantitative research / Map &amp;amp; help prioritize product decisions with Opportunity Solution Trees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solution Discovery - Explore &amp;amp; co-create multiple solutions / Prototype early, iterate often / Design usable interfaces aligned with our design system and accessibility standards (WCAG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Testing - Constantly de-risk the relevance, usability and impact of explored solutions, using the most adapted method (usability tests, A/B tests, surveys, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence - Work closely and proactively with all expertises (product, business, engineering, etc.) to influence strategies, prioritization and discovery/delivery roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration - Involve your product team and stakeholders throughout your design process, leveraging the right methods and/or storytelling, creating a safe environment for feedbacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design collaboration - Contribute to elevate the design practice, run and/or participate to collaborative design sessions (co-design, design critiques) with your peers across multiple teams (New Business Models, eCommerce, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth mindset - Proactively identify and build on your strengths and improvement areas, turn failures into positive learning lessons (for you and for others)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join the In-Store adventure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are a few challenges you may tackle if you join the In-Store adventure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance the human bound - Simplifying complexity and leveraging store teams and management, building more and more quality time spaces between our customer and our teammate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve Store efficiency - Empower our teammates on the field, understand their pain-points and provide strong, efficient and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reinforce the end-to-end, omni experience - Contribute to an high &amp;amp; amazing end-to-end experience for our customer, by designing the best digital experience for our teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the store of tomorrow - Leverage on digital to support the store evolution, and design the futur of our actual main touchpoint with the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In-Store might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to support the teammates, and be at the heart of Decathlon&#39;s ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love collaborating with a wide variety of expertises &amp;amp; stakeholders (your product team, but also people from eCom, Business, Countries, Sports, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be part of a lovely &amp;amp; united team, always ready to help each other or share good laughs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in transforming Decathlon’s stores !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille, Paris, or Amsterdam;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;an1&quot; src=&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f680/72.png&quot; alt=&quot;🚀&quot; data-emoji=&quot;🚀&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt; Lead Data Engineer - HR Data Migration (Workday) - People VF&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans le cadre d&#39;un remplacement en interne, nous recrutons un·e &lt;strong&gt;Lead Data Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, basé·e à Lille.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous souhaitons accélérer la transformation et la digitalisation de nos processus RH, en partie grâce à une forte maîtrise de nos données People et de leurs usages. Pour accompagner cette transformation, nous déployons une plateforme RH mondiale (Workday) qui intégrera un CORE RH et plusieurs modules de talent management pour les 65 pays dans lesquels Decathlon est implanté.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre mission :&lt;/strong&gt; Au croisement de la stratégie et de l&#39;exécution technique, vous serez le/la garant·e technique de la migration de nos données depuis nos systèmes legacy vers Workday. En tant que Lead Data Engineer, vous concevrez l&#39;architecture de transformation, piloterez la création des pipelines de données, et mettrez en place un monitoring rigoureux pour assurer une migration &quot;zéro défaut&quot;. Vous travaillerez sous la responsabilité du Program Leader et en étroite collaboration avec les équipes projet locales et globales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;an1&quot; src=&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f3af/72.png&quot; alt=&quot;🎯&quot; data-emoji=&quot;🎯&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt; VOS RESPONSABILITÉS PRINCIPALES&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Architecture et Stratégie de Transformation des données :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Définir l&#39;architecture technique et la stratégie de migration des données de nos systèmes sources (legacies) vers le template cible Workday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identifier le périmètre technique de la migration et concevoir des modèles de données répondant aux exigences fonctionnelles et de sécurité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Documenter de manière précise les systèmes sources, les flux, et les règles de transformation complexes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Ingénierie et Développement (Hands-on &amp;amp; Leadership) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concevoir, développer et superviser des pipelines de données robustes, évolutifs et sécurisés (ETL) pour extraire, transformer et charger les données locales vers la plateforme mondiale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Définir et implémenter les règles de transformation avancées pour adapter nos données historiques aux standards stricts de l&#39;intégrateur Workday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assurer l&#39;intégrité, le chiffrage et la sécurité des données RH (données sensibles) tout au long du processus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Monitoring des erreurs, Tests et Qualité des données :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mettre en place les outils de monitoring des pipelines et de gestion des erreurs (alerting, logs) pour identifier, isoler et corriger les anomalies en temps réel lors des phases de tests et de &quot;Go-Live&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concevoir des mécanismes de contrôle qualité automatisés (Data Quality) pour garantir la conformité absolue des données migrées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordonner les tests de migration (unitaires, intégration, fonctionnels) et organiser les activités de validation post-migration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Leadership Technique et Coordination :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Piloter techniquement les ressources data impliquées dans la migration, animer les rituels techniques et garantir les délais et la qualité des livrables.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintenir une communication claire avec les parties prenantes (Data Stream Leader, équipes métiers, intégrateur externe), vulgariser les enjeux techniques et remonter les alertes avec des plans de mitigation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;an1&quot; src=&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f6e0_fe0f/72.png&quot; alt=&quot;🛠️&quot; data-emoji=&quot;🛠️&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt; CE DONT VOUS AUREZ BESOIN POUR RÉUSSIR&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise Technique (Stack Decathlon) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering &amp;amp; Architecture :&lt;/strong&gt; Très forte maîtrise de la conception de pipelines de données (ETL, orchestration) et des architectures Data Warehouse (ex: AWS Redshift).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bases de données :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise des bases de données relationnelles (PostgreSQL) et compréhension des bases NoSQL.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Développement &amp;amp; Qualité :&lt;/strong&gt; Maîtrise des langages de programmation data, des pratiques CI/CD (GIT, Jenkins), de la conteneurisation et des tests logiciels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sécurité &amp;amp; Data Privacy :&lt;/strong&gt; Solides connaissances en protection des données, chiffrage et conformité (RGPD).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils :&lt;/strong&gt; Compréhension globale des systèmes d&#39;information (ERP, HRIS, CRM) et idéalement une connaissance préalable des formats d&#39;intégration Workday (un vrai plus).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership et Savoir-être :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expérience avérée dans le lead technique de projets de migration de données complexes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capacité à piloter, fédérer des équipes et interagir avec des profils très variés (techniques, fonctionnels, internationaux).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esprit analytique poussé, culture du &quot;problem-solving&quot; et excellente gestion des priorités (gestion des risques et du temps).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Rigueur absolue (traitement de données critiques) et flexibilité dans un environnement mouvant.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Français courant&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anglais courant indispensable (contexte international).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;img class=&quot;an1&quot; src=&quot;https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/e/notoemoji/17.0/1f381/72.png&quot; alt=&quot;🎁&quot; data-emoji=&quot;🎁&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt; CE QUE NOUS OFFRONS&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Liberté de choix de l&#39;outil de travail (Mac, Windows).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Équipe projet en local et partage avec le réseau mondial (parcours international).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Montée en compétences et mentorat (diversité de projets, langages et technologies, certifications, events).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Formations internes et externes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actionnariat salarié.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primes mensuelles et trimestrielles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;NOTRE ENGAGEMENT EN FAVEUR DE L&#39;INCLUSION ET DE L&#39;ACCESSIBILITE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez Decathlon, nous reconnaissons l&#39;immense valeur qu&#39;apporte la diversité à nos équipes et nous nous efforçons continuellement de favoriser et de cultiver un lieu de travail inclusif et équitable : c&#39;est pourquoi l&#39;Inclusion est l&#39;un de nos Fondamentaux Humains. Nous encourageons les personnes de tous horizons et de toutes capacités à postuler, car nous sommes convaincu·es que la diversité des pensées, des cultures, des identités et des expériences vécues nous rend plus fort·es.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon s&#39;engage également à offrir un processus de sélection inclusif et accessible à tous les candidat·es. En cas de besoin d&#39;aménagement, tu peux en faire la demande via le formulaire de candidature, celle-ci sera confidentielle. Ces demandes n&#39;affectent pas le résultat du processus de recrutement&quot;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Dans le cadre de l’ouverture d’un poste en CDI, nous recrutons un.e &lt;strong&gt;AI engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, basé-e au choix à Lille ou Paris.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 CONTEXTE &amp;amp; ENJEUX STRATÉGIQUES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de Decathlon Digital, l&#39;équipe Finance Data engage une initiative majeure : transformer les métiers de la finance par l&#39;intégration de l&#39;IA Générative et Agentique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Face à la fragmentation des analyses exécutées par la fonction FP&amp;amp;A, notre ambition est de construire des solutions plus standardisées avec l’appui de l’IA. Il s&#39;agit d’implémenter des couches d&#39;intelligence centralisées et agnostiques des outils, capable d&#39;interagir avec l&#39;ensemble de notre infrastructure (Workday, Data Lake, EPM, ...) pour faire évoluer nos interfaces d&#39;une logique de consultation vers une logique d&#39;action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce cadre, nous développons des débriefs de performance financière générés par l’IA pour toutes les activités de l’entreprise. Il aide nos collaborateurs et managers à accéder instantanément à une information fiable et sur laquelle ils peuvent prendre des décisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Déjà déployé avec succès en France, Espagne, Italie et Belgique, ce projet est le premier d’une série à venir.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour mener ce projet, nous ne recherchons pas uniquement un.e développeur.se, nous avons besoin d&#39;un.e &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Builder&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; : un.e personne capable de traduire un besoin métier en solution technique, de l’implémenter, la qualifier, la déployer et la maintenir dans le temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🎯 VOTRE MISSION&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer confirmé(e)&lt;/strong&gt; pour participer activement à l&#39;industrialisation et au développement de nos solutions d’IA pour les contrôleurs de gestion. Votre objectif est clair : transformer les besoins métiers en fonctionnalités IA fiables, mesurables et robustes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour relever ce défi, vous évoluerez au &lt;strong&gt;sein d&#39;un collectif dédié&lt;/strong&gt;, en collaboration directe avec d&#39;autres AI Engineers et un Product Manager. Cette organisation de proximité vous permettra d&#39;assurer une synergie parfaite entre les enjeux produits, la roadmap et l&#39;implémentation technique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛠 VOS RESPONSABILITES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement Agentique &amp;amp; Fonctionnalités&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l&#39;extension des capacités de nos agents vers des actions d&#39;écriture (write actions) en implémentant notamment des protocoles de tool-calling (MCP - Model Context Protocol) et des communications inter-agents (A2A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;optimisation des coûts, de la latence et de l&#39;efficacité globale du système en lien avec les équipes Plateforme et Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualité, Évaluation &amp;amp; Observabilité (LLMOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir la couche de qualité de nos pipelines (Databricks / Vertex AI Search / Discovery Engine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le grounding (ancrage) des réponses et la vérification des citations pour garantir la traçabilité vers une source de vérité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place des pipelines d&#39;observabilité robustes pour l&#39;évaluation online et offline (OpenTelemetry, MLflow, Langfuse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coder des évaluateurs automatiques pour itérer sereinement et prévenir les régressions avant chaque mise en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer des garde-fous (guardrails) pour protéger le système et les utilisateurs contre les hallucinations et les erreurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurité, Cloisonnement &amp;amp; Déploiement International&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Isolation &amp;amp; Multi-tenancy : Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de filtrage par métadonnées (metadata filtering) en base vectorielle et de cloisonnement (des index et/ou des modèles) pour assurer une étanchéité parfaite des données entre les différentes sociétés fiscales, entités légales et géographies de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Multilingue : Contribuer à l&#39;architecture d&#39;internationalisation de nos solutions en adaptant les pipelines, l&#39;embedding et l&#39;inférence pour maintenir un haut niveau de performance et de pertinence sur une grande diversité de langues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produit &amp;amp; Impact Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à l&#39;analyse des intentions des utilisateurs pour mesurer l&#39;impact de nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire, avec l&#39;appui de la Product Manager, les enjeux métier en comportements de modèles et en métriques de succès.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 PROFIL RECHERCHE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un profil justifiant a minima d’une première expérience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Profil confirmé justifiant de plusieurs années d&#39;expérience professionnelle en entreprise (hors stages et alternances) en AI Engineering, ML Engineering ou Software Engineering orienté IA. Vous justifiez également d&#39;au moins une expérience concrète et réussie de mise en production d&#39;un système GenAI ou agentique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack Technique&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide maîtrise de Python, de l&#39;écosystème GCP / Vertex AI + Databricks, et des frameworks d&#39;orchestration (LangChain, LlamaIndex ou Google ADK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise LLM &amp;amp; Agentique &lt;/strong&gt;: Solide maîtrise des architectures RAG (recherche vectorielle, Vertex AI Vector Search, gestion avancée de métadonnées), mais surtout des concepts techniques agentiques : function/tool-calling, boucles de raisonnement (ReAct, etc.), orchestration de workflows multi-agents, structured output et gestion du contexte/mémoire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualité &amp;amp; Évaluation&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à diagnostiquer une réponse incorrecte (problème de modèle, de retrieval ou de données) et appétence pour l&#39;observabilité applicative (SQL / MLflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues &lt;/strong&gt;: Français courant obligatoire &amp;amp; anglais professionnel courant (environnement international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les plus :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance technique approfondie des protocoles A2A (Agent-to-Agent) et MCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compréhension technique des enjeux de sécurité (RBAC, ACLs, RGPD) appliqués aux LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des architectures microservices et conception d&#39;APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎁 CE QUE NOUS PROPOSONS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de développer un produit d&#39;IA agentique de pointe avec un impact direct sur le quotidien des collaborateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement technologique premium (Stack Google Cloud / Vertex AI / Databricks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de télétravail flexible (2 jours par semaine en remote, le reste dans nos bureaux).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture du delivery axée sur l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;intelligence collective et la montée en compétences (accompagnement par un Lead, certifications, formations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des avantages attractifs (primes mensuelles/trimestrielles, actionnariat salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Stage) Assistant Project Manager Hackathons &amp;amp; Innovation - F/H&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stage fin d&#39;études&lt;/strong&gt; (6 mois)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Début :&lt;/strong&gt; Janiver 2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lieu :&lt;/strong&gt; Paris 9e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📌Qui sommes-nous ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Chez &lt;strong&gt;Artefact Adopt AI&lt;/strong&gt;, nous propulsons &lt;strong&gt;l’innovation &lt;/strong&gt;à travers des &lt;strong&gt;événements&lt;/strong&gt; d’envergure : Ateliers d&#39;innovation participative, Programmes d&#39;intrapreneuriat, et notre format phare : des &lt;a href=&quot;https://adoptai.artefact.com/content/hackathons&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hackathons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Notre mission ? Connecter et faire collaborer un écosystème d&#39;acteurs clés — étudiants, experts Tech et métiers, décideurs, startups, chercheurs — autour des technologies actuelles et de demain :&lt;strong&gt; IA, Robotique, Quantique…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;En tant qu’Assistant Project Manager, tu co-pilotes ces programmes immersifs de A à Z pour faire émerger des prototypes et solutions, répondant à des problématiques réelles d’aujourd’hui et du futur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚀 Tes défis au quotidien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestion et suivi de projet &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu participes à la création et au suivi des supports de pilotage, ainsi qu’à la gestion des jalons clés de nos expériences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordination &lt;/strong&gt;: Tu assures une communication et une coordination fluides entre tous les acteurs du projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Animation digitale&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu pilotes le recrutement des participants, le ciblage des experts (mentors, jurys) et l&#39;animation de nos plateformes en ligne.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Orchestration J-J&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu gères la logistique des temps forts et participes activement à la facilitation, animation et à la coordination générale le Jour-J.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production de Livrables&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu conçois les supports de communication (slides, briefs, kits) et structures les synthèses post-événements pour valoriser nos réalisations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤖 Ta mission bonus : AI Playground&lt;/strong&gt;. Tu testes et intègres des solutions IA/tech pour booster nos propres process et enrichir l&#39;expérience des participants.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👤 Ton profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Parcours :&lt;/strong&gt; Fin d&#39;études (Master 2) en École de commerce, Ingénieur, Université, IEP, Master Innovation, Management, Gestion de Projet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu as une vraie rigueur d&#39;organisation, excellent relationnel, autonomie et force de proposition. Tu as une appétence forte pour l&#39;innovation, l&#39;écosystème Tech/IA, la gestion d&#39;événements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outils&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu sais opérer Canva, des outils visuels (Klaxoon/Mural), Lemlist et tu joues souvent avec des outils d&#39;IA Générative (ChatGPT, Claude, Gemini etc.).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues&lt;/strong&gt; : Français et Anglais courants (contexte international).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎁 Ce que nous t&#39;offrons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Immersion&lt;/strong&gt; : Le meilleur spot pour comprendre concrètement les enjeux et usages de l&#39;IA, la Tech et l’innovation de rupture aujourd&#39;hui.Réseau unique : Tu seras en contact direct des acteurs clé étatiques, de la tech, des startups, des écoles et de l&#39;industrie.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un cadre de travail stimulant&lt;/strong&gt; au sein d&#39;une équipe à taille humaine, dynamique, bienveillante et responsabilisante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Gratification compétitive, tickets resto, télétravail flexible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comment postuler ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Envoie-nous ton &lt;strong&gt;CV&lt;/strong&gt; accompagné d’un &lt;strong&gt;support de motivation original &lt;/strong&gt;(libre cours à ta créativité – points bonus pour une utilisation appropriée de solutions IA !).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Chez Artefact, nous recrutons nos collaborateurs uniquement en fonction de nos besoins et des qualités propres de chaque candidat. Nous assurons le développement de leurs compétences professionnelles et de leurs responsabilités sans discrimination d’aucune sorte. Le groupe s&#39;engage à reconnaître et promouvoir tous les talents, quels que soient leurs croyances, âge, handicap, parentalité, origine ethnique, nationalité, identité de genre, orientation sexuelle, appartenance à une organisation politique, religieuse, syndicale ou à une minorité, ou toute autre caractéristique qui pourrait faire l&#39;objet d&#39;une discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Auterion builds a cutting-edge operating system for autonomous robotic systems that empower a diverse range of platforms to perform surveillance, reconnaissance, inspection, mapping and logistics tasks. Our industry-leading software drives the adoption of robotic fleets and is recognized by the U.S. government as the future standard for its drone programs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Embedded Performance Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; who is passionate about getting the most out of embedded systems — from low-level Linux tuning and hardware integration to high-performance video and data pipelines. This role is ideal for someone who enjoys working close to hardware, moving across the stack, and solving the kinds of problems where milliseconds, bandwidth, startup time, and system efficiency matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work across the AuterionOS ecosystem on topics such as:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Linux performance and system tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low-latency video streaming and media pipelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;C/C++, Python, and Bash-based platform development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hardware integration, system profiling, and end-to-end optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with experienced and driven engineers across Auterion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work within the Apps &amp;amp; Simulation team and collaborate with other development teams to build high-performance products for autonomous systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, optimize, and maintain performance-critical components within AuterionOS, Auterion’s custom embedded Linux distribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve end-to-end system behavior across compute, networking, video, and hardware interfaces, with a strong focus on latency, throughput, reliability, and resource efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze and optimize demanding workloads such as real-time telemetry, video streaming, media processing, and communication between distributed system components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate system bottlenecks across the full stack, from kernel and OS behavior to application-level code and tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering and product teams to understand both internal and customer use cases, and translate them into robust technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Propose and implement new platform capabilities with a strong emphasis on measurable performance gains in real-world deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in daily stand-ups, release planning, and prioritization discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc. or M.Sc. in Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience writing object-oriented C++ and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with embedded Linux systems, including cross-compilation, debugging, profiling, and performance tuning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on background in diagnosing and optimizing real-world system behavior, including CPU, memory, I/O, networking, boot time, and application latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing low-latency video or data-streaming pipelines, ideally on embedded platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of software systems that span embedded devices, higher-level applications, and fully integrated products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering fundamentals, including system design, implementation, debugging, and testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with video codecs, GStreamer, RTP/RTSP, or hardware-accelerated media pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Debian/Ubuntu-based systems, Bash scripting, and systemd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and docker-compose in complex development and deployment environments, as well as qemu.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging and performance analysis skills at both system and application level, combined with a proactive and self-directed working style.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in ROS2/DDS-style middleware and experienced with networking across multiple OSI layers, including REST APIs and performance-sensitive communication paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with system integration and interfacing sensors or peripherals, especially via USB and Ethernet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an agile engineering environment with stand-ups, sprint planning, and shared ownership across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus: Experience with build systems such as CMake, including improving build performance in large-scale software projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bieten wir dir:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work-life-balance&lt;/strong&gt;: Für uns steht Teamarbeit und der persönliche Austausch im Büro im Vordergrund. Wir ermöglichen dir aber auch einen regelmäßigen Homeoffice-Tag fürmehr Flexibilität. Außerdem kannst du Überstunden ausgleichen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vacation mode on&lt;/strong&gt;: Du erhältst 26 Urlaubstage und erhältst noch zusätzlich 4 Kompensationstage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellbeing first: &lt;/strong&gt;Gesundheitsleistungen sowie Mental Health Awareness Days stellendeine Gesundheit in den Mittelpunkt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice makes perfect&lt;/strong&gt;: Entfalte dich mit unseren vielfältigen Weiterbildungen undnutze unsere internen Karriereprogramme für deine Entwicklung im WPP-Netzwerk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;More than just a job&lt;/strong&gt;: Dich erwarten unvergessliche Events, Mitarbeitendenrabatte und weitere Highlights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be yourself&lt;/strong&gt;: Bei uns ist jede:r herzlich willkommen - Vielfalt und Chancengleichheit liegen uns am Herzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das bewegst du:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager Client (m/w/d)&lt;/strong&gt; entwickelst du gemeinsam mit deinem Team wirkungsvolle Marken-, Media- und Kommunikationsstrategien. Du steuerst Kundenprojekte und Kampagnen über alle relevanten Offline-Mediakanäle hinweg, behältst Budgets und Marktbewegungen im Blick und bist zentrale Ansprechperson für Kunden sowie interne Teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marken- &amp;amp; Kommunikationsstrategie:&lt;/strong&gt; Entwicklung von Markenstrategien und Ableitung passender Media- und Kommunikationsstrategien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kampagnensteuerung &amp;amp; Digitalintegration:&lt;/strong&gt; Planung, Umsetzung, Analyse und Optimierung von Kampagnen über alle Offline-Mediakanäle hinweg sowie ganzheitliche Integration digitaler Kanäle in die Mediaaktivierungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Budgetverantwortung:&lt;/strong&gt; Zentrale Ansprechperson für alle mediarelevanten Kundenfragen sowie Verwaltung und Forecasting der Kundenbudgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Projekt- &amp;amp; Prozessmanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Koordination aller Kundenprojekte und klare Priorisierung der Aufgaben im Team in enger Abstimmung mit dem Director; außerdem Unterstützung des Line-Managers und Zusammenarbeit mit Spezialunits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teamführung &amp;amp; Aktivierungskoordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Selbstständige Steuerung deiner Aufgaben sowie fachliche Begleitung und Ausbildung von Junior-Kolleg:innen. Du koordinierst und briefst interne Aktivierungsabteilungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Markt- &amp;amp; Partnermanagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Verantwortung für das Setup und Handling externer Dienstleistungen und Marktteilnehmender, Beobachtung des Wettbewerbs sowie Identifikation von Wachstumsmöglichkeiten und Unterstützung interner Projekte.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Das zeichnet dich aus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mediaerfahrung:&lt;/strong&gt; Berufserfahrung in der Mediaberatung und/oder Mediaplanung, idealerweise in einer Mediaagentur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategisches Media-Know-how:&lt;/strong&gt; Verständnis für Marken-, Media- und Kommunikationsstrategien sowie Erfahrung in der Planung und Steuerung von Kampagnen über verschiedene Medienkanäle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kundenberatung &amp;amp; Kommunikation:&lt;/strong&gt; Souveränes, kommunikatives Auftreten und die Fähigkeit, komplexe Zusammenhänge zielgruppengerecht und verständlich zu vermitteln.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organisation &amp;amp; Qualität:&lt;/strong&gt; Eine strukturierte, sorgfältige und qualitative Arbeitsweise sowie Freude daran, mehrere Projekte und Aufgaben zu koordinieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verantwortung &amp;amp; Teamgeist:&lt;/strong&gt; Selbstständige Arbeitsweise, Verantwortungsbewusstsein und Freude an der Zusammenarbeit sowie daran, Junior-Kolleg:innen zu unterstützen und weiterzuentwickeln.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprachkenntnisse:&lt;/strong&gt; Verhandlungssichere Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Darüber hinaus bist du: &lt;strong&gt;#client-partner #media-strategist #team-player&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du diesen Job spannend findest, dann ermutigen wir dich ausdrücklich zur Bewerbung, auch wenn du nicht jede oben gelistete Qualifikation aufweisen kannst.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeiten bei WPP Media:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als WPP Media gestalten wir die Zukunft der Medien und investieren dabei konsequent in unsere Mitarbeiter:innen. Jede:r Kolleg:in genießt die Vorteile des globalen Netzwerks von WPP Media und WPP, um sich weiterzuentwickeln&amp;nbsp;und an der Spitze von Marketing und Werbung zu lernen. Vielfalt und Zusammenhalt leben wir durch zahlreiche Employee Resource Groups und regelmäßige interne Events - zum Austausch, zur Inspiration und zum gemeinsamen Feiern unserer Erfolge.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;WPP Media ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit fördert. Wir berücksichtigen alle Bewerber:innen für alle Positionen ohne Diskriminierung. Unser Ziel ist eine Kultur des Respekts und der Zugehörigkeit, in der jede:r die gleichen Möglichkeiten hat, sich einzubringen und beruflich zu wachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bitte lies unsere &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Datenschutzerklärung&lt;/a&gt; für Deutschland, Österreich und die Schweiz, um weitere Informationen darüber zu erhalten, wie wir die von dir bereitgestellten Daten verarbeiten. #LI-Promoted 13731&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ping Identity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Ping Identity, we believe in making digital experiences both secure and seamless for all users, without compromise. We call this digital freedom. And it&#39;s not just something we provide our customers. It&#39;s something that inspires our company. People don&#39;t come here to join a culture that&#39;s built on digital freedom. They come to cultivate it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our intelligent, cloud identity platform lets people shop, work, bank, and interact wherever and however they want. Without friction. Without fear.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While protecting digital identities is at the core of our technology, protecting individual identities is at the core of our culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pingidentity.com/en/company/championing-every-identity.html&quot;&gt;We champion every identity.&lt;/a&gt; One of our core values, Respect Individuality, reminds us to celebrate differences so you are empowered to bring your authentic self to work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re headquartered in Denver, Colorado and we have offices and employees around the globe. We serve the largest, most demanding enterprises worldwide, including more than half of the Fortune 100. At Ping Identity, we&#39;re changing the way people and businesses think about cybersecurity, digital experiences, and identity and access management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Sales Director will be tasked with influencing and developing an energized, competitive, high impact sales team that is characterized by its ability to create differentiated value for our customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a seasoned leader from within the SaaS enterprise marketplace, with proven software solution selling combined with success in a fast growth business. This leader will be a model to drive the team in building extraordinary customer relationships and experiences, leveraging a strong teamwork approach, and cross matrix collaboration across all Ping functions. This role will demonstrate a depth of understanding when working alongside a partner community and posess a well-established customer and partner network in the Nordics &amp;amp; Eastern Europe regions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In order to acquire, develop and retain customer relationships and create a winning Ping business, this leader will be able to create and maintain a high-performance culture, that is grounded in data, transparency, accountability, and agility. The ideal candidate’s mindset should be customer-focused, people-oriented, open, passionate, and authentic.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates, implements, measures and reviews a strategic or operational plan that drives achievement of business goals aligned to overall Ping strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses mechanisms such as territory planning, account plans, opportunity inspection, pipeline management, account reviews, forecast calls, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advises and coaches the sales team around how to position and articulate Ping Identity’s value proposition at enterprise customers, thus increasing the average deal size&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifies and pursues opportunities to expand business activities within areas of responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverages GSIs &amp;amp; other partners to help source, develop and progress business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plans and controls the expense associated with the area of responsibility even if not responsible for overall cost center&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishes working relationships with external parties which supports the achievement of business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is conversant with Ping Identity’s systems and procedures and ensures effective use of and conformance to standard business practices and tools (i.e. SFDC – SalesForce.com)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates Ping Identity’s vision and aligns team and personal goals to achieve business results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides direction and guidance, mentoring and development of the field team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lives teamwork and promotes cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruits, builds and develops the team to deliver business results; Identifies, develops and promotes high potential employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommends and/or approves people-related decisions – hiring, promotions, merit increases, rewards &amp;amp; recognition, training initiatives, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives performance review and development planning process with annual and quarterly review meetings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has established multi-vertical C level contacts in large enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has an established partner/SI network and is used to working with partners on projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds relationships with customers (internal or external) as necessary providing customer escalation management as necessary for problem resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides support for customer relationship management as necessary and drives initiatives which result in improvement in customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives initiatives which result in improvement in customer satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills &amp;amp; Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of successfully leading sales teams focused on the Nordics &amp;amp; Eastern Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in enterprise software, SaaS, managed services and strategic account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Results-oriented with multiple years meeting or exceeding quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility to travel to across the regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transitioned a team through on-prem to SaaS solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept working in a fast-growing global organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good interpersonal skills to align and foster positive working relationships across the organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility to work in the Netherlands or Norway&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Ping:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in and facilitate a flexible, collaborative work environment. We’re growing quickly, but remain true to the innovative, can-do startup values that got us here. Most importantly, we keep hiring talented, smart, fun, and genuinely nice people because that’s who we want to succeed with every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here are just a few of the things that make Ping special:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company culture that empowers you to do your best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups that create a sense of belonging for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company and team bonding events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits and perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global volunteering and community initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
