&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Style: Immerse yourself in a world of beautifully crafted, high-quality products, and enjoy a 40% discount on&amp;nbsp;Suitsupply&amp;nbsp;products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
