&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Allowances:&lt;/strong&gt; 50% commuting expense reimbursement, €200 Home Working Allowance, and €150 Learning Fund&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; 25 days holiday + bank holidays + RTT days, Moments That Matter Leave, Compassionate Leave, two paid Volunteering Days, Flexible Working, and Career Break eligibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come as you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want to meet people from all walks of life. The more inclusive we are, the better our work will be, and we recognise talent on merit and potential. If you’re excited about the role but don’t tick every box, we’d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. Our Applicant Data Protection Policy is&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice/&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Director of Platform Operations&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Bristol or London (Including hybrid)&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;£141,000 - £170,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&lt;/strong&gt; VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is based in either Bristol or London and requires an existing right to work in the UK.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a global leadership role accountable for how clients experience Kaluza day to day. Reporting to the VP Product &amp;amp; Tech Operations, you&#39;ll run three global functions and hold global accountability for client support and SLA performance across every client and region:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Support (incl. Incident &amp;amp; Problem Management)&lt;/strong&gt; - our client-facing service desk, owning triage and first-contact resolution, incident response and the client/product-team relationship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Platform Performance Assurance (KPPA)&lt;/strong&gt; - our neutral source of truth on platform performance, monitoring contractual SLAs and journey health per client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Product Specialists (KPS)&lt;/strong&gt; - Global retail-energy experts fixing broken journeys and operational gaps outside core platform coverage - driving an automation-by-default approach across all client brands&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead the practice / craft globally, set the strategy and standard for how each operates, and be the steady, credible presence clients and colleagues rely on - from a board-level service review to a live Sev1. Specifically, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Client Support, Incident &amp;amp; Problem Management&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own incident response end to end - severity, Major Incident command, root cause analysis, client communication and resolution within contractual SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage incoming support requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own Problem Management, driving root-cause remediation and reducing the rate and duration of incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep support frictionless - shielding Product &amp;amp; Engineering from noise while closing the loop with clients, and making sure postmortems land as real systemic change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;SLA &amp;amp; Performance Assurance (KPPA)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own global monitoring of contractual SLAs, KPIs and performance metrics as the agreed source of truth per client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the assurance loop - prevent, diagnose, treat - and coordinate performance reporting into Client Service Reviews and senior leadership, raising events when performance deviates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the line on data integrity (Datadog, Jira, Databricks) and embed Kaluza&#39;s Global Standard SLAs consistently across regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the commercial relationship, budget and roadmap with our key Operational tooling vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight and inputs on commercial conversations related to client reporting of performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operational Resolution &amp;amp; Product Specialists (KPS)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the processes that fix broken journeys and coverage gaps across all of our client brands, including new clients as we grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance scheduled and ad-hoc work while keeping a safe, well-governed operational estate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed recurring manual interventions back to Product &amp;amp; Tech as signals for systemic fixes, and drive down manual effort through automation and AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Across all three, you&#39;ll be genuinely AI-native - pushing AI into support, assurance and operations so each function does more with less - and you&#39;ll operate fluently at every altitude, staying neutral, evidence-led and a steady presence under pressure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An accomplished operations and support leader with a strong track record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder, not an executor - you define what good looks like, take full accountability, and go looking for what you need rather than waiting for a brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely AI-native - AI feels like leverage, and you actively push it into support, assurance and operational delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Steady in ambiguity - nimble, sharp and decisive in a live incident, and a steady presence clients and colleagues rely on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced leading client support, service operations or service management at scale, ideally across multiple regions and enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in incident and problem management (severity and Major Incident command, postmortem culture, root-cause remediation) and in managing against contractual SLAs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to understand, or quickly master, retail-energy operations and the operational reality of running processes around a platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will set you apart&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with the data and tooling of assurance - SLAs, KPIs, observability (Datadog), Jira Service Management, and BI/warehouse tooling (Databricks/BigQuery) - enough to challenge the numbers, not just receive them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A credible partner to senior leadership and C-level clients, especially in a tense service review or live incident.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong people leader and coach across multiple disciplines, able to build a self-solving, high-performing culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Committed to radical candour and customer centricity, with experience scaling a high-growth SaaS business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Bank Holidays - Giving you an additional 8 days which you can choose to take whenever you like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including up to 26 weeks full pay for primary caregivers and 4 weeks full pay for secondary caregivers when welcoming a new addition to your family.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life - our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about working in &lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our &lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt;careers page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You can also find our Applicant Data Protection Policy &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/applicant-data-protection-notice&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion is looking for a talented and passionate Meta Designer to join our London studio, helping shape the combat experience for our first-person shooter mobile title. This role focuses on designing and managing metagame, live, and progression features to create a satisfying and sustainable mobile experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own key metagame features from conception through live, coordinating with design, art, UX, engineering, and product management throughout the whole process. As a live game you will need to design features with iteration and extensibility in mind and analyze live data to expand and improve your features over time. We are looking for someone who brings both craft knowledge, an excitement to try new things, and a genuine love of action games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role you will work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of designing, prototyping, and implementing progression, economy, and engagement features that align with the creative vision of the game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define, analyze, and take action on analytics, feature data, and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with live and product management teams to define goals and implement solutions to boost engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with art, animation, audio, design and engineering teams to build content and solve problems in a multi-disciplinary environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and balance in-game economies across many different metagame features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX and engineering to ensure features are implemented in ways that meet the engagement goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse player data, feedback, and behaviours to identify and fix metagame issues and retention barriers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work concurrently on multiple features at varying stages of development, managing priorities effectively as content pipelines run in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and communicate metagame feature concepts clearly to ensure alignment across all development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in Metagame / Progression / Engagement Design or an equivalent role in the video game industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one shipped title in a design role for a live service title&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing progression, economy, or engagement features for live gamesKnowledge and experience analyzing KPIs and player behaviour data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Unreal game engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse gameplay data and player feedback to inform and balance design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to work effectively across cross-disciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage multiple designs in a fast-paced development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about action games with a deep understanding of what makes enemy designs engaging and memorable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mobile games with an understanding of mobile player behaviour and market leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with visual scripting or rapid prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avid gamer with a genuine enthusiasm for crafting engaging progression and metagame features and motivating players over a long period of time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;#LI-NH3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about_the_role_0&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Product Manager with strong experience in Field Service Management (FSM), Facility Management, or operational workflow-driven SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Manager at Joblogic, you will play a key role in shaping the future of our platform by deeply understanding how service contractors operate and translating complex operational workflows into intuitive product solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with engineering, UX, customer-facing teams, and customers themselves to identify real-world operational challenges and build solutions that simplify the daily work of engineers, planners, helpdesk teams, and operations managers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys solving real operational problems, working closely with users, and building workflow-driven B2B SaaS products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_your_main_focus_will_be_1&quot;&gt;What your main focus will be&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead discovery with customers across&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;field service and facilities management operations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand and map operational workflows including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reactive maintenance jobs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planned Preventative Maintenance (PPM)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scheduling and dispatch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field engineer mobile workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quote → job → invoicing journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;You will be expected to:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex operational problems into clear product requirements and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX designers to create intuitive workflows and product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and prioritise roadmap initiatives aligned with product strategy and customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineering teams to ensure solutions are practical, scalable, and deliver real operational impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate product ideas through customer interviews, field research, and prototype testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor product adoption, workflow performance, and user behaviour to continuously improve features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal teams including Sales, Customer Success, and Support to ensure successful feature adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;what_you_bring_2&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a Product Manager within B2B SaaS environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Field Service Management, Facilities Management, or operational workflow-based software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience translating real-world operational processes into clear product logic and requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong discovery skills and ability to conduct customer interviews and uncover real problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with UX designers and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to manage stakeholders and communicate product strategy clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured thinking and ability to break down complex workflows into scalable product solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in fast-moving product environments with multiple priorities and cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;nice_to_have_points_3&quot;&gt;Nice-to-have points&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;CAFM / FSM / CMMS software platforms&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building products with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;scheduling engines or optimisation logic&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;mobile-first workflows for frontline users&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;API-driven platforms and system integrations&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;data-driven operational analytics and reporting systems&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;remuneration_package_and_benefits_4&quot;&gt;Remuneration package and benefits&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work within a global SaaS product company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career progression opportunities as Joblogic continues to scale internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative, product-focused and innovative working environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular company events and team activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development through Joblogic Academy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to internal training and product leadership mentoring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Joblogic Story&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1998,&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic&lt;/strong&gt; is the UK’s #1 &lt;strong&gt;Field Service Management&lt;/strong&gt; (FSM) software platform. We are a global business with offices in the &lt;strong&gt;UK&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Pakistan&lt;/strong&gt;, and &lt;strong&gt;Vietnam&lt;/strong&gt;. Since our management buy-out in 2013, we have grown from &lt;strong&gt;~£500K &lt;/strong&gt;ARR to &lt;strong&gt;~£35M+ &lt;/strong&gt;ARR and expanded our team from 11 to 500+ people.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recently, we secured a strategic growth investment from &lt;strong&gt;Vista Equity Partners &lt;/strong&gt;— a global technology investor specialising in enterprise software. This investment includes over &lt;strong&gt;£100&lt;/strong&gt; million in new primary capital and will fuel our next phase of growth by accelerating our &lt;strong&gt;AI-first roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, expanding our platform into CAFM (Computer-Aided Facilities Management) capabilities, and supporting our expansion across Europe and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With &lt;strong&gt;Vista’s &lt;/strong&gt;backing, we’re transforming from a successful UK business into a global scaling SaaS rocket ship, and we’d love for you to join us on our journey to &lt;strong&gt;£100M &lt;/strong&gt;ARR across international markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Joblogic &lt;/strong&gt;provides software to service contractors who install and maintain the built environment. Our platform helps businesses streamline operations, improve profitability, ensure compliance, and achieve rapid growth. With over &lt;strong&gt;100,000&lt;/strong&gt; users across industries including HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management, and building fabric maintenance, we are entering a new era of intelligent automation, predictive maintenance, and data-driven decision-making for service firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THIS IS A REAL STEP INTO CLOSING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You booked the meeting. Someone else closed it. Not here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your number. Your accounts. Your calls. Your deals. Start to finish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You already know this feeling&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You worked the account for weeks. You found the pain, you got the right person on the phone, you booked the meeting. Then you handed it over and watched someone else take it to signature and pick up the commission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is the seat where you keep it.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The role, in plain English&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own a UK and Ireland mid-market patch and carry a monthly new-business ARR target. You find every opportunity yourself, and you close it yourself. There is no SDR underneath you and nobody filling your diary. We give you the data, the tools, the coaching and a few live opportunities to get you moving. Everything after that is yours to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If that reads as a warning, this is not your role. If it reads as an opportunity, keep going.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll actually be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Picking your target accounts and going after them properly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cold calling. Every week. It does not stop being part of the job when you start closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Running discovery that reaches business impact, not a feature checklist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demoing Joblogic to operations directors, finance and business owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Multi-threading, building the commercial case, negotiating and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keeping HubSpot honest and forecasting a number you are happy to be held to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we’ll give you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A structured 90-day ramp &lt;/strong&gt;into discovery, demonstrations, commercials and closing. You will never be guessing what good looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full coaching as standard: &lt;/strong&gt;MEDDPICC is our qualification standard and we will teach it to you, alongside discovery, demo and negotiation training, weekly call reviews and deal clinics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Live opportunities at the start &lt;/strong&gt;to get you selling while you build your own engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The data, tooling and tech stack &lt;/strong&gt;to prospect properly, so your time goes on selling rather than list building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A real career, &lt;/strong&gt;with a fast-growing, PE-backed software business scaling to £100M ARR. This is the first seat of a career here, not the last&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;You’ll love this if&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 12-36 months as an SDR or BDR and you have smashed your number, and you can prove it with real figures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A cold call that turns into a deal is still the best part of your week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are competitive with yourself before you are competitive with anyone else&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want feedback, not comfort, and you act on it fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to be judged on ARR, not on dials and diary entries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are curious about how businesses actually make money, not just about hitting activity targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;table width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width=&quot;624&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DON’T APPLY IF&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You want your pipeline handed to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You think prospecting stops the day you start closing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your best answer to “how did you perform?” is “the team hit target”.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Joblogic in thirty seconds&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the UK’s #1 Field Service Management software platform. Founded in 1998, ~£35M ARR, 500+ people and over 100,000 users across HVAC, plumbing, electrical maintenance, facilities management and building fabric maintenance. We are backed by Vista Equity Partners with over £100 million of new capital behind us, and we are scaling to £100M ARR with an AI-first product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Put simply: the market is huge, the product wins, and the ceiling on this team has just been lifted. We need people who want to run at that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How to apply&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Send us your CV, and tell us in a few lines about the best opportunity you have ever self-sourced (In the Cover Letter). How you found it, how you got in, what happened next. We are far more interested in that than in how your CV is formatted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring energy. This team runs on it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Company Software Consulting LLC (“Zone”) is the ERP-native AI platform for financial operations, purpose-built for organizations running on Oracle NetSuite. We are redefining how finance teams operate by delivering an AI-powered system that automates, connects, and scales financial workflows directly within the ERP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the AI operating system for finance teams in NetSuite, Zone enables more than 4,500 customers worldwide to run smarter, faster, and with greater accuracy. Our platform spans the full financial lifecycle, including Quote-to-Cash, Procure-to-Pay, Treasury, Payroll Management, and Record-to-Report, eliminating manual processes and unlocking real-time financial intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By embedding intelligence directly into NetSuite, Zone helps finance teams move beyond reactive work to proactive, strategic impact. Learn more at&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.zoneandco.com&quot;&gt; www.zoneandco.com&lt;/a&gt; or follow us on LinkedIn:&lt;a href=&quot;http://linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&quot;&gt; linkedin.com/company/zoneandco&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co. is seeking a Director of Procure-to-Pay Product Suite to define, build, and scale our flagship platform. As the strategic leader of this product area, you will set the vision, drive innovation, and lead a high-performing team to deliver transformative solutions for global businesses. This is a unique opportunity for a product executive with a proven track record or exceptional potential to shape the future of enterprise financial operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is changing what technology can do. We want someone who knows the problem space to see where it is heading, and who builds with AI to get there first.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and communicate a bold, actionable product vision and strategy for the Procure-to-Pay suite, aligned with Zone &amp;amp; Co.’s overall business goals and market opportunities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and empower a high-performing team of product managers, fostering a culture of innovation, accountability, and customer focus.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and scale the product roadmap, ensuring seamless integration of procurement and payment workflows that drive measurable value for customers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer feedback, market trends, and competitive insights into data-driven product decisions and prioritization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion design excellence by delivering intuitive, user-centric solutions that elevate the customer experience and differentiate our offerings.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with engineering, sales, marketing, and executive leadership to align vision and execution, from ideation to launch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a visible product leader—representing the Procure to Pay suite in customer conversations, internal leadership forums, and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;job-requirements-title&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Need:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;x12ofw9d&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Business, Finance, Accounting, Computer Science, Product Management, or a related field; an advanced degree is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in product management, with deep expertise in Accounts Payable (AP) automation and Procure-to-Pay (P2P) solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of end-to-end AP workflows, including the day-to-day needs of AP teams and the strategic priorities of CFOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building AI-powered products and successfully bringing them to market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ownership and initiative, with the ability to drive outcomes end to end, act proactively, and identify and address challenges early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, evolving environment, adapt quickly, and adjust priorities based on customer feedback, data, and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial judgment, with the ability to balance customer needs, business objectives, and market opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading and developing product teams, with excellent communication skills and the ability to collaborate effectively with peers and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this position is £100,000 – £108,000 GBP + bonus + equity. Actual compensation will be determined based on factors including, but not limited to, the candidate’s skills, qualifications, experience, and education, as well as market and business considerations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zone, we provide the platform; you provide the grit. We operate as a high-velocity, fully remote, global team where autonomy isn&#39;t just a perk, it’s the standard. We’re looking for self-driven professionals eager to navigate the complexities of a unique SaaS environment and take full command of their professional evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We ditch micro-management for high-trust flexibility, ensuring you have the space to innovate and scale. Our benefits are built to fuel this lifestyle, supporting your life beyond the screen so you can focus on making a global impact. Explore our offerings at &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&quot;&gt;https://www.zoneandco.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Our Global Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zone &amp;amp; Co is an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to building a diverse, equitable, and inclusive workplace. We thrive on unique perspectives and strongly encourage candidates of all backgrounds to apply. Here, your identity is valued, and your talent is the only limit to your growth. All qualified applicants will receive consideration regardless of race, color, religion, sex, orientation, age, disability, or any other protected factor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Terms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United States&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Employment with Zone is &lt;strong&gt;“At-Will”&lt;/strong&gt;, meaning either party may terminate the relationship at any time, with or without cause or notice, in accordance with applicable law. This job description does not constitute an employment contract or guarantee of continued employment. Duties and responsibilities may evolve as the company grows and may change at any time with or without notice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-US Jurisdictions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is offered as a Fixed-Term or Permanent Contract based on your country of residence.&amp;nbsp; Employment is subject to a written contract which outlines specific notice periods, probationary terms, and statutory entitlements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoneandco.com/legal/privacy&quot;&gt;Privacy Statement&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://21166970.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/21166970/Website%20Downloads/Legal/Applicant%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn&#39;t work together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we&#39;ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We&#39;re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Square, we’re re-imagining how small and midsize businesses grow. As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Sales Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; on our Outbound Team, you’ll bring Square’s ecosystem to new sellers across diverse industries by building, shaping, and closing your own pipeline. You’ll run sophisticated, multi-product deals from the first touch to final close — blending hunter instincts, consultative depth, and strategic execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re an experienced closer who thrives in outbound environments, loves solving meaningful business challenges, and consistently delivers against ambitious targets — this is your role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the full outbound sales cycle&lt;/strong&gt; — from prospecting to negotiation to close — with SMB and mid-market merchants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and manage a high-quality pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; through cold outreach, social selling, targeted campaigns, and creative outbound strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Develop multi-product solutions&lt;/strong&gt; across Square’s ecosystem and tailor them to each merchant’s unique needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Business Development&lt;/strong&gt; on lead flow while independently driving net-new logo acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conduct high-impact discovery, demos, and negotiations&lt;/strong&gt; with decisiveness across multi-stakeholder deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as a consultant and trusted advisor&lt;/strong&gt; — seamlessly flexing across BDR, AE, and AM responsibilities when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally&lt;/strong&gt; with Product, Marketing, Implementation, and Operations to deliver cohesive solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain disciplined pipeline management&lt;/strong&gt; and forecasting accuracy in Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consistently hit and exceed revenue goals&lt;/strong&gt; — monthly and quarterly.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6+ years of full-cycle B2B sales experience&lt;/strong&gt; with consistent quota achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven success in outbound prospecting&lt;/strong&gt; and net-new business creation (SaaS or fintech preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-threaded deals&lt;/strong&gt; with longer sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to build pipeline from scratch&lt;/strong&gt; using targeted, strategic outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and negotiation skills&lt;/strong&gt; across phone, video, and written channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong consultative selling skills&lt;/strong&gt; — diagnose business challenges and map tailored solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A hunter’s mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — resilient, creative, and driven to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ability to work independently&lt;/strong&gt; while contributing to a team-first environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advanced proficiency with Salesforce&lt;/strong&gt; and modern sales tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BA/BS degree or equivalent experience.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re working to build a more inclusive economy where our customers have equal access to opportunity, and we strive to live by these same values in building our workplace. Block is a proud equal opportunity employer. We work hard to evaluate all employees and job applicants consistently, based solely on the core competencies required of the role at hand, and without regard to any legally protected class. We believe in being fair, and are committed to an inclusive interview experience, including providing reasonable accommodations to disabled applicants throughout the recruitment process. We encourage applicants to share any needed accommodations with their recruiter, who will treat these requests as confidentially as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Want to learn more about what we&#39;re doing to build an inclusive workplace? Check out our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/news/inclusion&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Inclusion &amp;amp; Diversity page&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Since we opened our doors in 2009, the world of commerce has evolved immensely, and so has Square. After enabling anyone to take payments and never miss a sale, we saw sellers stymied by disparate, outmoded products and tools that wouldn’t work together.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;So we expanded into software and started building integrated, omnichannel solutions – to help sellers sell online, manage inventory, offer buy now, pay later functionality, book appointments, engage loyal buyers, and hire and pay staff. Across it all, we’ve embedded financial services tools at the point of sale, so merchants can access a business loan and manage their cash flow in one place. Afterpay furthers our goal to provide omnichannel tools that unlock meaningful value and growth, enabling sellers to capture the next generation shopper, increase order sizes, and compete at a larger scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, we are a partner to sellers of all sizes – large, enterprise-scale businesses with complex operations, sellers just starting, as well as merchants who began selling with Square and have grown larger over time. As our sellers grow, so do our solutions. There is a massive opportunity in front of us. We’re building a significant, meaningful, and lasting business, and we are helping sellers worldwide do the same.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not every seller comes to Square directly. A growing number reach us through resellers who sell Square on our behalf, and through independent contractors who represent Square in their own communities. Together these two motions make up our channel sales function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Marketing Manager, Channel Sales, you will own marketing for both motions worldwide. You will be the primary marketing point of contact for the global channel sales team, turning what they need into programmes that scale. Most of your time will go into building scalable solutions that equip every reseller and contractor to sell Square well. The rest will be spent working shoulder to shoulder with our highest-performing resellers on activity that grows both their business and ours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner closely with channel sales leadership, events, content and regional marketing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the marketing point of contact for the global channel sales team, triaging incoming requests, prioritising them and shaping them into a coherent programme of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run a scaled co-marketing hub that gives resellers and independent contractors the campaigns, content and guidance they need to sell Square in their own markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with our top-performing resellers on demand generation campaigns that grow and convert their pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip both motions to sell effectively, including through content and events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with our independent contractor and reseller network to extend Square&#39;s brand presence and build awareness / credibility in the communities they serve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review incentive programmes that reward the strongest-performing resellers and contractors, partnering with the cross-functional teams who deliver different components of the programme to ensure and report back on success against objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define how co-marketing funds work for this channel, setting out how funds are allocated, spent and measured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with sales to define an effective recruitment programme for resellers and independent contractors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a valued community that our resellers and independent contractors are proud to be a part of.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure and report on programme performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of relevant marketing experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience marketing through a channel, reseller, distributor or independent sales model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong background in B2B marketing, ideally within technology companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building enablement and co-marketing programmes that partners adopt and use at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to own programmes end to end, from design through to execution and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing incentive or reward programmes in partnership with a sales team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across international markets and with globally distributed teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder, communication and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
