&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About AlphaSense:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is the AI platform redefining market intelligence and workflow orchestration, trusted by thousands of leading organizations to drive faster, more confident decisions in business and finance. The platform combines domain-specific AI with a vast content universe of over 500 million premium business documents — including equity research, earnings calls, expert interviews, filings, news, and internal proprietary content. Purpose-built for speed, accuracy, and enterprise-grade security, AlphaSense helps teams extract critical insights, uncover market-moving trends, and automate complex workflows with high-quality outputs. With AI solutions like Generative Search, Generative Grid, and Deep Research, AlphaSense delivers the clarity and depth professionals need to navigate complexity and obtain accurate, real-time information quickly. For more information, visit &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.alpha-sense.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Come join us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The AlphaSense Corporate Sales team is verticalized, with a focus on the world&#39;s largest companies across Life Sciences, Technology, Media and Telecom, Energy and Industrials, and Consumer Packaged Goods. The newly formed Global Accounts team sits at the intersection of our regional and strategic teams. It is built around multinational corporates with a material presence on both sides of the Atlantic, where a combined account strategy delivers the most value to our customers and company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Executives on the Global Accounts team work in cross-region pairs, with an Americas-based and an EMEA-based AE jointly owning a shared set of accounts. Together, you will build one territory vision, partner on account strategy and business cases, and drive adoption bottom up and top down across both regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced, entrepreneurial, and accomplished seller to join our Global Accounts team as an Account Executive based in EMEA. You will be the primary owner for a book of multinational accounts &lt;strong&gt;headquartered or led from EMEA&lt;/strong&gt; that have significant teams, users, and buying centers in the Americas. You will partner day to day with your Americas-based counterpart, who leads the accounts headquartered in the Americas and the regional relationships on the accounts you lead, to grow AlphaSense across the whole organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership, end-to-end role. You will combine a strategic account planning motion (executive relationships, business cases, multi-stakeholder and multi-region deal cycles) with the hands-on work of growing large accounts and opening new ones. You will proactively prospect into new accounts and business units, not just manage inbound interest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role is built on people. You will identify and develop champions across business units, functions, and regions, and equip them to advocate for AlphaSense internally. You will be expected to get in front of customers: onsite visits, executive briefings, and team workshops, in partnership with your Americas-based counterpart, are a core part of how we earn trust and accelerate deals. You will turn that access into results through disciplined execution: clear mutual action plans, tight follow-through on trials and next steps, and a regular rhythm of account reviews with your partner and leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategy and execution for your book of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;EMEA-led global accounts&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with your Americas-based counterpart on the accounts they lead where your presence and relationships can accelerate the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a joint account plan with your Americas-based partner for every shared account, aligned on stakeholders, whitespace, deal timing, and a single global business case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build executive-level relationships and champions across Corporate Strategy, Competitive Intelligence, Business Development, M&amp;amp;A, and Investor Relations, and expand into new functions and business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow your accounts through upsell, cross-sell, and new use cases, and open new accounts and business units alongside your existing book.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the full sales cycle, from prospecting through demos, trials, and close, in partnership with our SDR, Product Specialist, and Account Management teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecast accurately and build the pipeline needed to meet and exceed your quota.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert on corporate customer needs and use cases, market dynamics, the competitive landscape, and product differentiation within your vertical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gather and share product feedback from customers and prospects with the sales and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel regularly for customer meetings, onsite engagements, and team collaboration is an expectation of this role. Flexibility to travel as needed to advance opportunities, strengthen customer relationships, and drive revenue growth is essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thinks strategically.&lt;/strong&gt; You put your time where there is real buying intent and access to decision-makers, and you build plans by working backwards from what success looks like for the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Builds relationships.&lt;/strong&gt; You have a strong record of account mapping, multi-threading, and building relationships with senior executives and champions across large, matrixed organizations. You can explain complex business data and concepts to a non-research audience and tell the story of present and future value to people at all levels. [Additional European language skills are a plus.]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grows accounts.&lt;/strong&gt; You have taken accounts from low five or six figures to much larger through expansion, cross-sell, and new use cases, ideally in a SaaS or comparable enterprise sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opens new doors.&lt;/strong&gt; You crack open new accounts and new business units while still running a book, through your own proactive prospecting alongside the support of our SDR and Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brings grit and hustle.&lt;/strong&gt; You stay with it and deliver consistently, quarter after quarter. You are coachable, intellectually curious, and thrive where you can be creative to get things done.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborates globally.&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable sharing an account, a pipeline, and a plan with a colleague in another region, working across time zones and putting the account&#39;s outcome ahead of individual credit. You understand that the buyer in London, Basel, and New York may all be different, with different needs and budgets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense is an equal-opportunity employer. We are committed to a work environment that supports, inspires, and respects all individuals. All employees share in the responsibility for fulfilling AlphaSense’s commitment to equal employment opportunity. AlphaSense does not discriminate against any employee or applicant on the basis of race, color, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, age, religion, marital status, sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, military or veteran status, disability, or any other non-merit factor. This policy applies to every aspect of employment at AlphaSense, including recruitment, hiring, training, advancement, and termination.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;In addition, it is the policy of AlphaSense to provide reasonable accommodation to qualified employees who have protected disabilities to the extent required by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances where a particular employee works.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Recruiting Scams and Fraud&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We at AlphaSense have been made aware of fraudulent job postings and individuals impersonating AlphaSense recruiters. These scams may involve fake job offers, requests for sensitive personal information, or demands for payment. Please note:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;AlphaSense never asks candidates to pay for job applications, equipment, or training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All official communications will come from an @&lt;a href=&quot;http://alpha-sense.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=http://alpha-sense.com/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2sfhQUZloRzVpQ4Yj1Ftlo&quot;&gt;alpha-sense.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you’re unsure about a job posting or recruiter, verify it on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.alpha-sense.com/careers/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1740162734907000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw3I0CFwb1ser7ImCRD48YOl&quot;&gt;Careers page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you believe you’ve been targeted by a scam or have any doubts regarding the authenticity of any job listing purportedly from or on behalf of AlphaSense please contact us. Your security and trust matter to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;About the Job:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Regional Sales Director, you’ll own Enterprise sales performance and strategy within EMEA. You’ll lead a high-performing team of experienced Enterprise Account Executives focused on new business and expansion opportunities, building the pipeline, sales discipline, and customer relationships needed to deliver predictable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll collaborate cross-functionally to drive regional performance and support complex enterprise sales engagements. This role is ideal for a sales leader who understands the developer tools space, is passionate about solving complex customer challenges, and thrives in a high-growth SaaS environment. This role reports to our VP, EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and manage a team of Enterprise Account Executives across EMEA, driving new logo acquisition and expansion within existing enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quarterly and annual team revenue targets, translating regional strategy into clear territory plans and execution priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong outbound pipeline generation culture, partnering with Sales Development and Marketing to create and progress qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional sales forecasting and pipeline inspection, ensuring accurate reporting, clear deal qualification, and proactive management of risks and gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Account Executives through complex sales cycles, including discovery, value articulation, stakeholder engagement, negotiation, and close planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive sponsorship for strategic opportunities and customer relationships, helping the team engage senior technical and business decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leadership and Revenue Operations on annual planning, territory assignments, coverage, capacity, and quota and compensation planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Marketing, Sales Development, Revenue Operations, and Enablement to improve sales execution and deliver a coordinated customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard, develop, and retain high-performing sales talent, fostering an inclusive culture of accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, develop, and manage a team of Enterprise Account Executives across EMEA, driving new logo acquisition and expansion within existing enterprise accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own quarterly and annual team revenue targets, translating regional strategy into clear territory plans and execution priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong outbound pipeline generation culture, partnering with Sales Development and Marketing to create and progress qualified opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own regional sales forecasting and pipeline inspection, ensuring accurate reporting, clear deal qualification, and proactive management of risks and gaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach Account Executives through complex sales cycles, including discovery, value articulation, stakeholder engagement, negotiation, and close planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive sponsorship for strategic opportunities and customer relationships, helping the team engage senior technical and business decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior leadership and Revenue Operations on annual planning, territory assignments, coverage, capacity, and quota and compensation planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Marketing, Sales Development, Revenue Operations, and Enablement to improve sales execution and deliver a coordinated customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard, develop, and retain high-performing sales talent, fostering an inclusive culture of accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LaunchDarkly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modern software delivery was supposed to be the foundation for a thriving digital business but reality has proven otherwise. Slow, inefficient development cycles, costly outages, and fragmented customer experiences are preventing developers from building their best software. The LaunchDarkly platform helps developers innovate on new features faster while protecting them with a safety valve to instantly rewind when things go wrong. Developers can target product experiences to any customer segment and maximize the business impact of every feature. And by gradually rolling out new application components, they escape nightmare &quot;big-bang&quot; technology migrations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The LaunchDarkly platform was built to guide engineers to the next frontier of DevOps by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the velocity and stability of software releases, without the fear of end customer outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering targeted experiences by easily personalizing features to customer cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximizing the business impact of every feature through the ability to experiment and optimize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating the release and optimization of software to provide consistent experiences across mobile platforms and device types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the effectiveness and productivity of engineering teams, by providing insights into engineering cadence and stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LaunchDarkly, we believe in the power of teams. We&#39;re building a team that is humble, open, collaborative, respectful and kind. We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you need a disability accommodation?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Fill out this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYb_7upYMtdRVXzvXGHGfQw0pU2FNma-6Rwp-I6NjKm7SYNw/viewform&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;accommodations request form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and someone from our People Operations team will contact you for assistance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;To protect yourself from potential scams, LaunchDarkly recruiters will only contact you from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://launchdarkly.com/&quot;&gt;launchdarkly.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email addresses or via LinkedIn from &quot;Verified Recruiter&quot; accounts. Be cautious of emails from other domains.&amp;nbsp; Legitimate LaunchDarkly recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before making a job offer. LaunchDarkly will never make a job offer without conducting a formal interview process. Our interview process does not involve asking detailed questions by email. If you are ever unsure about a communication that you receive, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://launchdarkly.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Careers | LaunchDarkly&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; directly for confirmed job openings and links to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please notify us of any fraudulent representation by sending an email to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;About the Job:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;LaunchDarkly is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Corporate&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Regional Sales Director EMEA to lead the strategy and execution of our Corporate EMEA sales business. This leader will own regional performance across new business and expansion, lead and develop frontline sales leadership and Account Executives, and build the operating discipline needed for predictable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role combines hands-on commercial leadership with organizational leadership. The Regional Sales Director will set the regional plan, inspect pipeline and forecast, coach leaders through complex deals, shape territory and capacity decisions, and partner closely with Marketing, SDR, Solutions Engineering, Customer Success, Revenue Operations, and Enablement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for a sales leader who can operate across Corporate EMEA segments, translate global strategy into regional execution, and build a high-performing, accountable, and inclusive team in a fast-growing SaaS environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own Corporate EMEA performance and strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Set the regional plan for new logo acquisition, expansion, pipeline creation, coverage, and revenue attainment across the Corporate EMEA business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through frontline managers.&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and support sales managers and Account Executives through clear goals, consistent operating rhythms, coaching, and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive predictable forecasting.&lt;/strong&gt; Own forecast accuracy, pipeline inspection, stage discipline, deal progression, and risk management across the region; provide clear updates and actions to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build pipeline and improve conversion.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish expectations for prospecting, partner with SDR and Marketing leaders on pipeline generation, and remove barriers to conversion across the funnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coach complex sales execution.&lt;/strong&gt; Support strategic opportunities, executive alignment, multi-threading, value articulation, negotiation, and close plans across technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape territory, coverage, and capacity.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Revenue Operations and senior sales leadership on territory design, segmentation, headcount planning, quota allocation, hiring priorities, and organizational structure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the team.&lt;/strong&gt; Recruit, onboard, retain, and develop high-performing sales talent; create a strong management bench and an inclusive culture of accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About LaunchDarkly:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modern software delivery was supposed to be the foundation for a thriving digital business but reality has proven otherwise. Slow, inefficient development cycles, costly outages, and fragmented customer experiences are preventing developers from building their best software. The LaunchDarkly platform helps developers innovate on new features faster while protecting them with a safety valve to instantly rewind when things go wrong. Developers can target product experiences to any customer segment and maximize the business impact of every feature. And by gradually rolling out new application components, they escape nightmare &quot;big-bang&quot; technology migrations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The LaunchDarkly platform was built to guide engineers to the next frontier of DevOps by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the velocity and stability of software releases, without the fear of end customer outages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering targeted experiences by easily personalizing features to customer cohorts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximizing the business impact of every feature through the ability to experiment and optimize&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating the release and optimization of software to provide consistent experiences across mobile platforms and device types&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improving the effectiveness and productivity of engineering teams, by providing insights into engineering cadence and stability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At LaunchDarkly, we believe in the power of teams. We&#39;re building a team that is humble, open, collaborative, respectful and kind. We are an equal opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do you need a disability accommodation?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Fill out this&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYb_7upYMtdRVXzvXGHGfQw0pU2FNma-6Rwp-I6NjKm7SYNw/viewform&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;accommodations request form&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and someone from our People Operations team will contact you for assistance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;To protect yourself from potential scams, LaunchDarkly recruiters will only contact you from @&lt;a href=&quot;http://launchdarkly.com/&quot;&gt;launchdarkly.com&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;email addresses or via LinkedIn from &quot;Verified Recruiter&quot; accounts. Be cautious of emails from other domains.&amp;nbsp; Legitimate LaunchDarkly recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before making a job offer. LaunchDarkly will never make a job offer without conducting a formal interview process. Our interview process does not involve asking detailed questions by email. If you are ever unsure about a communication that you receive, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://launchdarkly.com/careers/&quot;&gt;Careers | LaunchDarkly&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; directly for confirmed job openings and links to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please notify us of any fraudulent representation by sending an email to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;8c2fp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;874u1-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;874u1-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;874u1-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Security EDR Workflows team is in charge of building core capabilities that power Elastic Defend management experience. Our focus is on delivering policy configuration and management capabilities, Elastic Defend and third party providers response actions as forensics capabilities through OSquery. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;vevd-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The team is leading XDR key expansion to our SIEM foundations and enhancing user experience in onboarding and managing our security product. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f946k-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;As a Software Engineer on the Security EDR Workflows team, you will help build workflows and user-facing capabilities that get to our Elastic Defend agent to protect and respond against security threats. You’ll collaborate closely with other security engineering teams, as well as with product and design, to deliver robust, high-scale features used by security practitioners around the world. You’ll be using AI to quickly understand and solve problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;8c2fp&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9a454-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
