&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Comprehensive testing across unit, integration and functional layers, including Go&#39;s built-in testing tooling and frontend testing frameworks such as Jest or React Testing Library&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Go modules and dependency management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Go performance fundamentals, including profiling with pprof, memory management and garbage collection behaviou&lt;/li&gt;
