&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted Go grows by signing new pick-up/drop-off locations, and a large share of that growth is delivered by external sales agencies. You will own that network: the agencies running our field sales, virtual calling and digital outreach across Europe and the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today these relationships are managed in a fragmented way. Your job is to turn them into one well-governed, high-performing extension of the acquisition team, with clear targets, a consistent operating rhythm and a single point of accountability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-ownership role. You will act as an agency manager, performance analyst and budget owner, and above all as the guardian of the Vinted Go sales approach in every conversation an agency has on our behalf. You will build on the structure that already exists.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agency &amp;amp; Channel Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full relationship with every outsourced sales partner across countries: onboarding, day-to-day management, escalations and offboarding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the single point of accountability for agency sales results, replacing today&#39;s fragmented oversight&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and manage contracts, SLAs and commercial terms, including pay-for-performance structures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, select and onboard new sales agencies as we enter new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build one operating framework (reporting cadence, WBRs, MBRs, escalation paths) that works the same way across agencies, channels and countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track sales KPIs and SLAs per agency, channel and market: conversion, signed locations per rep, productivity, lead quality and adherence to the Vinted Go pitch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that give real-time visibility into performance across the whole network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot underperforming agencies or markets early and drive corrective action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate acquisition targets set by leadership into agency-level performance expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run calibration and quality assurance (call reviews, field ride-alongs) so every agency sells consistently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Budget Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the outsourced sales budget across all agencies and countries: forecasting, spend tracking and variance reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze cost per outcome (CAC, cost per signed location, cost per hour) across agencies, channels and markets to drive efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find and execute cost optimizations without compromising quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Report on budget and performance regularly to finance and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale &amp;amp; Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design the processes and governance needed to run a multi-agency, multi-country, multi-language sales network sustainably&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain playbooks for opening new markets and onboarding new agencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the acquisition team to align on targets, budgets and reporting standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Senior experience managing external sales agencies or outsourced sales teams (field sales, telesales, digital lead generation), ideally across several countries and vendors at once&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in sales, acquisition or growth in a high-velocity environment, so you know what good looks like on the ground&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong record of agency performance management: setting KPIs and SLAs, running WBRs and MBRs, and driving accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Budget ownership: forecasting, tracking and optimizing spend across multiple vendors or cost centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building structure and process from a relatively unstructured starting point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, working easily in dashboards, reporting tools and a CRM to track performance and cost&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and negotiation skills: you hold agencies accountable while keeping the partnership productive&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working across time zones and cultures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English; French and/or Spanish is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why This Role Matters&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outsourced sales is one of the main ways Vinted Go signs new locations at scale, and it is growing in every market we enter. This role brings order, accountability and cost discipline to that network, and lays the foundation for further international and product growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When an incident happens in production at Vinted, how quickly our engineering teams recover directly affects millions of members across Europe and the US.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be the lead technical architect for VITA, our in house platform for alerts, on call routing, incident management, and SLOs. Every single production alert at Vinted flows through VITA, and every incident is coordinated through it in Slack, from declaration to postmortem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join a focused engineering team within our Service Ecosystem domain. The previous lead engineer recently stepped up to become the team Engineering Manager, which means we now need an experienced technical partner to take over the architectural vision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because our team operates without a dedicated product manager, you will enjoy true product ownership. You will spend roughly half your time on technical discovery, researching solutions, and shaping our roadmap directly with engineering stakeholders and directors across Vinted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the team&#39;s technical direction: scope complex problems, design solutions and coordinate delivery across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own incident management and on-call processes, and lead improvements to both the processes and the tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eliminate alert fatigue across Vinted, collaborating with engineering teams to group noisy alerts, establish alert standards, and make every page actionable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advance practical AI in production, designing the event pipelines that allow our AI incident agent to accurately suggest root causes during live outages in minutes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define standards for SLOs and alerts across Vinted, and simplify the tools teams use to create them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track the product and process metrics that show whether our work makes a difference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep alert routing and our other critical systems reliable and simple to operate, so the team can move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical mentor and multiplier for a growing team of five engineers, elevating their engineering discipline through thoughtful system design reviews and collaborative RFCs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience architecting, building, and operating high scale distributed systems in production. Our platform is built in Go, but we warmly welcome strong backgrounds in Java, Rust, Python, C++, or similar technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience owning distributed systems in production, from design to operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have been on call and responded to production incidents, and are happy to keep doing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product mindset for developer tooling. You treat other engineers as your customers, listen to user pain points, and measure success by adoption and developer happiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand observability: metrics, logs, traces and SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English is mandatory, paired with strong technical communication and diplomacy. You can explain architectural risks clearly to non technical stakeholders and have the confidence to challenge senior leaders constructively with data and SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural mentor and collaborator. You take pride in lifting others up, breaking down complex technical problems, and helping newer engineers grow safely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: experience with incident management, on-call or observability tooling, or in a platform team serving other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: experience building LLM-based tools or agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€93.500&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€126.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Vinted’s new Android Software Engineer, you’ll be joining the Android Technologies team. This is a team that provides Android support to Vinted developers in the marketplace business unit, helping them to develop and ship features faster. You will be working on exciting engineering areas like Android build systems, observability tools and coming up with technical solutions for platform stability and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll also support our Android Staff engineer and other technologies engineers in executing critical platform projects, moving us closer to achieving our company mission.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with peers to design and maintain core Android architecture, shared libraries, and developer tooling that empower product engineers to build high-performance app features efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable other Android engineering teams by creating developer experience solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other teams through GitHub pull requests and code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use comprehensive testing methodologies, including unit tests, integration tests, snapshot tests, and UI tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;See how your code affects millions of Vinted members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Android, Kotlin, Kotlin Multiplatform and other tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to learn and master new technologies and concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to work with a senior and very knowledgeable team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep understanding of key software engineering and Android-specific principles and technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand and use future proof software architecture and design patterns, Android arch, Kotlin coroutines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand trade-offs in solutions and are attentive to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€69.900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€94.500 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Work on the mission-critical Java back end&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;25&quot; data-local-id=&quot;079e1865-d4ef-42fd-b7e7-cc9e402e3857&quot;&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we don’t just deliver IT solutions, we design, build, and run mission-critical systems that our customers rely on every single day. From infrastructure to cloud-native platforms, every layer of technology is crafted with one goal in mind: uncompromising reliability and excellence. We take pride in working shoulder-to-shoulder with our customers, ensuring their most vital operations run smoothly, no matter how complex the challenge.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;482&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c00a1f72-3107-4ff3-91be-891f21ef9d80&quot;&gt;We are looking for an experienced Java Software Engineer to work with one of our biggest banking customers, delivering business value using cloud technologies and a DevOps way of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;671&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6212e011-4dd4-4f56-9dbd-0d263b9dc82c&quot;&gt;As a Java software engineer, you will be responsible for the development of core business features for our customer and for improving its software delivery capabilities, working closely with internal stakeholders and other DevOps teams. You will work daily within a DevOps team where your colleagues will expect you to maintain a wide overview while guarding aspects like quality, security, and planning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;671&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6212e011-4dd4-4f56-9dbd-0d263b9dc82c&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-you’ll-do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;38e10f4a-b9e9-44b3-a739-b8374f17367b&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1078&quot;&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1096&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af7e8743-fa2d-432e-81d7-032ce76f3962&quot;&gt;Design, build and run Java-based micro-services and APIs that support business‑critical banking processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1096&quot; data-local-id=&quot;af7e8743-fa2d-432e-81d7-032ce76f3962&quot;&gt;Work end-to-end: from clarifying requirements and refining user stories to development, testing, deployment and operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1331&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a328879-58d8-4ca5-b732-2cd1b0e57d41&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with other DevOps teams, architects and business stakeholders to deliver secure, reliable and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1467&quot; data-local-id=&quot;349c98d5-71ea-4ba6-9aec-3f5357fe43a3&quot;&gt;Contribute to improving engineering practices: code quality, testing, CI/CD pipelines, monitoring, and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1584&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fdcba0d5-1ea9-41b0-afb7-4337e3ab1f15&quot;&gt;Help the team keep production stable, with a strong focus on reliability, security, observability and incident prevention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1709&quot; data-local-id=&quot;494978a8-a68f-4e24-b793-f3678b1c02be&quot;&gt;Stay up to date with modern engineering practices and bring in ideas to improve the platform and the way we work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1972&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f96e317b-5ecd-4d5b-8476-5c5dfd22720c&quot;&gt;Ideally, you have:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1994&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6ec3c441-8055-41ab-bc28-4225542be6bc&quot;&gt;Strong hands-on Java experience (preferably Java 17+)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2051&quot; data-local-id=&quot;27d118e0-1aff-4218-b64c-865f96c54f5e&quot;&gt;Solid experience with Spring Boot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2088&quot; data-local-id=&quot;09b8457d-aafa-4cc7-8f36-e72cf4537876&quot;&gt;Experience designing and building RESTful APIs and system integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2162&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f740c046-43e8-4fe4-b84f-d974c211b5e7&quot;&gt;Experience with Java-based microservices in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2220&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bb77d7a9-0719-497d-8e81-1cc55df16d60&quot;&gt;A track record of writing testable, maintainable, high-quality code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2291&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1dec140-43a1-4fa5-b8e7-e440ee656638&quot;&gt;Experience working in a professional development team (code reviews, CI/CD, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2291&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e1dec140-43a1-4fa5-b8e7-e440ee656638&quot;&gt;We’re also open to engineers with a strong background in other languages (e.g. Kotlin, .NET, C++)&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;plus&lt;/strong&gt; at least ~3 years of recent, hands-on Java experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;What would be a great plus for us?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You don’t need all of these. Having some of them – or strong interest and the ability to learn – is a plus:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f65048ba-e98a-42ec-b06a-0570991d4109&quot;&gt;Experience with Kotlin or other JVM languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2707&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8be92de5-fba9-43c8-85e3-9199a10e65a9&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Authentication and Authorization protocols (OIDC / OAuth2, etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2787&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6c5926df-41c1-4f93-8fe5-50e9beeb606e&quot;&gt;Experience with DevOps practices and tools (preferably Azure DevOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2859&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a679d47-07e8-4548-a9b8-e83a4d4ca58c&quot;&gt;Experience with public cloud (AWS and/or Azure)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2910&quot; data-local-id=&quot;231c3782-80a4-47f4-8ba9-2d67216b56e0&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code experience (e.g. Terraform)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2964&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1673f1c9-d2ec-4b40-8191-a1f11e526c6d&quot;&gt;Experience working in Agile/Scrum teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Partner Solutions Engineer is a highly experienced technical lead responsible for driving the growth and technical enablement of our key partners (Telcos, Global Systems Integrators, Resellers and BPOs) across the Netherlands, Belgium and Luxembourg and Germany.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This senior individual contributor role reports directly to the Vice President, Partner Solution Engineering. You will act as the primary technical point of contact, supporting partners in establishing and scaling their Contact Center as a Service (CCaaS) and Customer Experience Automation (CXA) practices built around the Talkdesk platform. This role involves deep technical engagement, partner enablement, co-selling support, and providing technical thought leadership to ensure mutual partner and customer success across the assigned territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Enablement &amp;amp; Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Technical Enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and execute comprehensive enablement plans to educate partner Solutions Architects and Sales Engineers on the Talkdesk value proposition, product architecture, competitive differentiators, and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Center of Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of Partner Competency Centers by coaching on effective technical discovery, platform demonstrations, and proof-of-concept (POC) execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop and maintain deep domain expertise in the regional Partner landscape, understanding their current go-to-market (GTM) strategy, areas of focus, and identifying new opportunities for expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Co-Selling Support &amp;amp; Technical Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI Focus:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical expertise on &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt; solutions within the contact center, including prompt engineering, RAG implementations, tools integration, and guardrail best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical oversight, guidance, and direct assistance to Partner sales teams in understanding complex customer business and technical requirements, use cases, and solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Demonstration:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead advanced technical discussions, conduct compelling demonstrations of the Talkdesk platform, and articulate the ease of integration within an enterprise ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ecosystem Integration:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop a deep understanding of the enterprise ecosystem, including integration requirements with &lt;strong&gt;CRM&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., Salesforce, Microsoft Dynamics), &lt;strong&gt;WFM, Knowledge Management, and UCaaS &lt;/strong&gt;vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Contribution &amp;amp; Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Voice of the Partner:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the critical communication channel to Talkdesk Product Management and Engineering teams, relaying Partner and customer needs, market trends, and product enhancement requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Representation:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Talkdesk as a technical expert at regional Partner summits, technical events, webinars, and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Travel approximately 70% of the time across the Netherlands, Belgium and Luxembourg, working primarily from partner offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regional Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;10+ years of experience as a &lt;strong&gt;Partner Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; or Pre-Sales Engineer in the &lt;strong&gt;CCaaS/CXA&lt;/strong&gt; sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Business-level fluency in Dutch and professional fluency in English are required. German or French as a further language is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Excellent communication, presentation, and whiteboard session skills&lt;/strong&gt; with an ability to lead advanced technical discussions and deliver compelling platform demonstrations for enterprise customers &amp;amp; Partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Solid experience working with &lt;strong&gt;Service Providers, Regional Systems Integrators, National Partners, and VARs&lt;/strong&gt;, with a proven understanding of a partner-centric GTM approach within the Benelux market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to lead and drive complex technical engagements and serve as a subject matter expert without direct people management responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Telephony &amp;amp; Protocol Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience with at least one &lt;strong&gt;Unified Communication protocol&lt;/strong&gt; (e.g., SIP, WebRTC, RTP) and familiarity with Call/Message processing Proxies and Session Border Controllers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied AI Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or strong familiarity with modern &lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI&lt;/strong&gt; technologies, including the practical application of LLMs for Contact Center and Customer Experience Automation use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, MIS, or an equivalent combination of education and years of relevant experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Method of Application&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;Apply online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Window&lt;/strong&gt;: The application window is expected to close at least 5 days from the posting date. The application was posted on 10/18/2026.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits and perks listed above may vary based on the nature of your employment with Talkdesk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All questions or concerns about this posting should be directed to the Talent team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk is pioneering a new era of Customer Experience Automation (CXA), redefining how the world’s most admired brands interact with their customers through AI. Our global team of courageous innovators is customer-obsessed, building AI-first solutions that put empathy, trust, and transparency at the center of every interaction. We foster an inclusive culture where diverse perspectives drive our success and every voice belongs. Combining the stability of a global leader with the agility of a disruptor, Talkdeskers are empowered with the autonomy to drive meaningful impact, while giving back to the communities and environment around us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Talkdesk has been recognized as a Leader in the Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ for Contact Center as a Service (CCaaS) and in the G2 Overall Grid® Reports for AI Agents and Contact Center. With seven consecutive years on the Forbes Cloud 100 and multiple AI Breakthrough awards, there has never been a more exciting time to join us as we shape the future of customer experience automation!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment and Physical Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Primarily office-environment work, extended periods of sitting or standing, computer-based work. Limited lifting, and equipment usage limited to computer-related equipment (keyboards, mouse, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;The Talkdesk story hinges on empathy and acceptance. It is the shared goal among all Talkdeskers to empower a new kind of customer hero through our innovative software solution, and we firmly believe that the best path to success for our mission is inclusivity, diversity, and genuine acceptance. To that end, we will hire, promote, work along, cheer for, bond with, and warmly welcome into the Talkdesk family all persons without regard to ethnic and racial identity, indigenous heritage, national origin, religion, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, age, disability, marital status, veteran status, genetic information, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f161c5e0e159&quot;&gt;As an &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer, you’ll work side-by-side with teammates to build real-world applications that power a global trading firm. You’ll create solutions with nanosecond response times, highly parallelized algorithms, and customized low-level networking that solve business challenges effectively and efficiently. Collaborating closely with our business, you’ll have in-depth insight into a problem before developing the solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;431&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adba195f4739&quot;&gt;Optiver is building with cutting edge AI technology in the most competitive, data rich landscapes in the world: financial markets. Our &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; engineers use AI to speed up verification, debugging, and technical research, while retaining full ownership of the designs and decisions it supports.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;723&quot; data-local-id=&quot;17a0fe36f211&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;739&quot; data-local-id=&quot;73bf921aff41&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your onboarding&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;756&quot; data-local-id=&quot;faf72777d0b4&quot;&gt;You will participate in Optiver’s comprehensive &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/working-at-optiver/career-hub/kickstart-your-tech-career-with-the-global-optiver-academy-technology/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Global Academy&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt; and be equipped with the knowledge needed to make an impact the moment you join your team. The comprehensive training covers trading theory and Optiver’s tech stack to hone your skills for your role. In addition, you will be paired with a dedicated mentor who will empower you to take ownership of your work and make a difference.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1151&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ca6e2c0c77c8&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0e361e4-6196-4356-8541-d8f002e435bf&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1176&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eac520c2171&quot;&gt;Accelerate network infrastructure and trading system components with high-speed hardware designs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1277&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a022afb9a9ab&quot;&gt;Research new low-latency techniques and platforms and identify opportunities for integration with our trading system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1398&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fadf5bffabfd&quot;&gt;Collaborate in a multidisciplinary team of traders, software developers, and infrastructure engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5addbd5461f6&quot;&gt;Leverage the best hardware available or build in-house versions to ensure our FPGAs can interface with cutting-edge server hardware.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1641&quot; data-local-id=&quot;146a73037404&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What you’ll get&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1658&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3eacf938451f&quot;&gt;You’ll join a culture of collaboration and excellence, where you’ll be surrounded by curious thinkers and creative problem solvers. Motivated by a passion for continuous improvement, you’ll thrive in a supportive, high-performing environment alongside talented colleagues, working collectively to tackle the toughest problems in the financial markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2011&quot; data-local-id=&quot;503188307740&quot;&gt;In addition, you’ll receive:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;99ca3959-15c0-45f1-a447-767e53fdf49b&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2043&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1f9c9f8fb4a2&quot;&gt;A performance-based bonus structure, enabling all of our employees to benefit from our global profit pool&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2152&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e3fe9d7a371b&quot;&gt;The opportunity to work alongside best-in-class professionals from over 50 different countries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2250&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f436e67758ba&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days in your first year, increasing to 30 from your second year onwards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;30a31e86a468&quot;&gt;Training opportunities, discounts on health benefits, and fully paid first-class commuting expenses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2445&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fb0b9c1fb6fb&quot;&gt;Extensive office perks, including breakfast, lunch and dinner, world-class barista coffee, sport and leisure activities, bi-weekly massages and Friday afternoon drinks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2616&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fa46477f06b3&quot;&gt;Training and continuous learning opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2666&quot; data-local-id=&quot;044e9d2ff377&quot;&gt;International transfer opportunities for global career growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2731&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3c7c84d9e057&quot;&gt;Competitive relocation packages and visa sponsorship where necessary for expats&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2814&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4ffe813798de&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8295f26d0d39&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2829&quot; data-local-id=&quot;9cb4fbc9c504&quot;&gt;University degree in Electrical/Electronic Engineering, Computer Engineering or similar, with outstanding academic achievements&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2960&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c29bca845925&quot;&gt;Graduating between August 2024 and August 2027, with a maximum of 3 years of work experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3056&quot; data-local-id=&quot;88b9545187e7&quot;&gt;Academic design experience with FPGAs or ASICs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3106&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f0a544f723de&quot;&gt;Academic experience in &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VHDL&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, Verilog, or SystemVerilog&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3164&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d77564dce5cd&quot;&gt;An open, collaborative, self-critical attitude and willingness to learn from your mistakes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3258&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6bc214fc201c&quot;&gt;A desire to understand how the systems you build fit into our trading activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3342&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1b4604aa2b53&quot;&gt;Able to work closely with other engineers, traders, and business operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3421&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3128ca8fb8fd&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3423&quot; data-local-id=&quot;823584a77e0c&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;How to Apply: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Apply directly via the form below for the position of Graduate &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FPGA&lt;/span&gt; Engineer. Please provide us with a &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;CV&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; in English. Unfortunately we cannot accept applications via email for data protection reasons.&lt;br&gt;If your application is selected to proceed to the next round, you will be required to complete online assessments. By submitting your application you are confirming that you will be able to take the assessment within 7 days.&lt;br&gt;Kindly note that we do not require any assistance from third-parties including agencies in the recruitment of this role. If you have any questions feel free to contact our Recruitment team via the &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4075&quot; data-local-id=&quot;139f367f88ca&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4078&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5abdd7d99e5d&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Diversity statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4099&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6aff0008585e&quot;&gt;Optiver is committed to &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/diversity-statement/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;diversity and inclusion&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4149&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22b474595d9b&quot;&gt;We encourage applications from candidates from any and all backgrounds, and we welcome requests for reasonable adjustments during the process to ensure that you can best demonstrate your abilities. Please let us know if you would like to request any reasonable adjustments by contacting the Recruitment team &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://optiver.com/contact-eu-recruitment/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;via the contact form&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, selecting &quot;Reasonable Adjustments&quot; as the subject of your inquiry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d289fcd7c1a&quot;&gt;For answers to some of our most frequently asked questions, refer to our &lt;a class=&quot;_2hGPVj98eZ _2i3C1kYbGa _2kH23qT6kp _1ubuxonXvL _34b3D2vc3e _1NDpvb6wH8 _2wtOC9vc3e _3e11vU6wH8 _0hSAgbHZdu _00uqCY98eZ _3xtjKN0Rl6 _0H9qDF6wH8 _24h04i2Njc _1mT5xdRAKS _0WKd3G4z3T _0bjKvDcjp5 _1UtDYzM7Tp _32C2rk98eZ _0i9AWA0Rl6 _0mm6KQ6wH8 _10n1R5M7Tp _0DCa9D98eZ _3932vvYbGa _02cRtH6wH8 _0clgaMM7Tp _3WzCGi98eZ _0NqVRtYbGa _3BKYwu6wH8 _0CMRbkAwSC _2nTuUYWfPD _3ADzdEWfPD _1warJ9WfPD _4scvAwWyeI&quot; href=&quot;https://www.optiver.com/join-us/stories/optiver-europe-recruitment-faq/&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;FAQs&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ddd7edd2cd3e&quot;&gt;For applicants based in India, our entry route is via the placement office internship hiring season (July/August).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4743&quot; data-local-id=&quot;895e3754d5bc&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Optiver has a global application re-apply policy for our intern and graduate roles. If you have completed an online assessment or interviewed for a technology graduate or internship role at any Optiver location in the past 8 months, please note that you are not yet eligible to reapply. We welcome you to re-apply after the 8-month cool off period.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;6618a4c09482&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Ready to shape the future of talent acquisition in a global trading firm? As a Senior Campus Recruiter, you&#39;ll be the driving force behind spotting and bringing the top 1% of talent from Europe&#39;s premier universities on board. Your journey involves navigating the full campus recruitment lifecycle, from identification to selection, and making your mark at European recruitment events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll join our Campus Recruitment team in Europe, based in Amsterdam, part of a wider recruitment organisation of experienced tech, trading and business support recruiters. Collaboration comes first here: we share knowledge, step in for each other in peak season, and succeed as one team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end recruitment process: screening, interviewing, assessment review, offer conversations and closing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong partnerships with business leaders and interviewers, and make sure we&#39;re aligned on hiring needs and on what great looks like&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a data-driven way, using insights to make our process sharper, fairer and more efficient&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to strategic projects such as market analyses, process and assessment reviews, and improvements to how we select&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent IMC at recruitment events across Europe, with frequent travel (more than four times a year)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of industry experience, ideally within a global finance, trading, tech or consultancy organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial markets and the trading industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A critical eye: you question how things are done, spot trends early and turn them into practical improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to think strategically and act tactically, moving easily between the bigger picture and getting things done today&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solution-oriented mindset: when something isn&#39;t working, you look for a better way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy operational recruitment. Running a tight process and giving candidates a great experience energises you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build relationships with the business with ease and earn trust as a partner, not just a service provider&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in a dynamic environment where no two days are the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well in a larger team and put collaboration first&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You keep up with industry trends and best practices in campus recruitment and bring them into your own work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A unique work culture that values collaboration, initiative, and ownership. Our professional and friendly environment provides the perfect backdrop for your growth and responsibilities. We operate with transparency in a flat structure, allowing you direct engagement with stakeholders and professionals. Your input matters here, contributing to our collective success. At IMC, continuous learning is a priority. Various training and on-the-job growth opportunities allow you to shape your path within the organisation. This isn&#39;t just a job; it&#39;s a journey of ongoing growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We appreciate your efforts. Our highly competitive salary comes with great perks. If you&#39;re looking for a friendly yet professional space to contribute and grow, IMC is the place. If you&#39;re ready for a role beyond routine recruitment, where your experience can contribute to the future of our team and company, apply now.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;IMC is a research-driven trading firm where quantitative modeling, machine learning, and engineering shape how modern markets are traded. A stabilizing force in markets since 1989, we provide liquidity across trading venues, delivering the best outcome in value and risk management to investors. Using our own technology and capital, we build proprietary systems and algorithms that operate across global markets. Our researchers, traders, and engineers work as a collective, combining rapid experimentation, advanced infrastructure, and real-time feedback to turn insight into execution and execution into advantage.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;NOTE: English translation appears below&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt; ist eine führende globale Beratungsfirma, die wirtschaftliche, finanzielle und betriebswirtschaftliche Expertise für große Anwaltskanzleien, Unternehmen und Regierungen weltweit bietet. CRA berät Kunden in wirtschaftlichen und finanziellen Angelegenheiten im Zusammenhang mit Rechtsstreitigkeiten und behördlichen Verfahren und unterstützt Unternehmen bei kritischen Geschäftsstrategien und leistungsbezogenen Fragen. Seit 1965 engagieren Kunden CRA aufgrund der Kombination aus Branchenerfahrung und rigoroser, faktenbasierter Analyse, die klare, umsetzbare Lösungen für komplexe Geschäftsprobleme bietet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stellenübersicht&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die &lt;strong&gt;Life Sciences Practice&lt;/strong&gt; von CRA hilft Pharma-, Biotechnologie-, Medtech- und Digital-Health-Unternehmen, optimale Leistungen in wichtigen Geschäftsbereichen wie kommerzielle Strategie, Preisgestaltung und Zugang, Innovation, Organisationsstruktur, Politikanalyse, medizinische Angelegenheiten, Stakeholder-Management und Marketing zu erzielen – alles zum langfristigen Nutzen von Patienten, Ärzten, Mitarbeitern und Aktionären. Wir arbeiten direkt mit Life-Sciences-Unternehmen sowie mit deren Rechtsberatern, Industrieverbänden, Regierungsorganisationen und Interessengruppen zusammen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unsere spezialisierte Life Sciences Practice bringt Klarheit und Lösungen für komplexe Herausforderungen. Kunden wenden sich an uns, wenn sie die richtige Entscheidung treffen, sie richtig umsetzen und die Zustimmung der wichtigsten Interessengruppen sichern müssen. Ihr Vertrauen in uns beruht auf unserem emphatischen Fokus auf die Kunden und insbesondere auf unserer praktischen Erfahrung in den Life Sciences, unserem tiefgehenden Industriewissen von der Forschung und Entwicklung bis zum Markteintritt und darüber hinaus sowie unseren starken akademischen Qualifikationen in den Bereichen Wissenschaft, Wirtschaft und Betriebswirtschaft.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Das Life Sciences Team von CRA arbeitet von Büros in den USA und Europa aus, um Einblicke in globale Themen und lokale Marktchancen zu bieten und unseren Kunden einen einfachen Zugang zu ermöglichen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Der Einstieg in die Life Sciences Practice bei CRA bietet Ihnen eine einzigartige Gelegenheit, Ihr Wissen über das Gesundheitswesen weltweit zu erweitern. Unser Praktikumsprogramm soll die Analystenerfahrung widerspiegeln und Ihnen ein besseres Verständnis für unser Geschäft und die Art der Arbeit bei Charles River Associates vermitteln.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Praktikanten sind neugierige und analytische Denker, die kreative Ansätze für nicht standardisierte Probleme mitbringen. Sie werden Teil eines integrierten Teams sein, das eine Vielzahl von Beratungsprojekten durchführt und liefert. Typische Aufgaben sind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enge Zusammenarbeit mit erfahrenen Kollegen zur Durchführung von Strategie- und/oder Politik- und Wirtschaftsberatungsprojekten, die spezifische Kundenbedürfnisse adressieren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei unabhängigen Recherchen zur Identifizierung, Sammlung, Verwaltung und Analyse qualitativer Erkenntnisse und quantitativer Daten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Beitrag zu internen Diskussionen, die Erkenntnisse aus dem Analyseprozess aufbauen und Ergebnisse in breitere Projektlieferungen integrieren;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an Telefon- oder persönlichen Interviews mit Kunden oder externen Interessengruppen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung von Abschnitten von Kundenberichten, Präsentationen und anderen Kundenlieferungen (z.B. Excel-Arbeitsmappen) unter der Aufsicht von erfahrenen Teammitgliedern;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proaktive Entwicklung von Wissen über die Life-Sciences-Branche sowie Beratungsmethoden;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teilnahme an praxisbezogenen Aktivitäten (Schulungen, Wissensaustausch usw.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gewünschte Qualifikationen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor-, Master- oder PhD-Studenten mit starker akademischer Leistung von einer erstklassigen Institution mit Schwerpunkt auf Biowissenschaften, Wirtschaft (oder verwandten Fächern wie Betriebswirtschaft, Gesundheitsökonomie und -politik, öffentliche Politik), Naturwissenschaften, Mathematik, Statistik, Ingenieurwesen oder einer anderen quantitativen Disziplin;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse in der Microsoft Office Suite (Word, PowerPoint, Outlook und Excel) sowie Verständnis für Internetrecherchen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in oder starkes Interesse an der Life-Sciences-Branche und dem Gesundheitswesen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Verständnis wirtschaftlicher Konzepte und Geschäftsprozesse sowie Vertrautheit mit wesentlichen Beratungsmethoden, -werkzeugen und -techniken ist sehr hilfreich;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effektive schriftliche und mündliche Kommunikationsfähigkeiten auf Englisch (weitere Sprachen sind von Vorteil);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Starke Selbstmanagementfähigkeiten (Detailorientierung, effektives Zeitmanagement, Fähigkeit zur Priorisierung);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nachgewiesenes hohes Maß an Initiative und Führung;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hervorragende Teamarbeit und Kollaboration;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Klares und nachgewiesenes Interesse an Beratung durch Kursarbeit, Arbeitserfahrung, Aktivitäten oder Teilnahme an CRA-Rekrutierungsveranstaltungen;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bewerbung&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Bewerbungen werden fortlaufend geprüft. Die Dauer des Praktikums beträgt in der Regel vier bis sechs Monate, mit flexiblen Startterminen über das Jahr verteilt. Das Praktikum ist bezahlt, und wir freuen uns über Bewerber, die ab &lt;strong&gt;Mai 2027&lt;/strong&gt; starten können. Um für diese Position berücksichtigt zu werden, reichen Sie bitte die folgenden Unterlagen ein:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lebenslauf – maximal 1 Seite;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anschreiben – Bitte beschreiben Sie Ihr Interesse an CRA und wie diese Rolle zu Ihren Zielen passt. Ihr Anschreiben sollte nicht länger als eine Seite sein und klar sowie professionell präsentiert werden (Mindestschriftgröße 12). Bitte stellen Sie sicher, dass Ihr Anschreiben die folgenden Fragen beantwortet:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Warum Life-Sciences-Consulting und warum CRA?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bitte beschreiben Sie ein Beispiel einer datenbasierte Entscheidung die Sie getroffen haben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Welche Erfahrung aus Ihrem Lebenslauf/CV macht Sie am meisten stolz und warum?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Praktikumsbeginn und – dauer – bitte geben Sie ihr bevorzugtes Anfangsdatum (in 2027) und ihre bevorzugte Praktikumsdauer (4-6 Monate) an&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berufliche Entwicklung&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die robusten Entwicklungsprogramme und Wellness-Programme von CRA ermöglichen es Ihnene, sowohl als Individuum als auch als Teammitglied zu wachsen. Wir bieten Praktikanten eine Vielzahl von technischen Schulungen, Präsentationsfähigkeiten, internen Seminaren und Leistungscoaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilität am Arbeitsplatz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRA schafft ein Arbeitsumfeld, das es unseren Kollegen ermöglicht, von der Zusammenarbeit im Büro zu profitieren, um unser Versprechen von beruflichem Wachstum, Mentoring und Inklusivität bestmöglich zu erfüllen. Gleichzeitig erkennen wir an, dass Einzelpersonen eine Reihe von Vorteilen genießen, wenn sie periodisch von zu Hause aus arbeiten. Derzeit bitten wir Mitarbeiter, im Durchschnitt 3 bis 4 Tage die Woche im Büro zu arbeiten (was Reisen zu einem anderen CRA-Büro oder zum Standort eines Kunden einschließen kann). Des weiteren bitten wir Praktikanten 5 Tage die Woche im Büro zu arbeiten. Zu bestimmten Zeiten des Jahres (z.B. Feiertagsperioden) werden zusätzliche Remote-Arbeitsoptionen für diejenigen angeboten, deren Arbeitsverpflichtungen dies zulassen, obwohl unsere Büros für diejenigen, die dort sein möchten oder müssen, geöffnet bleiben.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unser Engagement für Vielfalt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Charles River Associates ist ein Arbeitgeber, der Chancengleichheit bietet (Equality Act 2010). Im Rahmen unseres Fokus auf Gerechtigkeit und Inklusion arbeiten wir daran, einen fairen und konsistenten Einstellungsprozess sicherzustellen. Wir feiern Vielfalt und sind für ein inklusives Arbeitsumfeld engagiert.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die in dieser Stellenbeschreibung enthaltenen Aussagen sollen die allgemeine Natur und das Niveau der von den Personen in dieser Position ausgeführten Arbeiten beschreiben. Sie sind nicht als vollständige Liste aller Verantwortlichkeiten, Pflichten und Fähigkeiten gedacht, die für das Personal in dieser Position erforderlich sind.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Charles River Associates&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Charles River Associates&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading global consulting firm that provides economic, financial, and business management expertise to major law firms, corporations and governments around the world. CRA advises clients on economic and financial matters pertaining to litigation and regulatory proceedings, and guides corporations through critical business strategy and performance-related issues. Since 1965, clients have engaged CRA for its combination of industry experience and rigorous, fact-based analysis that provide clients with clear, implementable solutions to complex business concerns.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;CRA’s&lt;strong&gt; Life Sciences&lt;/strong&gt; Practice helps pharmaceutical, biotechnology, medical devices and digital health companies achieve optimum performance across key aspects of their business including commercial strategy, pricing and access, innovation, organisation structure, policy analysis, medical affairs, stakeholder management, and reputation, all for the long-term benefit of patients, clinicians, employees, and shareholders. We work with life sciences businesses directly as well as with their legal counsel, industry associations, government organisations, and advocacy groups.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our dedicated Life Sciences Practice brings clarity and solutions to complex challenges. Clients turn to us when they need to make the right decision, implement it the right way, and secure buy-in from key stakeholders. Their trust in us is rooted in our emphatic focus on clients and specifically our hands-on life sciences experience, in-depth sector knowledge, from R&amp;amp;D to market entry and beyond and strong academic credentials in science, economics, and business.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The CRA Life Sciences team operates from offices across the United States and Europe to provide insights on global issues and local market challenges, allowing ease of access for our clients.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Joining the Life Sciences Practice at CRA will provide you with a unique opportunity to develop your knowledge of healthcare globally. Our Internship program is meant to mirror the analyst experience to give you a greater understanding of our business and the type of work that is done at Charles River Associates.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Interns &lt;/strong&gt;are curious and analytical thinkers who bring creative approaches to non-standard problems. They will be a part of an integrated team that executes and delivers across a wide variety of consulting projects. Typical responsibilities may include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with senior colleagues to deliver strategy and/or policy and economic consulting projects that address specific client needs;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support independent research to identify, collect, manage and analyse qualitative insights and quantitative data;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal discussions that build insights from the analytical process and integrating findings into broader project deliverables;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in telephone or face-to-face interviews with clients or external stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate sections of client reports, presentations and other client deliverables (e.g. Excel workbooks) under the supervision of senior team members;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively develop knowledge of the life sciences industry as well as consulting methodologies;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in practice-building activities (training, expertise sharing, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s, Master’s or PhD degree candidates with strong academic performance from a top-tier institution with focused study in biological sciences, economics (or related subjects including business, health economics and policy, public policy), physical sciences, mathematics, statistics, engineering, or another quantitative discipline;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Microsoft Office Suite (Word, PowerPoint, Outlook and Excel), plus an understanding of how to conduct internet research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with, or keen interest in, the Life Sciences industry and healthcare;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of economic concepts and business processes, as well as familiarity with essential consulting methodologies, tools and techniques is very helpful;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective written communication and oral presentation English skills (additional languages helpful);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong self-management (detail orientation, effective time management, ability to prioritise);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated high level of initiative and leadership;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent teamwork and collaboration capabilities;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear and demonstrated interest in consulting through coursework, work experience, activities, or attendance at CRA recruiting events;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;To Apply&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applications will be reviewed on a rolling basis. The internship duration is usually four to six months, with flexible start dates throughout the year. The internship is paid, and we welcome candidates who are available to start&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;from May 2027 onwards&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;To be considered for this position, please submit the following items:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resume – at most 1 page;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cover letter – please describe your interest in CRA and how this role matches your goals. Your cover letter should be no more than one page, and presented in a clear, professional manner (minimum font size 12). &amp;nbsp;Please ensure your cover letter answers the following questions: &amp;nbsp;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Why life sciences consulting, and why CRA? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;What is an example of a time when you made a data-guided decision? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Which experience from your resume/CV are you most proud of and why? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferred internship dates – please submit your preferred internship start date (in 2027) and your preferred internship duration (4-6 months)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Professional Development&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;CRA’s robust &lt;strong&gt;skills development programs &lt;/strong&gt;and &lt;strong&gt;wellness programming&lt;/strong&gt; encourage you to thrive as an individual and team member. We provide interns a variety of technical training, presentation skills, internal seminars, and performance coaching.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location Flexibility&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;CRA creates a work environment that enables our colleagues to benefit from being together in the office to best deliver on our promise of career growth, mentorship and inclusivity. At the same time, we recognise that individuals realise a range of benefits when working from home periodically. We currently ask that individuals spend 3 to 4 days a week on average working in the office (which may include traveling to another CRA office or to a client&#39;s location). We also ask that interns spend 5 days a week working in the office. At certain times of the year (e.g. holiday periods), additional remote work options are offered to those whose work commitments permit it, although our offices remain open for those who choose or need to be there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Charles River Associates is an equal opportunity employer (Equality Act 2010). As part of our focus on equity and inclusion, we work to ensure a fair and consistent hiring process. We celebrate diversity and we are committed to an inclusive work environment.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;The statements included in this job description are intended to describe the general nature and level of work being performed by people assigned to this job. They are not intended to be an exhaustive list of all responsibilities, duties and skills required of personnel so classified.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Energy Exemplar&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In an era where the world is rapidly advancing towards a cleaner future through decarbonization, Energy Exemplar’s mission lies in ‘Empowering Transformative Energy Decisions’. Founded in 1999 in Adelaide, Australia, our award-winning software portfolio encompassing the modeling and simulation platform PLEXOS®, Aurora, and Adapt2, is trusted by innovative organizations across the globe. Through our technology and people, we strive to enable stakeholders from across the entire energy value chain to revolutionize the energy ecosystem and to collaboratively plan and execute for a sustainable energy future with unprecedented clarity, speed, and innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our impact is global and is being recognized across the industry. Some of our recent accolades include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;SaaS Company of the Year (2025) – Global Business Tech Awards.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Environmental Impact Award (2025) – E+E Leaders Awards.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;IPPAI (Independent Power Producers Association of India) Power Awards (2025) - Winners&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Finalist: Platts Global Energy Awards (2024) – Grid Edge category&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Finalist: Reuters Global Energy Transition Awards (2024) – Technologies of Change&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Top 50 Marketing Team (2024) – Voted by the public at the ICON Awards.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Energy Exemplar is growing fast and that growth is driven by how we work. We trust our team to deliver great results from wherever they work best, whether that’s at home, in the office, or on the move.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a global team that values ownership, integrity, and innovation. You’ll be supported to balance work and life in a way that works for you, and empowered to take initiative, solve problems, and make an impact, regardless of your background, location, or role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our four core values, Customer Success, One Global Team, Integrity &amp;amp; Ownership, and Innovation Excellence aren’t just words. They show up in how we collaborate, how we solve, and how we grow together.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About the Position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Energy Exemplar is looking for an ambitious enterprise sales professional who thrives on opening doors, building pipeline and winning new customers. Owning Germany, Austria and Switzerland, you will drive new-logo growth in a strategically important region, helping energy organisations make better decisions through market simulation, modelling and analytics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Regional Sales Director, you will have ownership of your territory and the full sales cycle. From identifying your next target account to securing executive engagement and closing complex enterprise agreements, you will turn market opportunity into revenue. Your customers will include utilities, power producers,&amp;nbsp; renewable developers and network operators facing some of the energy sector’s most significant commercial challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role requires a hunter who creates opportunities, challenging established thinking and earning a place at the decision making table. You will combine a clear territory strategy with consistent, hands-on prospecting, building your own pipeline and maintaining the momentum needed to win competitive deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;7&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Win new customers:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Take accountability for new-logo acquisition across DACH, consistently achieving or exceeding individual sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
