&lt;li&gt;A track record of managing complex sales cycles within industrial organisations and securing strategic deals by understanding both technical requirements and industrial use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate large, multi-site industrial organisations and procurement processes, building consensus among diverse stakeholders including executives, operations and engineering leadership, and IT departments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience negotiating complex agreements within industrial procurement frameworks, including supplier onboarding, security and data governance reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently to various industrial audiences, from plant and engineering managers to senior executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of industrial buying cycles, decision-making processes, and key pain points, including the regulatory, safety and sustainability pressures industrial businesses operate within&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing the industrial market combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems and their applications. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely and ethically for industrial use&lt;/li&gt;
