&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Highly analytical and fluent in using analytics platforms to derive customer insights and back product decisions with hard data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Languages &amp;amp; Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Fluent in English (written and spoken) with concise communication and synthesis skills; French is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;27,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Passion:&lt;/strong&gt; Excited by scalable customer-facing architecture, seamless digital-to-physical omnichannel journeys, and driven by a strong passion for sports !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;29&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;30&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Flexible Remote Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid model with 2 days of remote work per week (flexible).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Work Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based at our Decathlon Digital hubs in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;54&quot;&gt;Lille&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;63&quot;&gt;Paris&lt;/strong&gt;, France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Choice of Equipment:&lt;/strong&gt; Mac or Windows&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Impact &amp;amp; Career Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; High-visibility leadership role at the core of Decathlon&#39;s customer strategy, offering structured mentorship, continuous upskilling, and international mobility paths.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Financial Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt; Comprehensive remuneration package including employee shareholding options (&lt;em data-path-to-node=&quot;30,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;96&quot;&gt;actionnariat salarié&lt;/em&gt;), as well as monthly and quarterly performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;32&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Inclusion and Accessibility&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;33&quot;&gt;At Decathlon, we recognize the immense value that diversity brings to our teams, and we continuously strive to foster and cultivate an inclusive and equitable workplace: which is why Inclusion is one of our Human Fundamentals. We encourage people from all backgrounds and abilities to apply, as we firmly believe that diversity of thought, culture, identity, and lived experience makes us stronger.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;34&quot;&gt;Decathlon is also committed to offering an inclusive and accessible selection process to all candidates. Should you require any accommodations, you can request them via the application form, and your request will remain confidential. These requests do not affect the outcome of the recruitment process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Context &amp;amp; project&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Decathlon’s mission is to bring people together through sport to make wellbeing accessible for all. Fulfilling this mission requires design excellence at both ends of our digital experience: for the millions of sports lovers using our customer apps and websites, and for the thousands of teammates who rely on our tools in stores, warehouses, and offices to do their jobs every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital design plays a pivotal role in supporting Decathlon’s growth and human connection. How? By ensuring our digital tools are simple, reliable, and enjoyable, and by giving our design community the shared foundations, systems, and practices they need to deliver the best possible experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this context, we’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Design Senior Manager &lt;/strong&gt;within the Product Center of Excellence (CoE) to lead our core design capabilities, provide thought leadership on the future of our craft, and support our design community across Decathlon Digital.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Design Leader, you will have a dual mission: you will directly manage the Design System team and the Design &amp;amp; Research Ops team, while functionally leading and inspiring the community of digital product designers embedded across our different business domains (eCommerce, Store apps, Supply Chain, and internal platforms) and countries. You will also steer how design evolves at Decathlon in the era of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Digital Design Leader, you will act as a strategic partner at Decathlon Digital to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage and develop your direct teams &lt;/strong&gt;(Design System and Design &amp;amp; Research Ops): set their priorities, support their professional growth, and ensure their work delivers tangible value to Decathlon teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead our Design System&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure its relevance across all digital touchpoints by catering to the specific needs of B2C, E2E, and B2B products, as well as sports experiences. Measure its adoption and its contribution to team efficiency and experience quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Design &amp;amp; Research Ops&lt;/strong&gt;: ensure that tools, methods, and operational frameworks meet real team needs, are effectively adopted, and tangibly contribute to operational efficiency and the quality of product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support and coach our design teammates functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; clarify career paths, structure onboarding programs, drive upskilling, and foster synergies and best-practice sharing across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion a forward-looking vision for design and its practices&lt;/strong&gt;, especially in the era of AI, through active industry monitoring and experimentation with emerging practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create the conditions for active community contribution &lt;/strong&gt;to the evolution of our tools, standards, and practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build strong partnerships with Product and Engineering leaders&lt;/strong&gt; to advocate for design excellence, digital accessibility (RGAA / WCAG), eco-design, and business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hard skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Around 8-10 years of experience in digital design&lt;/strong&gt;, gained within complex, international product environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven track record in direct management&lt;/strong&gt;, ideally leading hybrid profiles (designers, engineers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;, with a demonstrated ability to influence, advise, and align senior stakeholders (Directors, business teams, tech, and product).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep understanding and strong awareness of current digital design challenges&lt;/strong&gt;, particularly regarding Artificial Intelligence (AI) and eco-design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in both written and spoken French and English is required&lt;/strong&gt; to thrive in an international environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviors / Soft skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence without authority&lt;/strong&gt; — Build trust, inspire teams with a forward-looking vision, and rally decentralized designers, product managers, and engineering leaders around shared standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Work closely with diverse domains (Omni, Supply Chain, Sports, Core Platforms), listening to their specific operational realities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design collaboration&lt;/strong&gt; — Foster an open, generous craft culture where teams share work early, learn from failures, and help each other grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — Stay curious and grounded, proactively developing yourself and others while turning challenges into positive learning moments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The CoE might be a perfect match for you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love enabling other designers and seeing teams succeed thanks to your support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy both direct team management and leading a wider community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are excited about the future of design and passionate about demystifying AI into practical, human-centered practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You like bringing clarity to complex environments and building simple, scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You want to play a key role in elevating design excellence across Decathlon Digital!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: 2 days of remote work per week;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work locations: Ability to work from any Decathlon Digital office in Lille or Paris&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality gear: Equipment provided in line with your mission and our social commitments (Mac, Windows, or Chromebooks);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global reach: A local project team within a worldwide network (offering international career opportunities);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skill development: Continuous growth and support (diverse projects, technical certifications from year one, internal and external training, etc.);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation package: Competitive package (employee profit-sharing, monthly/quarterly bonuses).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL CONTEXT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What if technology allowed us to push the boundaries and take sports experiences to new levels? That&#39;s exactly our goal at Decathlon Digital! We are a team of 5,000+ experts in software engineering, product management, data, cloud, and cybersecurity, distributed across Paris, Lille, and Amsterdam. Together, we are creating the largest digital sports platform, leveraging tech innovation from design to value chain optimization, connected experiences and product second life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changing the game for good&lt;/strong&gt;. We are in this for the love of sports. And like everything we love, we want it to last. That’s why we are embarking on a journey to create a more sustainable tech model, reducing our direct environmental impact while maintaining a safe, diverse, and inclusive space for all our people to learn and thrive together. Team up with us to design the digital future of sports.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Telnyx is an industry leader that&#39;s not just imagining the future of global connectivity—we&#39;re building it. From architecting and amplifying the reach of a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/our-network&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;private, global, multi-cloud IP network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, to bringing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://telnyx.com/resources/about-edge-connectivity&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hyperlocal edge&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; technology right to your fingertips through intuitive APIs, we&#39;re shaping a new era of seamless interconnection between people, devices, and applications.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re driven by a desire to transform and modernize what&#39;s antiquated, automate the manual, and solve real-world problems through innovative connectivity solutions. As a testament to our success, we&#39;re proud to stand as a financially stable and profitable company. Our robust profitability allows us not only to invest in pioneering technologies but also to foster an environment of continuous learning and growth for our team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our collective vision is a world where borderless connectivity fuels limitless innovation. By joining us, you can be part of laying the foundations for this interconnected future. We&#39;re currently seeking passionate individuals who are excited about the opportunity to contribute to an industry-shaping company while growing their own skills and careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Director or VP of Product Marketing to lead that effort globally. This is a senior, hands-on role for someone who can connect deep technical understanding with positioning, distribution and commercial results. The title will reflect the experience and scope of the person we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A good product story matters, but a story alone isn&#39;t enough. The person in this role needs to turn our infrastructure into clear customer problems we solve, compelling reasons to choose Telnyx and practical ways to try it. A great sample application, integration or reference architecture can do more than another 30-slide deck. So can a precise message that reaches a developer at the moment they are deciding how to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work across Product, Engineering, Developer Relations, Sales and Marketing to bring those pieces together. You&#39;ll help shape what we launch, how we explain it, how buyers discover it and how our field teams take it to market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll build&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coherent product story. Own positioning, segmentation and competitive differentiation across AI inference, Voice AI, agent and edge infrastructure, communications, networking and wireless. Make the full platform understandable without flattening the technical details that make it valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solutions people can actually use. Drive the packaging of sample apps, reference architectures, integrations, templates and working demos that prove what the infrastructure makes possible. Build repeatable plays for use cases such as contact centers, agent assist and industry-specific workflows. These should accelerate adoption and enterprise sales, not become disconnected software products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distribution that reaches technical buyers. Shape how we win discovery through product pages, developer content, SEO, answer engine optimization (AEO), technical communities and paid acquisition. You won&#39;t necessarily operate every campaign, but you must understand the mechanics deeply enough to direct them: search and answer-engine visibility, technical site structure, intent, targeting, conversion paths, attribution and economics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A field-ready commercial engine. Give enterprise sellers, FDEs and solutions teams the pitches, discovery frameworks, architecture diagrams, competitive proof, demos and ROI narratives they need to generate and advance opportunities. Translate platform capabilities into buying reasons for developers, technical executives and enterprise decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launches that translate into adoption. Work with Product and Engineering early, not after something ships. Choose the audience, packaging and launch strategy, then measure activation, qualified demand, field utilization and downstream pipeline. Build an operating cadence that keeps pace with a rapidly changing roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-native PMM team. Use AI research tools, coding assistants, agents and automation as part of everyday work to accelerate market research, competitive analysis, messaging tests, content production, demo development and go-to-market execution. Know when to trust those tools, how to evaluate outputs and where human technical judgment still matters. Lead the team to operate the same way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;ll measure success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ultimate measure is pipeline. Not the number of launches, assets, impressions or campaigns. We expect this leader to partner closely with Demand Generation and Sales to create measurable, qualified pipeline, improve conversion and accelerate opportunities. Product marketing should be able to show how specific product narratives, solutions, integrations and programs contribute to commercial results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Early wins will look like a dramatically clearer platform story; a small number of flagship use cases with runnable demos and integrations; sellers using consistent, technically credible plays; stronger discovery and conversion from search, AEO and paid channels; and a repeatable link from product launches to adoption and pipeline. We care about what works and scales, not activity for its own sake.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve led product marketing for a complex B2B technical platform, ideally in AI infrastructure, developer tools, APIs, cloud, networking or communications. You can be strategic without becoming removed from the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are technically fluent. You can understand architecture, work with APIs or SDKs, interrogate a latency or cost claim and talk comfortably with engineers. You don&#39;t have to be a production engineer, but you need to know when a demo is real and when it&#39;s just a pitch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand modern technical acquisition. You&#39;re credible directing AEO, SEO, paid programs and developer-focused content, and can connect channel-level metrics to funnel economics and qualified pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re already effective with AI tools and agents in your own work. You experiment, build workflows and use the technology to move faster. Familiarity with the limitations and evaluation of AI-generated outputs is as important as enthusiasm for the tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You write exceptionally well, have strong instincts for enterprise sales, and know how to turn a complex product advantage into a clear reason to buy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve built or led strong teams, can prioritize across competing launches and products, and enjoy working directly with product leaders and technical builders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telecom experience is not required. Technical curiosity, taste, speed and a track record of generating commercial impact matter more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Telnyx&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to shape the market narrative for a company that owns the underlying network, communications and compute infrastructure it sells. The platform is real, customers are deploying it in production, and the commercial opportunity is substantial. You&#39;ll have direct access to senior leadership and the ability to build a PMM function measured by its contribution to growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Telnyx is an equal opportunity employer. We welcome applicants from different backgrounds and evaluate candidates based on the skills and experience relevant to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Are you comfortable navigating complex software systems, working with coding agents, and defining what makes developer tools actually useful? Do you want to shape how developers and AI work together inside IDEs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About JetBrains&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We create intelligent software development tools for developers and teams. More than 15 million users, over 300,000 companies, and 88 of the Fortune Global Top 100 rely on our products to solve real, complex problems. Our mission is simple: make development teams more productive and AI adoptable at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agentic development is changing how software gets built. Developers no longer just chat with AI – they delegate tasks, run parallel agent sessions, and steer autonomous changes. As agents take on more work, reviewing and owning the output is becoming the hardest part of the process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;JetBrains Air is our open system for agentic development. It brings tools like Codex, GitHub Copilot, Claude Agent, Gemini, and Junie directly into JetBrains IDEs, providing an agentic-first user experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead key areas of Air. You’ll take ownership of high-impact workflows, work closely with cross-functional teams (including software engineers, designers, ML researchers, analysts, DevRel, and product marketing), and turn technical complexity into clear product direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take end-to-end ownership of key parts of Air in JetBrains IDEs, driving work from problem framing and discovery to delivery, adoption, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and refine core agentic workflows, including task delegation, session monitoring, steering, and code review.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model complex user flows, system states, permissions, and integration schemes to guide engineering and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a transparent roadmap that balances quick improvements with long-term strategic investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define telemetry, design experiments, analyze product data, and make evidence-based roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Study how developers interact with leading AI agents and tools to inform product priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with the Agent Client Protocol (ACP) ecosystem and collaborate with partners building on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with enterprise sales and support teams to address governance, privacy, and control requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems-thinking mindset that easily breaks down complex architectures, workflows, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven approach to product decisions, including hands-on experience querying and analyzing telemetry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active personal experience using coding agents and clear perspectives on where current AI tools succeed and fail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product intuition for complex technical user experiences and developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise, and collaborative communication skills with the ability to explain complex technical concepts simply and build alignment across diverse groups of stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort navigating fast-changing technical landscapes with high ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience shipping end-user products as a product manager or in a similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical grounding in software development workflows, including IDEs, git, code review, CI/CD, and package management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on technical background sufficient to collaborate closely with software and ML engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of core AI and agent concepts, including tool use, protocols (MCP/ACP), context retrieval, evaluations, and latency/cost trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write SQL or Python to analyze product metrics and experiment results independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, both written and spoken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What success looks like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your first 6 to 12 months, success in this role means:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving measurable growth in active Air users and improving weekly/monthly retention (D7/D30).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Increasing agent session completion rates and the proportion of agent-generated changes accepted by developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establishing clear, telemetry-backed decisions across your product roadmap areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delivering validated product hypotheses consistently each quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing directly to JetBrains AI revenue growth and overall IDE value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join JetBrains?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong base salary – We offer competitive pay that reflects your skills and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible work schedule – Enjoy the freedom to work from home or from the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra time off – More days to relax, recharge, and do the things you love.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning and development opportunities – Access to conferences, courses, and language classes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free meals and snacks – Lunch and refreshments provided to keep you fueled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and wellness – On-site gyms or sports club stipends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal events – Company-wide celebrations and team gatherings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like a challenge you&#39;d enjoy, send us your resume and a short note on why you&#39;re interested in Air.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-KL1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We know great ideas can come from anyone, anywhere. That’s why we do our best to create an open and inclusive workplace – one that welcomes everyone regardless of their background, identity, religion, age, accessibility needs, or orientation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;We process the data provided in your job application in accordance with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/privacy/privacy-recruitment/&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;(FEQ128R42)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the technical leader and lead architect for one of Databricks&#39; most strategic global customers: a health technology company whose diagnostic, therapy, connected-care and consumer health products reach hundreds of millions of people every year. You will own the technical relationship and the Data + AI vision for a single complex enterprise that spans multiple business units, regions and regulatory regimes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The account is a large, Azure-first Data Intelligence Platform customer. It runs a portfolio of well over a hundred use cases across business units and global functions, delivered as a multi-year program in quarterly releases. You will set the technical direction for that program and turn it into an executable roadmap. You will work as one team with the Account Executive and a dedicated pod of Solutions Architects, specialists, Professional Services and partners. We are looking for a visionary who can see where Data + AI will take health technology, explain that clearly to executives and engineers alike, and bring a large, distributed group of people with them!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You Will Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and drive the technical vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the customer&#39;s enterprise Data + AI vision with CxO and VP stakeholders, tied directly to business priorities. Be the executive suite&#39;s trusted advisor on platform strategy, build-vs-buy, responsible AI and regulated-industry governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Show, don&#39;t tell: inspire CTOs, chief architects and engineering leaders with working examples, and build prototypes yourself when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the account pod technically: set direction for Solutions Architects, Specialist and Delivery SAs, Professional Services and partners, and coach them to raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Account Executive on account strategy and consumption planning, owning technical strategy and path to value for every major initiative.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align pre-sales, delivery and partners so the customer sees one Databricks team, one plan and one escalation path, local to global. Lead discovery and solution design for strategic, high-risk deployments, driving each to production and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build lasting C-level, VP and Director relationships across IT, data &amp;amp; AI, R&amp;amp;D, Quality &amp;amp; Regulatory, Service, Operations and the business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the customer&#39;s voice internally, shaping Databricks product and go-to-market strategy with field insight while leading the account&#39;s largest modernisation programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale GenAI and agentic AI from pilot to production across business units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build partner ecosystem relationships (GSIs, ISVs, hyperscalers) to scale delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable IP (reference designs, accelerators, talks, blogs) for the wider Databricks health and life sciences community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Look For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;(Note: it is not expected that you “tick every box” below and encourage you to apply if you are meeting several of the key criteria and can demonstrate a strong ability to transfer skills and develop quickly in the role!) &amp;nbsp; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record as lead technical figure on a large global enterprise account, or as enterprise/chief architect at a similar organisation, owning the vision over multiple years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading virtual teams without direct authority: setting direction, coaching senior architects and aligning specialists, delivery and partners on one plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives with high autonomy in ambiguous, high-stakes, multi-region, multi-business-unit environments. Excellent communicator, from boardroom to engineering floor, with clear written thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in data engineering, analytics, ML or AI architecture, with significant customer-facing technical leadership (pre-sales, consulting or enterprise architecture).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep, hands-on expertise in modern data and AI platforms; Apache Spark, Delta Lake and Databricks experience is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Large-scale data platforms and migrations from legacy warehouses, Hadoop or other clouds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise governance and security models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Production ML, MLOps, GenAI and agent systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to win platform decisions against hyperscaler-native and competing platforms on architecture, cost and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Python and SQL; able to prototype quickly, including with AI-assisted development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain knowledge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in health technology, medical devices, life sciences or another regulated industry, and a passion for improving patient outcomes with Data + AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of MedTech and medical AI regulation:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU MDR/IVDR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;FDA SaMD and Predetermined Change Control Plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ISO 13485, IEC 62304 and ISO 14971&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU AI Act requirements for high-risk medical AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of privacy and data-sharing regimes (GDPR, HIPAA, European Health Data Space). Familiarity with healthcare data standards (DICOM, HL7, FHIR, OMOP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with or at a global MedTech, health technology or diagnostics company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing validated, audit-ready (GxP / 21 CFR Part 11) data and AI environments. Enterprise-scale SAP data integration (BW, S/4HANA) and semantic harmonisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public thought leadership: conference talks, publications or open source.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dutch is a plus; professional English required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ427R122&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the Data and AI space. Our customers rely on us to drive the accelerated innovation needed to stay ahead in today’s highly competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Named Enterprise Hunter Account Executive to join the team to maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks across Benelux. Reporting to the Director of Enterprise Sales, you will be responsible for driving strategic growth and expanding our footprint across the region’s most critical enterprise accounts. This role is hybrid, based in Amsterdam.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess your list of assigned accounts and develop a strategy to execute against it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a customer base, identifying and closing new logo opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead your customers and partners to identify impactful big data and AI use cases whilst proving out their value on the Databricks Lakehouse platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify land opportunities and develop the expand / consumption use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate and utilise internal teams to maximise the impact on your ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build exceptional value with all engagements to guide successful negotiations to close point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 4+ years of experience selling SaaS solutions to Enterprise Customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience and strong performance in new logo hunting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in Big Data, Cloud, or SaaS industries with some technical sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successful experience selling complex software deals and quota over-achievement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of consumption based land and expand sales models is advantageous&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the Data &amp;amp; AI space with some technology sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of creating demand that delivered substantial business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of following robust sales methodologies and process, e.g. account planning, MEDDPICC, Value Selling and accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building effective champions, collaborative teams and partnerships to support execution of your territory plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to identify all key uses cases and buying centres in an opportunity to increase the impact of Databricks in an organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of the Benelux territory and customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in business English and Dutch&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1800&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Anduril&#39;s global communications team is responsible for shaping how the world understands modern defense technology—and why it matters. We&#39;re seeking a Director of Communications, Europe, to build and lead Anduril&#39;s external communications presence across the continent.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role based in Amsterdam, reporting to the VP of Global Communications, with a dotted line to Anduril&#39;s European General Manager. You will be Anduril&#39;s first dedicated communications hire in Europe, responsible for standing up a regional program from scratch, building relationships with media and institutions, and developing the narratives that will define Anduril&#39;s reputation across the world&#39;s most consequential defense markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a builder role. You&#39;ll set strategy and execute it yourself, establish agency and contractor networks as the business grows, and work shoulder-to-shoulder with business development, policy, and senior leadership to earn Anduril a place in Europe&#39;s defense conversation. The ideal candidate has deep roots across multiple European markets, understands how defense, technology, and industrial policy intersect at the national level, and knows how to build presence and credibility in environments where trust is earned slowly and reputation matters enormously.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Anduril&#39;s European communications program from the ground up, developing strategy, establishing infrastructure, and executing across markets with varying levels of maturity and priority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive media relations across defense, technology, business, and policy outlets in priority European markets, building the relationships and pipelines that will sustain long-term coverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute market-specific narrative strategies that connect Anduril&#39;s mission and capabilities to each country&#39;s defense priorities, industrial ambitions, and security context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Anduril&#39;s European General Manager and business development teams to support market entry, customer engagement, partnerships, and key events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a network of regional agencies and contractors as European operations expand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with global communications, policy, and marketing teams to adapt core messaging for European audiences without losing coherence or accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage think tanks, research institutions, and policy communities to build credibility and shape the broader discourse around defense innovation and allied cooperation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own metrics and reporting frameworks to track progress and demonstrate impact across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in communications, public affairs, or media relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in the European defense and political landscape across multiple countries, how decisions get made, who shapes opinion, and where the conversation is heading.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building communications programs in new markets, not just inheriting them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, contractors, and regional communications networks across borders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional writing and strategic thinking, with the ability to develop narratives that land across cultures and audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working autonomously in an early-stage market environment, with the judgment to make calls without a lot of process around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;x_x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll excel in this role if you:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built something before, a market presence, a regional program, a communications function, and know what that actually requires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can hold complexity: different countries, different threat perceptions, different industrial interests, all requiring distinct approaches under a coherent strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know Europe&#39;s defense ecosystem personally, the journalists, the institutions, the officials who shape how these conversations evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Are energized by the moment Europe is in, and want to help shape how one of the most important defense technology companies in the world shows up in it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Anduril, we invest in our people. Our comprehensive, competitive benefits package (available at little to no cost to employees) ensures you’re supported in health, recovery, and whatever comes next.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For more information, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anduril.com/careers&quot;&gt;Explore Our Benefits&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protecting Yourself from Recruitment Scams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;Anduril is committed to maintaining the integrity of our Talent acquisition process and the security of our candidates. We&#39;ve observed a rise in sophisticated phishing and fraudulent schemes where individuals impersonate Anduril representatives, luring job seekers with false interviews or job offers. These scammers often attempt to extract payment or sensitive personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;RichText column2&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;To ensure your safety and help you navigate your job search with confidence, please keep the following critical points in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;No Financial Requests:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Anduril will never solicit payment or demand personal financial details (such as banking information, credit card numbers, or social security numbers) at any stage of our hiring process. Our legitimate recruitment is entirely free for candidates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please always verify communications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct from Anduril: If you receive an email from one of our recruiters, it will &lt;em&gt;only&lt;/em&gt; come from an ----- address.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Via Agency Partner: If contacted by a recruiting agency for an Anduril role, their email will clearly identify their agency. If you suspect any suspicious activity, please verify the agency&#39;s authenticity by reaching out to &lt;a ----------
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exercise Caution with Unsolicited Outreach:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you receive any communication that appears suspicious, contains grammatical errors, or makes unusual requests, do not engage. Always confirm the sender&#39;s email domain is ----- before providing any personal information or clicking on links.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;detailElios&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to Do If You Suspect Fraud:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Should you encounter any questionable or fraudulent outreach claiming to be from Anduril, please report it immediately to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- Your proactive caution is invaluable in protecting your personal information and upholding the security and trustworthiness of our recruitment efforts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive, you will accelerate SentinelOne&#39;s growth across large accounts in DACH. You will manage complex, high-impact sales cycles and deliver cybersecurity solutions that create real, long-term value for your accounts. Combining strategic thinking with sharp execution, you will use MEDDICC to navigate complex organisations and align our technology to their most critical business and security priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;What Will You Do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and expand direct sales opportunities within strategic accounts across DACH, targeting local state authorities, public health organisations, and critical infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and nurture strong, long-term relationships with key stakeholders and senior decision-makers to drive sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Lead complex sales cycles and present SentinelOne&#39;s cybersecurity solutions to C-level executives, supported by a dedicated sales engineer and channel partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive growth through partner-led initiatives, including managed security services and strategic alliances, while collaborating with marketing and product teams on lead generation and go-to-market campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Represent and champion SentinelOne&#39;s technology in the broader market, participate in key industry events, and consistently uphold sales excellence through best practices and operational discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;What Skills and Knowledge Will You Bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;[li_&amp;amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Fluent written and spoken German and English, with the ability to communicate effectively across all levels of an organization, including C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;5+ years of consistent, above-quota sales success as a regional sales executive or manager, ideally selling enterprise or endpoint security solutions using MEDDICC or similar methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Proven enterprise sales experience with an established network of senior decision-makers and a strong understanding of modern cybersecurity solutions and their business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience collaborating with channel partners and executing a channel-centric go-to-market approach, including managed security services and strategic alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Exceptional organizational, forecasting, and reporting abilities, combined with a driven, curious mindset and a &quot;whatever it takes&quot; attitude to achieve and exceed ambitious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]&quot;&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical and insurance benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accident insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work-from-home &amp;amp; internet allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This U.S. role has a base pay range plus commissions that will vary based on the location of the candidate. The range posted here is the on-target earnings (OTE) for this position, inclusive of base salary and commissions. For some locations, a different pay range may apply.&amp;nbsp; If so, this range will be provided to you during the recruiting process. You can also reach out to the recruiter with any questions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;On Target Earnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$124,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$170,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is transforming how organizations protect their people and places with an integrated, privacy-sensitive AI-powered platform that includes solutions for video security, access control, air quality sensors, alarms, intercoms, and visitor management.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve got serious momentum in the market: more than 30,000 customers (including 100+ of the Fortune 500), &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/03/verkada-capitalg-valuation-security.html&quot;&gt;a $5.8B valuation&lt;/a&gt;, more than $1 billion in annualized bookings, and backing from CapitalG, Sequoia Capital, General Catalyst, Felicis Ventures, Next47 and more. Physical AI is one of the most consequential technology shifts of our time, and Verkada is at the center of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can look at all kinds of communities to see our platform’s impact in the world. It&#39;s the retailer that uses our agentic AI to deter theft before it happens. The warehouse that uses AI-powered alerts to make sure its team is protected on the floor with proper PPE. The school that’s alerted to a threat in real-time and triggers a lockdown in seconds, not minutes. We’re rapidly scaling this impact: today, more than 2 million Verkada devices are deployed across 170+ countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is currently searching for a talented and ambitious sales representative to grow out our Enterprise function from the ground up in the DACH region. You would be directly responsible for a territory with a big untapped market of enterprise customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is building a world-class sales organization. Our business requires highly motivated and capable sales professionals. We prioritize drive and demonstrated success in whatever sales role you’ve been in before — we care far less about fancy pedigrees, schools, or a resume with “brand name” companies. We have a fun, positive culture of success, reward and professional and personal growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and close new business to consistently meet or exceed quarterly sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an intimate understanding of Verkada products and their place in the industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the full sales cycle: Prospect for new customers, host online demos, create proposals, and close deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate pipeline management with expert-level forecasting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aggressively exceed goals consisting of outbound phone calls, emails, online demos, and trials every quarter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor and subject matter expert to customers and channel partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market/client feedback to Verkada’s product/engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be “the CEO” of your territory - work successfully with your virtual team across channel, marketing and inside sales to drive growth and performance for all the above!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10+ years of quota-exceeding sales experience working for a technology vendor selling Enterprise solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling B2B solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of developing a greenfield territory, adding net new logos in an Enterprise solution role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hunter mentality with strong sales DNA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive customer network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS/BA degree strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German &amp;amp; English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Germany Employee Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verkada is committed to fostering a workplace environment that prioritizes the holistic health and wellbeing of our employees and their families by offering comprehensive wellness perks and resources. Our perks programs include, but are not limited to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave policy &amp;amp; fertility benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off to relax and recharge through our paid holidays, 30 days annual leave, generous time off, and personal sick time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness/fitness benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car &amp;amp; Gas assistance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Verkada Is An Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, Verkada is committed to providing employment opportunities to all individuals. All applicants for positions at Verkada will be treated without regard to race, color, ethnicity, religion, sex, gender, gender identity and expression, sexual orientation, national origin, disability, age, marital status, veteran status, pregnancy, or any other basis prohibited by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your application will be handled in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.verkada.com/privacy/candidate-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://url.uk.m.mimecastprotect.com/s/E_spClO3Ac9pX43h9dXa8/&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1719327847319000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw10eB41dX5dzNP9yveIJLsf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR FUTURE, ON DEMAND&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal blend of stability and flexibility. A genuinely human employer that cares for people and the planet. True autonomy to shape what comes next, for us and you. This is the perfect platform to take your career where you want.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Back in 2005, we pioneered Europe’s first TV streaming service. Today, we&#39;re a leading TV streaming provider with millions of monthly users, and since 2021 we&#39;ve been ClimatePartner-certified. Over 200 colleagues of 47 nationalities. We’re the grown-up start-up, helping to shape a better future since day one.&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;That hasn’t changed, even if the world has. We’re friendly, international, inclusive – and our people say we’re reliable and transparent, too. It’s why they trust us and believe in what we do.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Programmatic Sales GSA, you will be responsible for the automated and data-driven sale of our digital advertising inventory (primarily video and CTV) and report directly to the Director Sales All Markets. You will manage programmatic bookings, oversee the planning, implementation and optimisation of our initiatives to boost revenue in programmatic sales, and will therefore also be directly responsible for the optimisation and smooth, technical implementation of campaigns. This makes you the primary point of contact for agency trading desks in the GSA region regarding preferred deals and PMP strategies. You’ll also help with SSP and header bidding integrations and act as the link between Sales, Tech and AdOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ADS TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Ads Team is a small but highly efficient team that combines technology and marketing to win customers over in the long term. With a presence in two countries (based in Berlin, Hamburg and Zurich) and operations in six countries, the Ads Team is a key driver of growth within Zattoo and has established itself as the market leader in CTV in Switzerland within a year.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acquisition of new customers, advice, support and guide media agencies, trading desks and direct clients through our programmatic possibilities in a way they can understand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drawing up and negotiating bespoke programme packages, private deals or preferred deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maximise inventory revenue, skilfully manage floor prices (minimum prices) and analyse delivery rates and CPMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with regional sales teams in GSA to consult clients and pitch programmatic solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead the technical and commercial setup of Header Bidding and additional SSP integrations for CTV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;First-line technical ownership of programmatic delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical errors during delivery, analyse tracking issues and check campaign set-ups: troubleshoot deal delivery, floor pricing, and DSP configuration issues (e.g., SSAI, VAST responses, pod management, DSP/SSP bid stream mismatches).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain complex technical matters in simple terms to non-technical customers or internal departments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in Programmatic Advertising, SSP Management, or Programmatic Account Management (strong experience in CTV/Video)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record in the sales of digital advertising products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of Google Ad Manager, DSP/SSP workflows, OpenRTB specs, and deal types (Preferred Deals, PMP, PG)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong technical familiarity with Header Bidding frameworks (e.g., Prebid) and SSP integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong network or understanding of the DACH Agency Trading Desk landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent, strong communicator, able to work under pressure, with strong negotiation skills&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Teamplayer and creative thinker with a questioning mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WHY JOIN US?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Zattoo, you’re always on firm ground with real freedom to explore. You’ll have the support and opportunity you need to go far, while you’re helping us create a sustainable and entertainment-filled future for all.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reward&lt;/strong&gt;: strong market competitive salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recharge&lt;/strong&gt;: 30 days vacation plus public holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulate&lt;/strong&gt;: &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;trust based flexible working hours and the option for remote work worldwide for up to 8 weeks per year&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;sharing:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Free access to the best streaming experience on the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;re developing: &lt;/strong&gt;Your own development budget, German classes and Zattoo all-company&amp;nbsp;hack days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re inclusive: ‘&lt;/strong&gt;Zattooies’ are a fun, engaged, and diverse team made up of 47 nationalities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re healthy:&lt;/strong&gt; Health checks, mental wellbeing support, team sports and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re responsible:&lt;/strong&gt; We are carbon neutral, an active employee Green team, discounted BVG tickets and free bike rentals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re sociable: &lt;/strong&gt;A&amp;nbsp;calendar of events with fireside chats, lunches, in-house bar, BBQ’s, monthly socials, summer party and an annual off-site event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zattoo enables our users to view indiscriminately and we reflect that in our team too. Regardless of race, gender, sexual orientation, religion, national origin, age, disability or any other characteristic protected by law we encourage everyone to apply and will give everyone equal consideration. We are an equal opportunities employer — join us and help build a diverse team dedicated to revolutionising the way you watch TV.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are committed to ensuring fair, open, and equitable hiring practices and are happy to answer any questions you may have about us or the role throughout the whole process. In line with the EU Pay Transparency Directive, we share the applicable compensation range with you before your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;text-justify&quot;&gt;You can learn more about us at: &lt;a href=&quot;https://zattoo.com/company/jobs/&quot;&gt;https://zattoo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we&#39;re looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you&#39;re ready to help the world&#39;s best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_c57d2138b14e9ae2&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Your Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Are you ready to take ownership of high-value technical evaluations for new enterprise prospects across some of the world&#39;s most recognizable brands? Join New Relic as a Senior Solutions Consultant, where you will leverage your unique blend of technical expertise, commercial acumen, and customer-centricity to acquire new logos and drive market expansion across our DACH and Eastern Europe (EE) markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;In this role, you won&#39;t just be ticking boxes; you will be the absolute owner of the technical &#39;win&#39; for net-new clients. Partnering closely with our Enterprise Account Executives, you will guide technical sales strategies, displace legacy competitors, and establish deep, trusted relationships with prospective enterprise accounts. You will have the autonomy to run with your insights, serving as a critical bridge between complex prospective customer environments and our internal Product and Engineering teams to directly influence the evolution of our market-leading Intelligent Observability platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Secure the Technical Win:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with Sales teams to drive new logo acquisition, winning net-new business and establishing our initial Annual Consumption Revenue (ACR) footprint in strategic prospective accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consult &amp;amp; Architect:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical discovery sessions, deliver tailored Proof of Value (PoV/PoC) presentations, conduct structured architectural workshops, and craft compelling responses to RFX/RFIs to outmaneuver competitors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Establish Trusted Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt; Deeply understand prospective customers&#39; business objectives and technical landscapes to build long-term relationships, helping them eliminate digital experience disruptions from Day 1 and realize maximum platform value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Evangelize Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively champion new product capabilities to greenfield prospects while channeling structured field feedback from new buyer interactions directly to New Relic Product Managers and Engineering leads to fuel future platform evolution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborate Cross-Functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Expand the team’s operational reach by collaborating seamlessly with Solution Architects, Partner teams, and Customer Success colleagues to navigate complex enterprise acquisition cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;This Role Requires:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enterprise Pre-Sales Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record of leading and managing large, complex pre-sales engagements focused on &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot;&gt;new logo acquisition&lt;/strong&gt; for enterprise-level organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modern Cloud Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on familiarity with native cloud technologies, including Kubernetes, containers, microservices, SRE practices, DevOps, and continuous integration/continuous deployment (CI/CD) pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Full-Stack Technological Breadth:&lt;/strong&gt; A foundational understanding that spans modern enterprise layers, from user experience and cloud applications to infrastructure, networks, data, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Data-Driven Consulting:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong grasp of how telemetry, insight, and data enable better decision-making within prospective global organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Superb Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication skills with the ability to engage, influence, and build credibility with both prospective engineering teams and C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Language Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Professional proficiency (written and spoken) in both German and English to support the DACH and EE region effectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Bonus Points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Observability Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Previous experience working with performance monitoring tools across infrastructure, application (APM), network, or digital experience monitoring (DEM) in competitive deal cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Mobile Architecture Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with mobile device platforms and architectures across iOS and Android ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Academic Foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Engineering, or an equivalent technical field.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;10,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Based in or around Munich, Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;11&quot;&gt;#LI-JJ2 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-path-to-node=&quot;13&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a ----- -----
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;NaturalMotion is an award-winning UK game studio dedicated to crafting world-class mobile experiences. Alongside our continued live-service development on CSR Racing 2 (#1 drag racing series of all time), our team is stepping into its next chapter with an ambitious, unannounced project. Honoured for eight consecutive years as a GamesIndustry.biz Best Place to Work in the UK winner and named a Top 50 UK Game Maker in 2025 and 2026, we offer a collaborative studio culture backed by the global reach of Zynga and Take-Two Interactive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NaturalMotion is looking for a talented and passionate Meta Designer to join our London studio, helping shape the combat experience for our first-person shooter mobile title. This role focuses on designing and managing metagame, live, and progression features to create a satisfying and sustainable mobile experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own key metagame features from conception through live, coordinating with design, art, UX, engineering, and product management throughout the whole process. As a live game you will need to design features with iteration and extensibility in mind and analyze live data to expand and improve your features over time. We are looking for someone who brings both craft knowledge, an excitement to try new things, and a genuine love of action games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We embrace a hybrid work environment. Within this role you will work 2 days per week in our London office and the remaining days at home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ownership of designing, prototyping, and implementing progression, economy, and engagement features that align with the creative vision of the game&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define, analyze, and take action on analytics, feature data, and KPIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with live and product management teams to define goals and implement solutions to boost engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with art, animation, audio, design and engineering teams to build content and solve problems in a multi-disciplinary environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and balance in-game economies across many different metagame features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with UX and engineering to ensure features are implemented in ways that meet the engagement goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse player data, feedback, and behaviours to identify and fix metagame issues and retention barriers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work concurrently on multiple features at varying stages of development, managing priorities effectively as content pipelines run in parallel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document and communicate metagame feature concepts clearly to ensure alignment across all development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in Metagame / Progression / Engagement Design or an equivalent role in the video game industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least one shipped title in a design role for a live service title&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing progression, economy, or engagement features for live gamesKnowledge and experience analyzing KPIs and player behaviour data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the Unreal game engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyse gameplay data and player feedback to inform and balance design decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills with the ability to work effectively across cross-disciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage multiple designs in a fast-paced development environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about action games with a deep understanding of what makes enemy designs engaging and memorable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in mobile games with an understanding of mobile player behaviour and market leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with visual scripting or rapid prototyping tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avid gamer with a genuine enthusiasm for crafting engaging progression and metagame features and motivating players over a long period of time&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and discretionary annual bonus scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday, plus bank holidays &amp;amp; 2 paid personal days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6 months fully paid maternity/adoption leave and 16 weeks fully paid paternity leave (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan, with a double matching employer contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical &amp;amp; dental insurance and healthcare cash plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life insurance, personal accident insurance and income protection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and neurodiversity support programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company Employee Stock Purchase Plan (eligibility criteria applies)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement plan, worth £600 per annum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly happy hours, seasonal parties and monthly social events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual rail season ticket advance and cycle to work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;#LI-NH3&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain). &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Connecteam is:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Connecteam is the leading platform for managing deskless teams, trusted by over 80,000 businesses worldwide. We built Connecteam for real operators - the people running shifts, jobs, and teams across stores and sites. The kind of work that doesn’t happen behind a desk, and doesn’t have time for messy spreadsheets, scattered group chats, or tools that don’t talk to each other. Connecteam brings daily operations and team communication into one intuitive app - from hiring and scheduling to training, tasks, and day-to-day coordination. It gives teams the clarity and control to run the day, shift after shift, job after job. Backed by $220M+ from Insight Partners, Stripes, and Tiger Global, Connecteam is rapidly expanding worldwide - empowering frontline teams to work smarter, stay connected, and operate with greater efficiency.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Do you know those people who get a great career opportunity at the perfect time and change their lives? Now it’s your chance to be one of them!&lt;br&gt;If you are looking for a challenging role that includes sales, products, and business development Then look no further!&lt;br&gt;As the face of Connecteam and the first point of contact with our customers, you will have a direct influence on our development and expansion! Become a product expert and an expert in consulting businesses from a wide variety of industries!&lt;br&gt;With all these important insights you will become the link between the product, the market, and all departments in Connecteam.&lt;br&gt;As an Account Executive, your role includes consulting businesses who have signed up to the platform in order to make them paying customers, provide top-notch customer service, and help improve the product based on knowledge and feedback that you’ll gather!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;• You will become a product expert!&lt;br&gt;• Own the full sales cycle in a quota-carrying Account Executive role.&lt;br&gt;• Be the company’s eyes – No one in the company knows our clients better than the Sales team&lt;br&gt;• Be the face of the company – Connecteam is known for our outstanding customer service and approach&lt;br&gt;• Influence the product in the light of client demands and needs&lt;br&gt;• Cross department involvement and information sharing&lt;br&gt;• Initiative independence and ownership&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English, both spoken and written - Must.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 1 year of experience in Sales or another client-facing role such as Account Executive, SDR, Support, Customer Success, or Account Management - Must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech-savvy and comfortable learning new digital tools quickly - Must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy, positive attitude, and resilience in a target-driven environment - Must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in B2B SaaS – Advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRMs, project management tools, task management tools, or other digital business platforms - Advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge seeker!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self learner and independent!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good under pressure and in a fast paced environment!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry to conquer the market!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work hard, but also play hard! We love fun!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Joining Connecteam Is The Smart Move:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We build our people up.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Every team member is treated as a long-term investment and we recognize the value in always nurturing and training them so they can go above and beyond in their skills and job duties.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We make an impact on our customer’s business. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are on a mission to provide managers of all business types and sizes with the tools they need to communicate, operate, engage, and run their deskless workforce. Our product offers them an effective and affordable solution to run their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We get the job done. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Connecteam employees are passionate in executing their job duties so they can drive the company forward and provide real value to our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We have fun! &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;From weekly happy hours to holiday parties, we always enjoy each other’s company (and good food, of course). Connecteam is like one big, happy family!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Everyone is welcome. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Connecteam is committed to building an encouraging, caring, and supportive environment. We share a responsibility to support our team and enrich their lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Together we will shape the future of work!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JivAppdCXE5QjtK_uWM9ue2834blvyfC/view?usp=sharing&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our privacy policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is where careers accelerate. We move fast, think boldly, and empower you to do the best work of your life. You’ll be surrounded by teammates who care deeply, challenge each other, and celebrate wins. With tools that amplify your impact and a culture that backs your ambition, you won’t just contribute. You’ll make things happen–fast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join our dynamic team as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Account Executive &lt;/strong&gt;supporting our SMB segment&amp;nbsp;and embark on an exciting journey of driving success for high-growth businesses. ZoomInfo boasts a diverse clientele, from established Fortune 500 leaders, to nimble high-growth startups. As a key player in the growth of these companies, you&#39;ll utilize a consultative approach to identify challenges, showcasing our innovative products as strategic solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team takes a multi-tier approach to bringing on new clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Account Executives&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;are supported by a strong qualified inbound lead pool. They partner with Sales Development Representatives to help them infiltrate target accounts, but they also create their own key opportunities through prospecting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This is a hybrid role working three days per week from our office in Shoreditch, must be within 45 miles of Techspace Shoreditch South, 32-38 Scrutton Street, London, EC2A 4RQ.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceed revenue quotas by generating new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch outbound motions and create impactful meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customer requests during the pre-sale, from demos to legal and security reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Harness referrals and existing relationships to uncover new business prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct product demos and customer training calls with Enablement teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive accurate forecasts, pipelines, and weekly reports on new business opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share valuable client feedback with Engineering, Product, and Development teams for ongoing innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of sales experience, including minimum of 1 year of running demos and closing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell in a high velocity sales model - experience with short sales cycles in a transactional sales environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce or other CRM tools (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter mentality, capable of steering deals from inception to close independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales training certification (a definite plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to be practical, empathetic, autonomous, and flexible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ready to revolutionize the way businesses go to market? Apply now and be a driving force in shaping success for our clients and your career!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DB&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo (NASDAQ: GTM) is the Go-To-Market Intelligence Platform that empowers businesses to grow faster with AI-ready insights, trusted data, and advanced automation. Its solutions provide more than 35,000 companies worldwide with a complete view of their customers, making every seller their best seller.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is committed to protecting your privacy when you apply for jobs with us. Please review our Job Applicant &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1yiG-k0YX_sW10PiJk_xliDc3W-veJCrK/view?usp=drive_link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt; for more details on how we handle your personal information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo may use a software-based assessment as part of the recruitment process. More information about this tool, including the results of the most recent bias audit, is available &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zoominfo.com/legal/nyc-local-law-144-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZoomInfo is proud to be an equal opportunity employer, hiring based on qualifications, merit, and business needs, and does not discriminate based on protected status. We welcome all applicants and are committed to providing equal employment opportunities regardless of sex, race, age, color, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity, marital status, disability status, religion, protected military or veteran status, medical condition, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. We also consider qualified candidates with criminal histories in accordance with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For Massachusetts Applicants: It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability. ZoomInfo does not administer lie detector tests to applicants in any location.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision for Medicine is not your typical CRO. We are passionate about cultivating our culture and are proud to share extremely high CRA retention rates compared to industry averages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CRAs join us, love their jobs, and stay because of the amazing people and enjoyable quality of life. You will have a lower than average number of protocols, setting you up to be a protocol expert. Travel is reasonable and your work/life balance will benefit as a result. Most meaningfully - your voice will be heard. Working in a smaller CRO allows you to have influence and impact when it matters most and support from direct line management.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are hiring a Senior Clinical Research Associate/ Clinical Research Associate II, this position will be fully home based working in the UK or Northern Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are calm, thoughtful, and responsive when things don’t go as planned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are well-prepared, whether it be for an investigator meeting, site visit or project team update, always staying two steps ahead of the game.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You find quick and creative ways of overcoming difficulties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have an impeccable eye for detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You identify potential study risks and propose solutions on how to mitigate them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take responsibility in the quality and outcomes of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at handling conflict by using tried and true resolution strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we will keep you busy and support your growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will monitor and own the progress of clinical studies at investigative sites and ensure that clinical studies are conducted, recorded, and reported per protocol, SOPs, ICH-GCP, and all applicable regulations and standards. You will coordinate all necessary activities required to set up and monitor a study (i.e., identify investigators; helping prepare regulatory submissions, conducting pre-study and initiation visits, etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Minimum Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-year college degree or equivalent experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other Required:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Candidates should ideally have more than 1 years CRA experience within the CRO or pharmaceutical industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oncology experience, early phase experience desirable although not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Availability for domestic travel including overnight stays, which may constitute up to approximately 50-60% travel commitment (international travel may be required for some senior level positions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision’s uniquely integrated offering enables the science of precision medicine by combining novel clinical trial designs, industry-leading operational and medical experts, advanced biomarker and data analytics solutions, and an unequivocal real passion for rare diseases and oncology.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision medicine is revolutionizing the attack on cancer—and we are passionate about helping you harness its power. We strike tumors on a molecular level using biomarkers to link specific mutations to specific treatments. We combine deep science with deep data from advanced technological platforms, then layer on specialized expertise in the design and execution of targeted, adaptive clinical trials. Ultimately, we deliver robust insights that inform real-time decisions—and optimize the oncology development pathway.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invite you to learn more about our growing organization serving our clients that are researching groundbreaking cancer therapies. We strive to ensure employees feel appreciated for the contributions they make every single day. You will provide input and have your ideas valued and nurtured, impacting positive change for the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EK1 #LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any data provided as a part of this application will be stored in accordance with our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.precisionmedicinegrp.com%2Fprivacy-policy%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Czeta.larcon%40precisionmedicinegrp.com%7Cb58fe8b0c3ea4dd2e79d08db5bd09a25%7Cb71ff3f628164ca8a9b938f820f91ad1%7C0%7C0%7C638204723732367131%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=9DgboiHTFPrNYVhdKhyfdwVyNYwUvZbP%2FroLdWIIfxw%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;For CA applicants, please also refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://nam12.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.precisionmedicinegrp.com%2Fca-applicants-privacy-notice%2F&amp;amp;data=05%7C01%7Czeta.larcon%40precisionmedicinegrp.com%7Cb58fe8b0c3ea4dd2e79d08db5bd09a25%7Cb71ff3f628164ca8a9b938f820f91ad1%7C0%7C0%7C638204723732367131%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;amp;sdata=tfAqqMZsG%2B11IchL45HFFVbfECCkYqQpNr0PQxrMFJU%3D&amp;amp;reserved=0&quot;&gt;CA Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Precision Medicine Group is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, color, age, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, veteran status or other characteristics protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are an individual with a disability and require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application process or are limited in the ability or unable to access or use this online application process and need an alternative method for applying, you may contact Precision Medicine Group at &lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Fraud Warning: &lt;/strong&gt;Please be aware that fraudulent individuals and websites may impersonate Precision Medicine Group or its affiliates and attempt to obtain personal, financial, or banking information through fake job postings or employment offers. Precision Medicine Group will never request payment, banking details, or other sensitive financial information as part of the recruitment process. If you believe you have been targeted by a recruitment scam, we encourage you to report the incident to your local law enforcement authorities, consumer protection agency, or relevant cybercrime reporting organization in your country. Please also notify us at &lt;a id=&quot;menur2oq&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; ----- ----- so we can investigate and take appropriate action.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
