&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Role-Summary&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ad213d8fe4e2&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1929&quot;&gt;Role Summary&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1943&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4daa64b4c380&quot;&gt;Nebius Token Factory is building production-grade inference for open-source, customer, and internally optimized models. This role owns the path from model artifact to fast, reliable, cost-efficient endpoint. The work sits at the intersection of model internals, inference engines, serving architecture, benchmarking, and production deployment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;What-You-Will-Do&quot; data-local-id=&quot;6b105a288faf&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2508&quot;&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ebbff5d80805&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2528&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c5115fb223c0&quot;&gt;Own a platform-level optimization pillar such as quantization, speculative decoding, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, engine selection, or long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2682&quot; data-local-id=&quot;0ffc3414d75f&quot;&gt;Create reusable evaluation, benchmarking, and rollout frameworks across multiple model families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2782&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b1093d4c9089&quot;&gt;Provide technical direction to MLEs, Applied Scientists, GPU kernel engineers, and infrastructure engineers on shared performance goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2922&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba8442a0b3db&quot;&gt;Optimize LLM and &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; endpoints for latency, throughput, memory efficiency, GPU utilization, quality, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3046&quot; data-local-id=&quot;295f060f2f89&quot;&gt;Deploy, configure, benchmark, and extend inference engines such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, or similar systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3204&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a92060bc9227&quot;&gt;Build and productionize model-compression workflows, including quantization, quantization-aware training, distillation, low-bit serving, and accuracy recovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3367&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fc94ad87ea7d&quot;&gt;Implement or integrate speculative decoding, draft-model approaches, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt;-cache optimization, prefix caching, chunked prefill, continuous batching, and disaggregated prefill/decode serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3558&quot; data-local-id=&quot;767163fd69ef&quot;&gt;Build reproducible benchmark harnesses for &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TTFT&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;TPOT&lt;/span&gt;, tokens per second per GPU, p95/p99 latency, GPU memory, reliability, and cost per token.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3705&quot; data-local-id=&quot;08931f048a7e&quot;&gt;Partner with GPU kernel engineers and platform engineers to diagnose bottlenecks across model code, kernels, runtime, scheduler, gateway, and cluster layers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3866&quot; data-local-id=&quot;40fc2b50527b&quot;&gt;Write clear design docs, performance reports, rollout plans, and customer-facing technical explanations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Required-Qualifications&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d808b8c02bc9&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3974&quot;&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;000c2bf27478&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4001&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8bcf8dd9c7f9&quot;&gt;Strong Python and PyTorch engineering skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4050&quot; data-local-id=&quot;781d2e3f4c3f&quot;&gt;Hands-on experience deploying or optimizing LLM, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;VLM&lt;/span&gt;, or high-throughput transformer inference systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4157&quot; data-local-id=&quot;604abc69fbd4&quot;&gt;Practical knowledge of at least one modern inference stack such as vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, Triton Inference Server, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVIDIA&lt;/span&gt; Dynamo, Ray Serve, KServe, or equivalent internal systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4346&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3815fcf1bdd9&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of transformer inference bottlenecks, including &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;KV&lt;/span&gt; cache, attention, memory bandwidth, batching, parallelism, and long-context serving.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4506&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e7ade27b40b8&quot;&gt;Ability to reason quantitatively about latency, throughput, quality, utilization, and cost tradeoffs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4611&quot; data-local-id=&quot;ba5ac6530c91&quot;&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate with research, kernel, infrastructure, product, and customer teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;_3iDTPbvLZJ renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;renderer-heading-wrapper&quot; data-level=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;Preferred-Qualifications&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8d0c1267a411&quot; data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4737&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;60367df2c185&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4765&quot; data-local-id=&quot;adcfa560c32c&quot;&gt;Experience with quantization-aware training, post-training quantization, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;FP8&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;INT8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;INT4&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;NVFP4&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;MXFP4&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;AWQ&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;GPTQ&lt;/span&gt;, SmoothQuant, or related techniques.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4919&quot; data-local-id=&quot;819dcc6d2bb4&quot;&gt;Experience with distillation, speculative decoding, EAGLE, Medusa, multi-token prediction, or other inference acceleration methods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5054&quot; data-local-id=&quot;15844e70e97e&quot;&gt;Experience with agentic workloads, including tool calling, structured outputs, streaming APIs, high concurrency, and multi-step orchestration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5200&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cd4bee1cb99&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;CUDA&lt;/span&gt; or Triton familiarity, even if the role is not primarily a kernel-engineering role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5292&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f030cb084e2a&quot;&gt;Open-source contributions to vLLM, SGLang, TensorRT-LLM, FlashInfer, LMCache, PyTorch, Triton, Ray, KServe, or related projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth and learning opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility and ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and innovative culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to work on impactful AI projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International environment and talented teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s it like to work at Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fast moving&amp;nbsp;- Bold thinking&amp;nbsp;- Constant growth&amp;nbsp;- Meaningful impact&amp;nbsp;- Trust and real ownership&amp;nbsp;- Opportunity to shape the future of AI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is an equal opportunity employer. We are committed to fostering an inclusive and diverse workplace and to providing equal employment opportunities in all aspects of employment. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy), national origin, ancestry, age, disability, genetic information, marital status, veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must be authorized to work in the country in which they apply and will be required to provide proof of employment eligibility as a condition of hire.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT QUINCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a destination for builders, creators, innovators, and operators who want to come together and challenge the status quo. Our mission is simple: make really high quality essentials for really low prices, fairly and sustainably. We deliver on that mission through a unique manufacturer-to-consumer (M2C) model eliminating the layers of traditional retail that add cost and result in consumers paying more than they need to. We find, build relationships with, and work directly with the manufacturing partners behind some of the world’s finest products. From there, our teams design smart, efficient operational processes&amp;nbsp; and build and deploy proprietary technology, AI, and analytics to help us scale fast.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What began with a small assortment of elevated basics has quickly grown into a cross-category brand spanning apparel, accessories, home goods, and more. Today, tens of millions of people across a growing number of countries come – and return – to Quince because they trust us to deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR CULTURE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quince is a culture built for builders by builders. Our way of working starts with a blank sheet of paper. We question conventional thinking, use technology and data to uncover new opportunities, and move quickly to turn ideas into reality. We aren’t interested in replicating how others do retail. We’re building a better way – at a speed and scale unlike anything that’s been done before.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We dream big and chase the hard problems others shy away from. Rejecting long-held assumptions is part of our company&#39;s DNA.&amp;nbsp; Where conventional wisdom says you have to choose – soft or durable, speed or rigor, quality or price – we ask why that trade-off has to exist in the first place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our pace is fast and the bar is high because our customers expect a lot from us and we refuse to let them down. We believe the best results come from challenging ourselves, learning from one another, and building on each other&#39;s strengths.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Here, responsibility is not determined by role, tenure, or seniority. Every team member - no matter their level - has the opportunity to drive our business and shape our trajectory.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re someone who likes to imagine new possibilities and build better systems rather than plug-in to outdated ones, Quince is the place for you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE IDEAL CANDIDATE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is a self-starter and problem-solver, skilled at leveraging technology and data to deliver top-tier analytics solutions. They thrive on addressing complex business challenges and are consistently effective in making high-judgment decisions at a rapid pace, even in the face of ambiguity and uncharted scenarios. Additionally, the ideal candidate is energized by a work environment where strategy, innovation, and decision-making are intentionally distributed, where transparency, agility, and data-driven insights are highly valued, and where colleagues at all levels hold each other to exceptionally high standards to serve Quince customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the US team to understand what exists that we need to replicate and the gaps that we need to build upon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain automated reports to track Marketing KPIs:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;New/Returning Customers, LTV/CAC, Total vs. inc. ROAS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Marketing Channel: Paid Social, SEM, App, Affiliates etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CRM: Customer cohort, Database health + Lifecycle stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct ad-hoc analyses to identify channel inefficiencies, scaling opportunities, areas for improving MER / Total ROAS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering and Performance team to deliver experimentation and incrementality studies: Geo-Lift tests, Channel Incrementality, Brand lift, MMM validation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering and CRM to deliver:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data driven customer lifecycle programme including key drivers of high-value customers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A/B and multivariate tests across lifecycle touchpoints that optimize revenue per visit, and Incremental LTV / Revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A multi-category approach to cross selling, identifying triggers and next best actions based on customer behaviour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement data quality, governance (inc. GDPR) and AI usage best practices in collaboration with the US.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an integral part of the international team and contribute to their growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a quantitative field (e.g., Statistics, Mathematics, Economics, Data Science, or similar). Master’s degree is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in a data analytics/product analytics role, ideally with a focus on supply chain within an e-commerce or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in SQL and data visualization tools (e.g., Tableau, Looker, Power BIm Mixpanel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of statistical analysis and A/B testing; familiarity with Python or R is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret complex data and translate it into actionable insights, with a focus on detail, accuracy, and clarity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to present data insights and recommendations effectively to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to manage multiple projects and prioritize in a fast-paced, dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Berlin / London with the ability to come into the Berlin / London office 4 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in running Geo-lift tests across Europe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous e-commerce / multi-category experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Performance marketing (attribution) + CRM measurement background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to translate data analysis into action through storytelling and visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of core marketing metrics and how they interact to deliver profitable growth: LTV/CAC, ROAS, MER&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;WHY QUINCE?&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3352&quot;&gt;Joining Quince means being part of a mission-driven team reshaping retail. You will work alongside talented colleagues, tackle meaningful challenges, and contribute to building a more sustainable, accessible future for customers and partners alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3604&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;u data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY &amp;amp; HIRING INTEGRITY&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3662&quot;&gt;Quince provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applications for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran or military status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4074&quot;&gt;Quince is committed to providing reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. If you need a reasonable accommodation to complete your application or to perform the essential functions of a role at Quince, please let us know by completing &lt;a href=&quot;https://forms.gle/DpJ11jHa1WbqfUWB9&quot;&gt;this accommodation form&lt;/a&gt;. We review all requests individually and will work with you to determine appropriate accommodations on a case-by-case basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4428&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent upon successful completion of a background check. Quince will conduct background checks in compliance with applicable federal, state, and local laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4604&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Security Advisory: Beware of Frauds&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4641&quot;&gt;At Quince, we&#39;re dedicated to recruiting top talent who share our drive for innovation. To safeguard candidates, Quince emphasizes legitimate recruitment practices. Initial communication is primarily via official Quince email addresses and LinkedIn; beware of deviations. Personal data and sensitive information will not be solicited during the application phase. Interviews are conducted via phone, in person, or through the approved platforms Google Meets or Zoom—never via messaging apps or other calling services. Offers are merit-based, communicated verbally, and followed up in writing. If personal information is requested to initiate the hiring process, rest assured it will be through secure and protected means.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5364&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence, and world-class partnerships – all united by our pioneering agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity, and deliver transformational growth. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dans un souci de clarté et d’accessibilité, nous avons choisi de ne pas utiliser l’écriture inclusive dans nos communications. WPP Media est fermement engagé en faveur de la diversité : nous valorisons l&#39;inclusion et l&#39;égalité, en considérant tous les candidats sans distinction d&#39;identité de genre, d&#39;origine ethnique ou de religion. Tous nos postes sont également ouverts aux personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP est le partenaire de confiance des plus grandes marques mondiales pour assurer leur croissance. Nous réunissons une intelligence média de pointe, une créativité de classe mondiale, une production de nouvelle génération, des solutions pour transformer le marketing à l’ère de l’IA et un conseil stratégique d’expert au sein d’une seule compagnie. Propulsés par des talents exceptionnels et WPP Open, notre plateforme de marketing agentique, nous déployons l’IA à grande échelle pour aider nos clients à naviguer dans un monde en pleines mutations et à optimiser leurs investissements marketing. Pour plus d’informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;www.wpp.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de WPP Media&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media est le collectif média global de WPP. Dans un monde où les médias sont omniprésents, nous regroupons la meilleure plateforme, les meilleurs talents et les meilleurs partenaires pour développer les solutions les plus innovantes, offrant une croissance inégalée à nos clients. Pour plus d&#39;informations, visitez &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;www.wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez WPP Media, nous croyons en la puissance de notre culture et de nos collaborateurs. Pour réussir dans ce poste, il est fondamental d&#39;incarner les valeurs qui nous unissent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Être Extraordinaire&lt;/strong&gt; en favorisant un leadership collectif et une créativité transformationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Créer un environnement Ouvert&lt;/strong&gt; en trouvant l&#39;équilibre parfait entre l&#39;épanouissement de nos collaborateurs et la satisfaction client.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diriger avec Optimisme&lt;/strong&gt; en stimulant activement la croissance et la curiosité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;À propos de Conexance / Choreograph&amp;nbsp;: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choreograph constitue le cœur technologique et data de l&#39;écosystème WPP, reliant la réflexion stratégique marketing à son déploiement opérationnel à grande échelle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conexance&lt;/strong&gt;, entité clé de Choreograph, est le leader reconnu du Marketing Data-Driven en France. Forts de 20 ans d&#39;expertise, nous proposons des solutions data uniques basées sur la mutualisation de données transactionnelles (base de données coopérative multi-secteurs) et sur l&#39;Intelligence Artificielle au service de nos clients en &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt; et au &lt;strong&gt;Royaume-Uni (UK)&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre mission : permettre à nos clients (e-commerce, retail, presse, associations/caritatif, etc.) d&#39;exploiter tout le potentiel de leurs données pour optimiser leurs campagnes de prospection, de fidélisation et d&#39;activation (lookalike, scoring, segmentation, CRM, profiling).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Missions &amp;amp; Rôle&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein du &lt;strong&gt;Service Études&lt;/strong&gt; de Conexance et rattaché directement au &lt;strong&gt;Senior Lead Data Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;, vous intégrez une équipe dynamique et collaborative de 7 collaborateurs (Lead Data Analyst, Data Analysts, prestataires et alternant).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans un contexte résolument &lt;em&gt;Customer Centric&lt;/em&gt;, vous intervenez en support direct du commerce (FR et UK) afin de produire, analyser et restituer des études statistiques à forte valeur ajoutée.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos responsabilités clés :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Production d&#39;analyses statistiques &amp;amp; modélisations :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Élaborer des scores de prospection et modèles de lookalike (cas simples à complexes).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des segmentations, études de profiling et analyses de répondants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectuer des comptages et sélections sur critères pour les campagnes de nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Garantie de qualité &amp;amp; respect des délais :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer des livrables rigoureux, fiables et structurés, répondant précisément aux besoins opérationnels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Accompagnement commercial &amp;amp; restitution :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner ponctuellement l&#39;équipe commerciale en rendez-vous clients (France et UK) pour expliquer la démarche, valoriser les analyses et formuler des recommandations stratégiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Amélioration continue &amp;amp; innovation :&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer activement aux réflexions inter et intra-services visant à optimiser nos méthodes de production, automatiser nos flux et explorer de nouveaux outils (dont l&#39;IA générative et de nouvelles approches d&#39;analyse).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trajectoire et montée en compétences :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À court terme (1 à 3 mois) :&lt;/strong&gt; Assimiler notre environnement technique et le process de production (FR/UK), devenir autonome sur le traitement des cas courants et consolider une rigueur méthodologique sans faille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À moyen/long terme :&lt;/strong&gt; Monter en autonomie sur les problématiques statistiques les plus complexes, gérer un portefeuille de demandes de bout en bout, être force de proposition sur l&#39;innovation et animer des restitutions auprès de nos interlocuteurs internes et externes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Profil recherché&amp;nbsp;:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous êtes passionné par la statistique et la valorisation de la donnée marketing, avec un tempérament curieux, proactif et un excellent relationnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation &amp;amp; Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Formation :&lt;/strong&gt; Titulaire d’un &lt;strong&gt;Master 2 / Bac+5&lt;/strong&gt; en Statistiques, Machine Learning, Big Data, Data Science ou Intelligence Artificielle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Environ &lt;strong&gt;2 ans d&#39;expérience&lt;/strong&gt; (alternance/stages significatifs inclus) dans un rôle axé sur le &lt;strong&gt;datamining&lt;/strong&gt;, la modélisation statistique ou l&#39;analyse de données orientée marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Techniques (Hard Skills) :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Indispensables :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise opérationnelle de &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maîtrise de la suite &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Office&lt;/strong&gt; (Excel avancé, PowerPoint).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des techniques de &lt;strong&gt;Data Visualisation&lt;/strong&gt; (capacité à mettre en scène la donnée pour la rendre intelligible).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Atouts supplémentaires :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance de &lt;strong&gt;R&lt;/strong&gt; et d&#39;outils de dataviz comme &lt;strong&gt;Power BI&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sensibilité à l&#39;&lt;strong&gt;IA générative&lt;/strong&gt; appliquée à la data, au &lt;strong&gt;storytelling&lt;/strong&gt; de la donnée et aux &lt;strong&gt;méthodes agiles&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compétences Comportementales &amp;amp; Soft Skills :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigueur, esprit logique et méthode&lt;/strong&gt; dans la manipulation de volumes importants de données.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellente communication orale et écrite :&lt;/strong&gt; aisance relationnelle, élocution claire et capacité à vulgariser des concepts techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personnalité dynamique, souriante, à l&#39;écoute et bienveillante&lt;/strong&gt;, dotée d&#39;un fort esprit d&#39;équipe et d&#39;une bonne présentation en clientèle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactivité :&lt;/strong&gt; curiosité intellectuelle, autonomie progressive et orientation solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Anglais professionnel opérationnel (niveau B2 minimum requis)&lt;/strong&gt;, indispensable pour collaborer sur les comptes et campagnes du marché UK.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Environnement de travail :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous évoluerez dans une équipe à taille humaine (environ 35 collaborateurs dans l&#39;entreprise, 6 dans l&#39;équipe Études) où la bienveillance, la collaboration, l&#39;écoute, la qualité, la rigueur, la méthode et l&#39;innovation sont des valeurs fondamentales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un poste basé à Lille, avec une politique de travail hybride : 100% en présentiel durant la période d&#39;essai, puis possibilité de 2 jours de télétravail par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence obligatoire par mois sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; et ses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; avantages&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre engagement à façonner l&#39;avenir des médias se manifeste par un soutien actif au développement professionnel de nos talents, les aidant à atteindre leur plein potentiel. Cette démarche s&#39;accompagne d&#39;une vision responsable dans nos stratégies d&#39;investissement médiatique, reflétant ainsi notre double priorité : valoriser nos collaborateurs tout en adoptant des pratiques durables dans notre secteur. Les collaborateurs de WPP Media ont un accès privilégié aux réseaux internationaux de WPP Media et WPP, leur permettant de développer leurs passions, d&#39;étendre leur réseau professionnel et de rester à la pointe des innovations en marketing et publicité. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous disposons de ressources vastes et variées au service de nos collaborateurs, notre entreprise cultive activement l&#39;inclusion des talents de tous horizons. Les réussites et expertises des équipes sont régulièrement mises en lumière lors d&#39;événements fédérateurs qui ponctuent également les moments clés de l&#39;année, renforçant ainsi notre culture d&#39;entreprise collaborative et diversifiée. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nos avantages comprennent :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rémunération et avantages&lt;/strong&gt; : Salaire compétitif, mutuelle (prise en charge employeur à 70%), prévoyance, titres-restaurant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Congés et équilibre vie pro/perso&lt;/strong&gt; : 25 jours de congés payés annuels, 12 jours de RTT (pour une année civile complète), jours de congé additionnels par palier de 5 ans d’ancienneté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibilité et télétravail&lt;/strong&gt; : Durant la période d’essai, 100% en présentiel. Puis possibilité de télétravail 2 jours par semaine en moyenne (avec 12 jours de présence par mois obligatoires sur site après validation de la période d&#39;essai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilité durable&lt;/strong&gt; : Forfait Mobilité Durable (facultatif au choix du salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous nous engageons à rendre ce process aussi rapide et efficace que possible, et à maintenir une communication ouverte et transparente tout au long du process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Échange RH : &lt;/strong&gt;Premier entretien de découverte (téléphonique ou visio) avec l&#39;équipe Talent Acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien physique &amp;amp; Business Case : &lt;/strong&gt;Rencontre dans nos locaux avec le Senior Lead Data Analyst incluant un cas pratique / test technique (pour vous projeter concrètement dans notre quotidien) et un échange avec la HRBP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Entretien de finalisation (si nécessaire) &lt;/strong&gt;: Échange complémentaire avec le N+2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Media garantit l&#39;égalité des chances et considère tous les candidats sans discrimination ni considération de caractéristiques particulières. Nous nous engageons à cultiver un environnement de respect où chacun se sent à sa place et bénéficie des mêmes opportunités d&#39;évolution professionnelle. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Consultez notre politique de confidentialité pour tout savoir sur la protection de vos données &lt;a href=&quot;https://open-web-sk.wpp.ai/chat/7aQi197iYDxX62kecaQzY/LIEN_VERS_POLITIQUE_DE_CONFIDENTIALITE&quot;&gt;politique de confidentialité&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bien que nous étudiions toutes les candidatures reçues, nous ne contactons que les personnes sélectionnées pour un entretien.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-Promoted&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;Please read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wppmedia.com/pages/privacy-policy#:~:text=WPP%20Media%20Privacy%20Notice%20for%20Recruitment&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-CA&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot;&gt;for more information on how we process the information you provide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW227196529 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam is the Data and AI Trust Company, specializing in helping organizations ensure their data and AI are fully understood, secured, and resilient to enable the acceleration of safe AI at scale. As the market leader in both data resilience and data security posture management, Veeam is built for the convergence of identity, data, security, and AI risk. Headquartered in Seattle with offices in more than 30 countries, Veeam protects over 550,000 customers worldwide, who trust Veeam to keep their businesses running. Join us as we go fearlessly forward together, growing, learning, and making a real impact for some of the world’s biggest brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam, following its acquisition of&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI - the leader in AI-powered data security posture management (DSPM) - is&amp;nbsp;seeking a Senior Sales Engineer to drive technical leadership in our sales team, focusing on the&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI portfolio. You will partner with a&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;Sales Specialist and support 3–5 Account Executives and Veeam Solution Engineers as the technical subject matter expert.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will guide customers from needs assessment to solution design,&amp;nbsp;delivering&amp;nbsp;hands-on demos and proof-of-concepts to&amp;nbsp;showcase&amp;nbsp;value. Success in this role requires strong technical skills and the ability to build trust with clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical contact for&amp;nbsp;Securiti&amp;nbsp;AI solutions during the sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical discussions and deliver customized security solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address customer needs in data discovery, posture management, and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and present product demonstrations and proof-of-concepts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product, engineering, and customer success teams to ensure smooth transitions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&amp;nbsp;You’ll&amp;nbsp;Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience&amp;nbsp;in pre-sales or sales engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of data and/or cloud security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communicator with both technical and business stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years technical sales experience in security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years in Software/SaaS/Enterprise technical sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AWS, Azure, or GCP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data privacy/security standards (e.g., GDPR, NIST 800-53, ISO 27001)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with DSPM frameworks, Linux, Kubernetes, or cloud data systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications (CISSP, CISM, or cloud-specific)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Get:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Veeam offers benefits that support your whole self:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;962d2596-0d84-4634-8122-e72620efaf3a&quot;&gt;25 paid vacation days plus RTT days, plus 4 extra global VeeaMe Days for self-care and 24 paid volunteer hours annually through Veeam Cares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;ac5169f0-07e3-489b-8abe-892be770a0b0&quot;&gt;Mandatory public health insurance with broad medical coverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;6d7de02c-c10d-4630-8e3a-d6fc9459e7d9&quot;&gt;Employer-paid private medical, dental, optical, and wellness plan through Axa, with options for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;61b12e02-8f54-4d15-96d6-bbc42318ce88&quot;&gt;Life insurance with enhanced coverage above the Social Security ceiling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;b2ca2bc7-2cd7-4995-9fc1-a5c272ebb57b&quot;&gt;Education pension for dependent children up to age 26 if in full-time education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;857127a3-8f58-4d62-9dd4-f69b9f89cff8&quot;&gt;State and supplementary pension contributions by Veeam&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-uuid=&quot;73fa609e-fa75-463b-994c-f8b6c840141c&quot;&gt;Opportunities to learn and grow through on-demand libraries (LinkedIn Learning, O’Reilly), mentoring, workshops and learning events like our annual Global Day of Learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: If an applicant is permanently located outside of France, Veeam reserves the right to decline the application for this position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AF1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 [&amp;quot;ul&amp;quot;,null,&amp;quot;li&amp;quot;,{&amp;quot;style&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;checked&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;value&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;displayValue&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;backgroundColor&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;color&amp;quot;:null,&amp;quot;listStyleType&amp;quot;:null}]&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-local-id=&quot;56095010243a&quot; data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Veeam Software is an equal opportunity employer&lt;/strong&gt; and does not tolerate discrimination in any form on the basis of race, color, religion, gender, age, national origin, citizenship, disability, veteran status or any other classification protected by federal, state or local law. All your information will be kept confidential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data collected during the recruitment process will be processed in accordance with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.veeam.com/legal/recruiting-privacy-notice.html&quot;&gt;Recruiting Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;, which explains how your information is collected, used, and handled in connection with hiring activities. By applying for this position, you consent to this processing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you confirm that the information provided, including any supporting documents, is complete and accurate to the best of your knowledge. Any misrepresentation, omission, or falsification may result in disqualification from consideration or, if discovered after employment begins, termination of employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;app&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;À propos du poste&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que leader de deuxième niveau pour l’équipe Applied AI Industries en Europe du Sud et au Moyen-Orient chez Anthropic, vous piloterez l’adoption d’une IA de frontier en partenariat avec le reste de l’organisation de mise sur le marché. Nos clients Industries en France, Ibérie et Italie incluent de nombreuses plus grandes entreprises de la région dans les services financiers, santé et sciences de la vie, fabrication, télécommunications, commerce de détail, énergie et autres secteurs. Vous mettrez à profit votre expérience de construction et de direction d’équipes de vente technique pour piloter une transformation IA positive qui répond aux besoins métier de nos clients, satisfait à leurs exigences techniques et réglementaires, et offre un haut degré de fiabilité et de sécurité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous serez responsable de la direction et de la croissance de l’équipe d’architectes de solutions qui partenaire avec les directrices et directeurs de compte pour aider les entreprises à adopter et déployer les produits d’Anthropic, notamment Claude Cowork, Claude Code et la Plateforme de Développement Claude (notre API). Cela inclura l’utilisation de vos compétences techniques et votre expérience de vente consultative pour recruter d’excellentes personnes en première ligne de management et contributeurs individuels, établir des processus pour évoluer votre équipe, et représenter Anthropic directement dans les engagements clients stratégiques. Votre équipe couvre plusieurs pays et secteurs à la fois, vous serez donc responsable de la réflexion stratégique sur les comptes d’industrie complexes et de l’identification et du déploiement de solutions qui résonnent dans chaque marché, avec sa propre langue, sa culture métier et son contexte réglementaire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsabilités&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruter, manager et guider une équipe de managers de première ligne qui construiront à leur tour des équipes d’Applied AI Architects (H/F) de pré-vente en France, Ibérie et Italie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Définir les objectifs de votre équipe en collaboration avec le leadership commercial et établir les attentes de performance de base sur votre équipe&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agir en tant que sponsor technique et exécutif pour les clients stratégiques de haute valeur dans la région et les conseiller sur leurs stratégies globales d’adoption de l’IA ou la délimitation des cas d’usage et l’exécution de pilotes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec le leadership commercial d’Europe du Sud (couvrant également le Moyen-Orient et l’Afrique) pour construire des stratégies pour les comptes d’industrie complexes et identifier de nouvelles façons de piloter l’adoption des produits Anthropic dans des secteurs verticaux spécifiques ou des cas d’usage horizontaux&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider les clients à naviguer dans les exigences réglementaires locales et européennes (par exemple, la Loi sur l’IA de l’UE, le RGPD, DORA et les attentes de résidence des données) et adapter la façon dont votre équipe s’engage à la culture métier de chaque marché&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travailler avec des équipes interfonctionnelles comme le produit et l’ingénierie pour assurer qu’Anthropic priorise les commentaires des clients ou résout les obstacles à l’adoption dans la région&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Voyager régulièrement en Europe du Sud pour les clients ou conférences pour des sessions de haut niveau, des ateliers techniques et la construction de relations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Établir une vision commune pour créer des solutions qui permettent une IA bénéfique et sûre dans les produits technologiques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à la pensée stratégique par des présentations en conférences, des webinaires et la création de contenu technique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rester au courant des tendances émergentes en IA et du paysage concurrentiel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce profil est un bon ajustement si vous :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez 7+ ans d’expérience en gestion de pré-vente technique, incluant un leadership de deuxième niveau ou supérieur (direction de managers)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez vendu des produits techniques complexes aux grandes entreprises en France, Ibérie, Italie, Moyen-Orient et Afrique&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez travaillé dans plusieurs secteurs, tels que services financiers, santé et sciences de la vie, fabrication, télécommunications, commerce de détail et énergie&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprenez les différences culturelles entre les marchés d’Europe du Sud et le contexte réglementaire dans lequel opèrent vos clients, et adaptez votre approche à chacun&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pensez de façon hautement stratégique aux comptes d’industrie complexes et transformez cette réflexion en plans que votre équipe et vos homologues commerciaux peuvent exécuter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Avez une profonde maîtrise technique des cas d’usage IA en entreprise, des intégrations d’API et des déploiements LLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospérez dans la construction et l’évolution rapide d’équipes et de processus dans des environnements ambigus et mouvants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez d’excellentes compétences en communication, collaboration et coaching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez une présence exécutive forte et la capacité à cultiver des relations profondes avec les leaders métier et technique des plus grandes entreprises de la région&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez au moins une familiarité de haut niveau avec l’architecture et le fonctionnement des LLM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ayez une passion pour rendre les technologies puissantes sûres et bénéfiques pour la société&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restiez à jour et informée en vous intéressant activement à la recherche émergente et aux tendances du secteur en IA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Les candidates et candidats solides pourraient avoir :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership de pré-vente d’entreprise à grande échelle : 5+ ans de direction d’équipes d’architectes de solutions à travers une hypercroissance (idéalement des dizaines de personnes dans plusieurs pays), avec expérience directe de direction de managers et développement de talents dans des environnements de vente de logiciels d’entreprise complexes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gamme multilingue et multiculturelle : En plus de l’anglais, maîtrise d’une ou plusieurs langues parmi le français, l’italien, l’espagnol ou le portugais, et expérience de direction d’équipes distribuées dans plusieurs pays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience avec les modèles commerciaux basés sur la consommation : Les candidats idéaux ont construit des cadres GTM ancrés sur la consommation, pas seulement sur les licences basées sur SaaS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profondeur technique en IA + Engagement exécutif : Expérience pratique avec les plateformes d’IA et les modèles d’intégration d’entreprise, combinée à un historique avéré d’engagement des parties prenantes au niveau C dans des évaluations techniques de 10 M€+ et des cycles de vente d’entreprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience GTM multi-secteurs dans les secteurs réglementés : Succès démontré dans l’adaptation des approches techniques à différents secteurs verticaux, en particulier les secteurs réglementés tels que la banque, les assurances et la santé, y compris le travail avec les parties prenantes en matière de risque, de conformité et de comité d’entreprise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the 2nd-line leader for the Applied AI Industries team in Southern Europe and the Middle-East at Anthropic, you will drive the adoption of frontier AI in partnership with the rest of the go to market organization. Our Industries customers in France, Iberia and Italy include many of the region&#39;s largest enterprises across financial services, healthcare and life sciences, manufacturing, telecom, retail, energy, and other sectors. You&#39;ll leverage your experience building and leading technical sales teams to drive positive AI transformation that addresses our customers&#39; business needs, meets their technical and regulatory requirements, and provides a high degree of reliability and safety.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for leading and growing the solutions architect team that partners with account executives to help companies adopt and deploy Anthropic&#39;s products, including Claude Cowork, Claude Code, and the Claude Development Platform (our API). This will include leveraging your technical skills and consultative sales experience to hire great 1st line managers and individual contributors, establish processes to scale your team, and represent Anthropic directly at strategic customer engagements. Your team covers several countries and industries at once, so you will be responsible for thinking strategically about complex industry accounts and for identifying and rolling out solutions that resonate in each market, with its own language, business culture, and regulatory context.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hire, manage, and guide a team of 1st line managers who will in turn build teams of pre-sales Applied AI Architects across France, Iberia and Italy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set goals for your team in collaboration with sales leadership and establish baseline expectations for performance across your team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a technical and executive sponsor for high-value strategic customers in the region and advise them on their overall AI adoption strategies or use case scoping and pilot execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partner closely with Southern Europe sales leadership (also covering the Middle-East and Africa) to build strategies for complex industry accounts and identify new ways to drive adoption of Anthropic products within specific verticals or horizontal use cases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help customers navigate local and European regulatory requirements (for example the EU AI Act, GDPR, DORA, and data residency expectations) and adapt how your team engages to the business culture of each market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with cross-functional teams like product and engineering to ensure Anthropic prioritizes customer feedback or resolves blockers to adoption in the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Travel regularly across Southern Europe to customers or conferences for executive-level sessions, technical workshops, and relationship building.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a shared vision for creating solutions that enable beneficial and safe AI in technology products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contribute to thought leadership through conference presentations, webinars, and technical content creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay current with emerging AI trends and the competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years of technical pre-sales management experience, including 2nd-line leadership or above (leading managers).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have sold complex technical products to large enterprises in France, Iberia, Italy, the Middle-East and Africa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have worked across multiple industries, such as financial services, healthcare and life sciences, manufacturing, telecom, retail, and energy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understand the cultural differences between Southern European markets and the regulatory context your customers operate in, and adapt your approach to each.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think highly strategically about complex industry accounts, and turn that thinking into plans your team and sales counterparts can execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have deep technical proficiency with enterprise AI use cases, API integrations, and LLM deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thrive in building and rapidly scaling teams and processes within ambiguous and fast-moving environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have excellent communication, collaboration, and coaching abilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong executive presence and ability to foster deep relationships with business and technical leaders at the region&#39;s largest companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have at least a high level familiarity with the architecture and operation of LLMs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a passion for making powerful technology safe and societally beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay up-to-date and informed by taking an active interest in emerging research and industry trends within AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong candidates may have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise pre-sales leadership at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years leading solution architect teams through hypergrowth (ideally dozens of people across several countries), with direct experience leading managers and developing talent in complex enterprise software sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multilingual and multicultural range:&lt;/strong&gt; In addition to English, fluency in one or more of French, Italian, Spanish or Portuguese, and experience leading teams distributed across several countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience with consumption business models:&lt;/strong&gt; Ideal candidates have built GTM frameworks anchored on consumption, not just SaaS-based licenses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Technical Depth + Executive Engagement:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with AI platforms and enterprise integration patterns, combined with proven track record engaging C-level stakeholders in €10M+ technical evaluations and enterprise sales cycles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Multi-industry GTM experience in regulated sectors:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success adapting technical approaches to different verticals, in particular regulated ones such as banking, insurance, and healthcare, including working with risk, compliance, and works council stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€265.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€310.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;En bref&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic grandit vite, et notre centre de préparation de commandes de Moissy-Cramayel a besoin de pilotes pour porter cette ambition. En tant que Captain, tu n&#39;es pas juste un(e) chef(fe) d&#39;équipe : tu es le moteur de l&#39;entrepôt. Ton défi ? Manager environ 20 Shoppers (préparateur(rice)s de commandes) en direct, garantir une sécurité totale et transformer chaque shift en succès collectif avec +100 Shoppers sur le terrain. Si tu aimes l&#39;action et que tu sais fédérer une équipe dans la bonne humeur, ce rôle est pour toi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Tes missions&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager et coacher ton équipe&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu supervises une vingtaine de Shoppers au quotidien, en veillant à leur motivation, leur sécurité et au respect des bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Piloter la performance&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu garantis que chaque commande est prête, complète et à l&#39;heure, en suivant de près nos indicateurs de qualité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coordonner les flux du FC&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu travailles main dans la main avec les autres Captains pour fluidifier les opérations et ajuster les ressources en temps réel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assurer la polyvalence opérationnelle&lt;/strong&gt; : Réception, gestion des stocks (sec, frais, surgelé) ou départ des camions... tu navigues entre les zones selon les besoins du planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gérer l&#39;humain et le terrain&lt;/strong&gt; : Tu es le point de contact privilégié pour ton équipe, capable de recadrer avec pédagogie comme de féliciter les réussites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;À propos de toi&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as entre 1 et 5 ans d&#39;expérience dans un environnement dynamique (logistique, retail, restauration ou ligne de production) avec une première gestion d&#39;équipe réussie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es disponible à temps plein sur des shifts tournants (matin dès 3h50 ou après-midi jusqu&#39;à 23h30) et tu es prêt(e) à travailler les samedis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu maîtrises le français (l&#39;anglais est un plus) et tu es parfaitement à l&#39;aise avec les outils digitaux de pilotage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu es véhiculé(e) pour rejoindre facilement l&#39;entrepôt de Moissy-Cramayel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu n&#39;as pas peur de mettre la main à la pâte. Tu aimes l&#39;action et tu sais prendre des décisions rapides pour débloquer des situations opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Avantages Picnic&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍴 &lt;strong&gt;Restauration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ton FC, tu disposeras d’une variété de déjeuners, de dîners, de snacks et de boissons sains, préparés fraîchement sur place par notre chef !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎫 Sorties et divertissement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Un accès à des offres et avantages exclusifs via notre CSE et partenaire Swile (bons d&#39;achats, places de concert, cinéma, et plus encore). Tu seras aussi convié(e) à nos événements récurrents comme notre très convoitée Summer Party !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;👨‍⚕️ Santé et repos&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grâce à nos partenariats avec SideCare et OpenUp, tu as la possibilité de souscrire à notre mutuelle d’entreprise ainsi qu’à un accès facile et gratuit à des psychologues professionnels, des ateliers et des outils pratiques. De plus, tu disposeras de 25 jours de congés payés par an.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍️ Développement personnel et professionnel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tu auras l’opportunité de développer tes compétences, non seulement au travers de projets stimulants, mais aussi grâce à des formations dédiées au leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/FSwRUFqnISA&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lorsque l&#39;on vous dit Deliveroo, vous imaginez sans doute d&#39;abord les bons petits plats livrés chez vous en moins d&#39;une demi-heure. Plutôt sympa non ? Mais c&#39;est en coulisses que l&#39;histoire est la plus intéressante. Elle est synonyme de forte croissance et d&#39;immenses opportunités dans les années à venir. Nous opérons désormais dans 10 marchés à travers le monde et travaillons avec plus de 176 000 restaurants partenaires et commerces en tous genres en France. Nous collaborons avec des milliers de livreurs et de livreuses partenaires pour le plus grand bonheur de nos millions de personnes clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous gérons l&#39;une des marketplaces tripartites les plus complexes du monde et nous le faisons en temps réel. Des millions de personnes clientes et des milliers de restaurants, de commerces en tous genres, de livreurs et de livreuses comptent sur nous pour être mis en relation en quelques secondes. Nos algorithmes sur lesquels repose cette marketplace sont l&#39;ingrédient secret qui nous permettent de livrer nos commandes en un temps record.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description de poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;stagiaire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, vous serez partie prenante du succès de nos partenaires supermarchés et commerces de bouche, en veillant à offrir une expérience unique et magique à nos utilisateurs; tout en construisant une base solide et durable pour notre application. Vous serez ainsi en support des missions suivantes :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant que &lt;strong&gt;stagiaire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt; vous aiderez les Account Managers auxquels vous serez rattaché à développer leur portefeuille d’enseignes. Vos principales missions consisteront à :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le suivi opérationnel et commercial des magasins de votre portefeuille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Animer le portefeuille de magasins partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser quotidiennement les performances opérationnelles des magasins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appeler quotidiennement les partenaires sous performants pour les accompagner dans leur excellence opérationnelle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer la bonne adoption des produits Deliveroo (application de réception des commandes, outils marketing, portail partenaire, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paramétrer et mettre en place les campagnes marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Profile recherché :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit commercial -&lt;/strong&gt; vous savez anticiper des discussions commerciales, et influencer des décisions prises par l’Account Manager avec le siège social. Idéalement, vous bénéficiez d’une première expérience commerciale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactif(-ive) - &lt;/strong&gt;dans vos relations avec les interlocuteurs. Vous adorez être sur le terrain et vous êtes impliqué(e) dans tous les aspects opérationnels de votre rôle et dans votre périmètre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client centric&lt;/strong&gt; - être obsédé par nos clients. Vous utilisez des données quantitatives et qualitatives pour construire un service opérationnel excellent pour nos clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptabilité - &lt;/strong&gt;vous êtes enthousiaste, flexible et adaptable, capable de surmonter les obstacles grâce à la facilitation, la créativité et l&#39;ingéniosité. Vous savez quand il est temps de passer un appel et appliquer quotidiennement la règle des 80 / 20.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Esprit d&#39;équipe -&lt;/strong&gt; vous savez collaborer et tirer le meilleur parti des personnes qui vous entourent. Vous êtes capable de travailler efficacement à tous les niveaux de Deliveroo et de réussir avec et par les autres.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimiste et dynamique&lt;/strong&gt; - vous apportez de la fraîcheur, de l&#39;énergie et de la passion dans l&#39;équipe. Vous contribuez à créer un environnement de travail unique, propice aux nouvelles idées et agréable pour les autres personnes impliquées.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues - &lt;/strong&gt;français courant et anglais professionnel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Date de début: Janvier 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons un environnement de travail dynamique et stimulant, où vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de développer vos compétences et de contribuer activement à notre mission de devenir la référence en matière de bien manger. Rejoignez notre équipe exceptionnelle dès maintenant et faites partie de cette aventure passionnante !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous transformons la façon dont le monde mange et fait ses courses en rendant leur accès plus pratique et agréable. Nous connectons les consommateurs, les restaurants, les magasins et les cyclistes. Nous donnons à chaque personne la possibilité d&#39;acheter ce qu&#39;elles veulent, comme elles le veulent, quand elles le veulent et où elles le veulent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous sommes une entreprise axée sur la technologie, à l&#39;avant-garde d’un secteur qui connaît une des expansions les plus rapides au monde. Nous avançons rapidement, valorisons l&#39;autonomie, et sommes toujours en recherche de nouvelles idées et de personnes talentueuses pour nous rejoindre!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Le rôle est basé à Lille (France).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tes principales missions :&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer un &lt;strong&gt;portefeuille de restaurants clés&lt;/strong&gt; sur des zones matures, où l’expertise et l’attention au détail font toute la différence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer des &lt;strong&gt;partenariats privilégiés et durables&lt;/strong&gt; en devenant le point de contact expert de votre zone et en mettant à profit vos connaissances Food Tech.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimiser la performance&lt;/strong&gt; de vos comptes grâce à un accompagnement personnalisé, construit sur le long terme et nourri par la data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser les résultats de vos restaurants, identifier les leviers d’amélioration et &lt;strong&gt;recommander des actions concrètes&lt;/strong&gt; à votre manager tout en restant agile et ouvert à la nouveauté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proposer et mettre en place des &lt;strong&gt;campagnes marketing et promotionnelles&lt;/strong&gt; ciblées pour booster l’attractivité de vos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre de près le déroulé des opérations afin de garantir la meilleure &lt;strong&gt;expérience restaurant&lt;/strong&gt; et &lt;strong&gt;client&lt;/strong&gt; possible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ton expérience et tes qualités :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu as déjà &lt;strong&gt;2 à 3 ans d’expérience&lt;/strong&gt; sur un rôle similaire où la gestion d’un portefeuille de partenaires était centrale à ta mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;négocier&lt;/strong&gt; et anticiper les discussions commerciales tout en gardant à l’esprit les valeurs de Deliveroo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais garder le &lt;strong&gt;contrôle de ton portefeuille&lt;/strong&gt;, identifier les nouvelles tendances du marché et partager du feedback utile à tes partenaires ainsi qu’à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Le &lt;strong&gt;terrain&lt;/strong&gt; est un lieu où tu te sens à ta place : tu sais construire des relations de confiance avec tes partenaires tout en gardant un œil attentif sur la concurrence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais te montrer &lt;strong&gt;proactif&lt;/strong&gt;, analyser les résultats de tes actions et proposer des recommandations concrètes à ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu travailles de manière &lt;strong&gt;autonome&lt;/strong&gt; tout en gardant le cap fixé, sais t’approprier des objectifs précis et mets tout en œuvre pour les atteindre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais concevoir des &lt;strong&gt;actions spécifiques&lt;/strong&gt;, adaptées à la fois aux besoins de tes partenaires et à la stratégie définie par ton manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais identifier, comprendre et analyser les &lt;strong&gt;données de performance&lt;/strong&gt; (commerciales et opérationnelles) pour garantir un niveau de service irréprochable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu sais &lt;strong&gt;t’exprimer en anglais&lt;/strong&gt; (à l’oral comme à l’écrit)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tu arrives à convaincre tout en construisant des relations commerciales solides, durables, où Deliveroo devient le partenaire de choix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Et si tu cherches un poste où tu travailles en &lt;strong&gt;full remote depuis Lille&lt;/strong&gt;, tout en gardant un lien fort avec le terrain et les équipes, alors c’est peut‑être le rôle qu’il te faut !&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Avantages et diversité&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliveroo France valorise la diversité sans discrimination de genre, race, sexualité, religion ou préférences personnelles. Avec un score de 99/100 à l&#39;Indice de l&#39;Égalité Hommes-Femmes 2023, nous sommes engagés envers l&#39;égalité des chances. Rejoignez-nous avec votre passion pour la nourriture dans une entreprise en pleine croissance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_8220454926977230902gmail-docs-internal-guid-9a9f34f4-7fff-014a-c97c-98ca90610a47&quot;&gt;Algolia is the retrieval intelligence layer that turns intent into trusted, decision-grade outcomes. Powering more than 1.7 trillion queries a year for over 18,000 customers with millisecond latency and 99.999% reliability, we are the recognized leader for Search and Product Discovery by top industry analyst firms. The Algolia platform turns a company&#39;s products, content, and business rules into data that humans, applications and AI agents can act upon. The result is trusted customer experiences with stronger conversions for measurable business impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s Engineering team builds the core infrastructure and product features that power real-time search and discovery for thousands of customers around the world. This includes backend services, frontend components, site reliability, and ML-powered capabilities. The team is distributed, collaborative, and committed to technical excellence and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Director&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead multiple teams or a critical product area, working closely with Engineering Managers, Product, and Design to deliver scalable, reliable, and high-impact solutions. You will play a key role in translating company strategy into execution, while building strong, autonomous teams and fostering engineering excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role Will Consist Of:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a &lt;strong&gt;group of engineering teams (via Engineering Managers and Senior ICs)&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring alignment with product and company priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates strong AI leadership within the engineering organization by fostering a culture of &lt;strong&gt;continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; and proactively evaluating and applying emerging AI technologies to enhance productivity, efficiency, and organizational performance across the broader technology function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning &lt;strong&gt;delivery, execution, and operational excellence&lt;/strong&gt; for a defined product or platform area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with &lt;strong&gt;Product, Design, and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/strong&gt; to shape roadmaps and ensure successful delivery of customer value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving &lt;strong&gt;engineering best practices&lt;/strong&gt; across system design, scalability, reliability, and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being a member of Algolia’s senior technology leadership team, with significant contributions to &lt;strong&gt;engineering excellence&lt;/strong&gt; and the &lt;strong&gt;high performance&lt;/strong&gt; of the global technology organization, extending beyond the immediate area of responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting and coaching &lt;strong&gt;Engineering Managers&lt;/strong&gt;, helping them grow as leaders and build high-performing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to &lt;strong&gt;organizational planning&lt;/strong&gt;, including headcount, team structure, and quarterly/annual planning cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring a strong culture of &lt;strong&gt;ownership, accountability, and continuous improvement&lt;/strong&gt; within your organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a &lt;strong&gt;bridge between strategy and execution&lt;/strong&gt;, translating high-level goals into clear team-level priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as a trusted advisor to the CTO and SVP Engineering, providing &lt;strong&gt;strategic guidance&lt;/strong&gt; on engineering leadership, organizational effectiveness, and cross-functional management initiatives across the technology organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Might Be a Fit If You Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8–12+ years of engineering experience&lt;/strong&gt;, including &lt;strong&gt;3–5+ years managing multiple teams or managing through managers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience delivering &lt;strong&gt;complex, cross-functional projects&lt;/strong&gt; in a fast-paced, high-growth environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background with experience in &lt;strong&gt;distributed systems, APIs, and scalable infrastructure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to &lt;strong&gt;lead through others&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering managers and senior engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with the ability to &lt;strong&gt;align diverse stakeholders and drive clarity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience operating in &lt;strong&gt;distributed or global engineering environments&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in &lt;strong&gt;developer tools, infrastructure, or data platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;product-led growth (PLG)&lt;/strong&gt; environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to &lt;strong&gt;AI/ML-powered products or platforms&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Algolia does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, national origin, military status, veteran status, disability status, sexual orientation, gender identity, genetic information, or any other characteristic protected by law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The annual base salary compensation range for this role reflects market pay data within this location. The exact compensation offered for this role may vary depending on specific location and job-related knowledge, technical skills, and experience; and is only one part of our Total Rewards philosophy to compensate and recognize employees for their work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€115.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€150.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORKPLACE STRATEGY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Algolia’s flexible workplace model is designed to empower all Algolians to fulfill our mission to power search and discovery with ease. We place an emphasis on an individual’s impact, contribution, and output, over their physical location. Algolia is a high-trust environment and many of our team members have the autonomy to choose where they want to work and when.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a global presence with offices in Paris, NYC, London, Sydney and Bucharest, however we also offer many of our team members the option to work remotely either as fully remote or hybrid-remote employees.&lt;strong&gt; Positions listed as &quot;Remote&quot; are only available for remote work within the specified country. Positions listed within a specific city are only available in that location - depending on the role it may be available with either a hybrid-remote or in-office schedule.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE’RE LOOKING FOR SOMEONE WHO CAN LIVE OUR VALUES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GRIT&lt;/strong&gt; - Problem-solving and perseverance capability in an ever-changing and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRUST &lt;/strong&gt;- Willingness to trust our co-workers and to take ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CANDOR&lt;/strong&gt; - Ability to receive and give constructive feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CARE&lt;/strong&gt; - Genuine care about other team members, our clients and the decisions we make in the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HUMILITY&lt;/strong&gt; - Aptitude for learning from others, putting ego aside.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for talented, passionate people to help build the world’s best search and discovery technology. We value autonomy, diversity, and collaboration. We’re committed to creating an inclusive workplace where everyone is respected and supported—regardless of race, age, ancestry, religion, sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, marital status, color, veteran status, disability, or socioeconomic background.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IMPORTANT NOTICE FOR CANDIDATES - Recruitment Fraud Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve recently seen an increase in recruitment scams targeting job seekers. To help protect yourself, please keep the following in mind:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our open positions may appear on third-party job boards, but the &lt;strong&gt;best way to apply safely&lt;/strong&gt; is directly through our &lt;strong&gt;careers page&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All genuine communication from Algolia will come from an ----- email address. If you receive an email from someone claiming to work at Algolia who does not have an ----- email address, please do not respond or share any personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’ll &lt;strong&gt;never ask for payments, purchases, or financial details&lt;/strong&gt; during the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;READY TO APPLY?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Backend Engineer in the Vinted Go Carrier domain, you will build backend systems that move parcels through Vinted Go&#39;s own logistics network, between hubs and through warehouses, quickly, reliably and at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Vinted Go, the logistics arm of Vinted, focused on making shipping more affordable, convenient, and reliable. Your team, &lt;strong&gt;Pacman&lt;/strong&gt;, owns mid-mile logistics and warehouse operations automation: how parcels are routed and transported between hubs, and how they are received, labelled, and dispatched.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a strong engineer who also makes the engineers around them better: someone who leads the team&#39;s hardest technical problems and actively shares what they know, so the whole team grows with them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and maintain scalable backend services and APIs that power mid-mile transport and warehouse operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical initiatives end to end, from problem framing and system design through delivery, monitoring, and iteration, and lead projects that span the team or the wider domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architecture and trade-off decisions with a 6–12 month horizon, balancing scalability, reliability, maintainability, and tech debt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help evolve our core service, a large Ruby on Rails modular monolith, towards clearer module boundaries and well-defined APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Operations, Decision Science, and neighboring engineering teams to shape discovery, sequencing, and implementation, and align on contracts and dependencies through RFCs and technical discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively share knowledge: give thoughtful code reviews, pair on hard problems, walk the team through complex changes, and keep documentation useful.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help onboard new team members, mentor engineers informally, and trust others with meaningful work while supporting them to succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with a backend stack that includes Ruby, Vitess, Kafka, Jenkins, Elastic, and observability tools; you do not need to know all of it upfront.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of service reliability, alerts, metrics, SLOs, and incident follow-up, including participation in on-call rotations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take part in hiring by interviewing candidates and helping raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools thoughtfully to improve your development workflow and help the team move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of backend engineering experience, with a track record of building systems and owning work from design through production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Ruby, or the ability and motivation to learn Vinted&#39;s backend stack quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of API design, database-backed systems, observability, and operating services in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works independently on problems of diverse scope, and is someone teammates turn to for advice on difficult technical matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pragmatic problem solver who balances delivery speed, reliability, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with ambiguity and breaking complex product or operational problems into clear technical steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely enjoys sharing knowledge and mentoring others, and sees raising the team&#39;s engineering standards as part of the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gives direct, useful feedback, seeks it in return, and builds alignment across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative and clear communicator who works well with engineers, product managers, operations, and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advantage: experience with logistics, warehouse management, fulfillment, or operational workflows; integrating software with physical devices; or modularizing a large monolith.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;25 working days of holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to all the tools &amp;amp; tech needed for work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Private health insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Pension plan with flexible contribution options and a matching contribution from Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Vilnius office: Gym &amp;amp; in-house meals at friendly prices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;In Kaunas office: a monthly lunch allowance, and a once-a-week provided in-house lunch and breakfast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director of Engineering to lead the Frontend Technologies domain within Marketplace. In this role, your mission will be two-fold:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pivot our frontend setup for bigger efficiency&lt;/strong&gt;: we have been operating in mostly the same frontend setup for at least 6 years, and recognize that change is imminent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive strategic engineering initiatives&lt;/strong&gt;: architect and implement platform-specific changes that enhance modularity, autonomy, resilience, and performance across Android, iOS, and Web.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have to balance and prioritize foundational capabilities - such as Design Systems, CI/CD, Modularization, App Releases, Performance, and Global UI quality - to optimize both frontend developer velocity and user satisfaction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead 4 Engineering Managers and 3 Staff Engineers and set and implement the FE strategy, which will impact the roadmaps of 9 Product domains within the Marketplace.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure the most effective frontend setup for the Marketplace.&lt;/strong&gt; We have 40+ teams, each with 3 frontend engineers (iOS, Android, and Web) in the Marketplace unit. We know this will look different in two years. Deciding what different means, and getting 9 product domains to fund it, is the job&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technology Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Set and drive the future technology strategy for frontends, establishing a modular, scalable architecture that enables rapid development and strategic growth. Basically - raise the technological bar for all Marketplace unit.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refine the domain&#39;s identity: &lt;/strong&gt;Take sole ownership of shaping its future, successfully integrating Design Systems and engineering to treat our frontend platforms as a cohesive product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tactically&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead frontends:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead a horizontal, platform-focused domain containing Android, iOS, Web, and Design System teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee Marketplace-wide technical tooling, core libraries, and frameworks. Lead strategic projects, i.e., frontend modularization and modernization (SwiftUI/Jetpack Compose), native automated testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate global UI quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Integrate design systems and accessibility into the frontend ecosystem to consolidate technical, visual and interaction quality standards. Support UI experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure Resilience &amp;amp; Reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain robust release processes, Marketplace frontend quality, and performance monitoring to reduce downtime and ensure a consistent member experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate &amp;amp; Optimize:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive AI-efficiency enablement in frontend development and explore cross-platform frontend development opportunities to increase engineering speed and productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A lot of this work will be influencing without formal authority&lt;/strong&gt;: Champion the frontend technical vision among your director peers, influencing the leaders of 9 Product domains to accommodate and prioritize platform-wide changes across 40+ teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How much of a technical acumen? &lt;/strong&gt;Enough to have in depth conversations with our direct reports. You will have 4 strong technical EMs reporting to you, as well as 3 world-class staff engineers. We don’t think you need to match their technical competencies (that’s a stretch!), but you have to be able to speak their language, understand problems at their essence, and be able to consolidate and multiply their inputs, including being able to disagree objectively.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;you have a track record of making level change in the organizations that you lead (rather than 20% change). Consolidating your team views and making coherent strategy out of those views is step one. Step two is even more important: being able to implement these changes in your domain, and more so - across other domains in the marketplace - is a foundational ability you carry. In practice, that means you have at least 2 years of experience leading leaders and 5 years of experience influencing without authority.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Change horizon:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable holding two timeframes at once. We need someone who can say, &quot;Here is what our frontend setup should look like in two years, and here is why&quot; AND name the clear deliverable that has to ship in the first quarter to make that end state reachable. Leaders who only do the second are common. Leaders who only do the first are entertaining. We need both.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What this role is not:&lt;/strong&gt; This is not a hands-on frontend or release-engineering role. You will not be tuning CI, owning the release train, or reviewing architecture decisions yourself — you’ll have 4 strong EMs and 3 Staff Engineers close to the details, and your job is to turn their technical judgment into direction, alignment, and organizational change. If your strongest work is deep in the mechanics, you&#39;ll be underused here. If your strongest work is changing how 40+ teams operate, you&#39;ll be busy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ClassPass (Gym Membership subsidy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan with total contribution of 12%, 8% by the Company and 4% by employee&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to spend up to 90 days per year - 21 of which can be spent working outside of the EU - on workation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual Learning Budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in your professional growth! As part of our commitment to continuous learning, we offer an annual learning budget to support your personal and career development through courses, certifications, workshops and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid Work&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve adopted a hybrid workplace model where 2 days in the office are recommended but not enforced. It’s up to you and your team to decide on the exact days you’ll spend working together in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Vinted Group is committed to building an inclusive workplace where people from all walks of life feel a sense of belonging. We welcome applications from people of all backgrounds, identities and life experiences. At Vinted, all applicants are treated fairly without regard to their race, age, religion or belief, sex, national origin, citizenship, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, or any other protected characteristic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€108.600&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€147.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we build mission-critical IT solutions that power some of the most essential operations of our clients. Reliability, craftsmanship, and continuous improvement are at the heart of everything we do. We are looking for a Senior Freelance TypeScript Software Engineer who enjoys designing and building resilient, high-performance systems that have a direct impact on large-scale operational processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will help shape the future of critical digital infrastructures, working on complex challenges where software quality, scalability, and reliability truly matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Freelance Software Engineer with an open mind and a genuine passion for software architecture. Together with our customers, we solve a wide range of challenges, from creating more user-friendly online banking platforms and designing business-critical portals and backend systems, to making industrial environments smarter through the combination of cloud technologies and IoT.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this specific project, you will work closely with developers and architects to design and build software that connects operator- and customer-facing hardware with a large-scale backend platform supporting parcel logistics operations across an international network of hubs. The platform powers critical parcel handling processes throughout Europe and beyond, serving as a key component in the global logistics chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform enables parcel intake, sorting, routing, and grouping processes across distribution hubs. It actively interacts with parcels in real time, processing events generated by scanners, handheld devices, and automated sorting systems. Every parcel moving through the network is represented and tracked by the platform, making it one of the most visible and operationally critical systems within the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this assignment, we are specifically looking for freelance professionals. We offer an initial 6-month contract with the possibility of extension, providing the opportunity to contribute to the continued evolution of a mission-critical platform operating at international scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal colleague brings:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-7+ years of professional software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing and building microservices and event-driven architectures in cloud environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience developing backend solutions with TypeScript and Node.js&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building serverless applications on AWS, particularly with services such as AWS Lambda and DynamoDB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write high-quality, maintainable, reusable, and well-tested code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with large-scale distributed systems processing high volumes of real-time operational events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CI/CD pipelines, such as GitHub Actions, and modern cloud-native development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating services and APIs within complex enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills and the ability to work closely with engineers and architects to design reliable and scalable solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A security-first mindset; practical security experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everyone we work with, and everyone we consider working with, has the right to equal treatment. Our hiring process is designed to be thorough, objective, and fair, ensuring equal opportunities, compensation, and growth for all candidates and colleagues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great teams are built through diversity of thought, background, experience, and perspective. We actively encourage applications from people of different nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and backgrounds, and are committed to fostering an inclusive environment in which everyone can thrive.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Role in Our Story:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ACT is strengthening its data, technology and AI capabilities as we build a more integrated digital platform alongside our core environmental commodities trading and market-making business. This transformation is commercially driven, enabling us to scale, deepen client relationships and support increasingly complex and digital markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Information Security Officer, you will own ACT’s enterprise information security strategy and governance at Group level, spanning our core operations, emerging digital businesses and client-facing technology platforms. You will define the security risk appetite, lead our response to an evolving threat landscape, and ensure security and resilience are embedded by design as our technology landscape develops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across business and technology leadership, you will translate commercial ambition into a pragmatic and scalable security posture that protects our systems and data while maintaining the trust of clients, counterparties and regulators. In essence, your role involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Group-wide information security strategy and roadmap across ACT’s core market-making business and digital and client-facing platforms, aligned with business goals and industry frameworks such as ISO 27001 and NIST CSF. Define and maintain ACT’s cyber risk appetite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and lead security governance, including policies, standards and control frameworks, with clear accountability across the Group. Report on security posture and material incidents to executive leadership and, where relevant, the Board.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client Platforms &amp;amp; Secure-by-Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security-by-design into new products and client platforms, partnering with Data, Architecture and Commercial teams to ensure emerging digital capabilities are secure from inception, while acting as a credible security voice to clients and counterparties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee application, product and SaaS security, embedding security throughout the software development lifecycle for internal and client-facing platforms, and assessing third-party services handling ACT and counterparty data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Resilience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enterprise security risk management, including risk assessments, vulnerability management and third-party/supply-chain risk, driving timely mitigation across core and digital environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct incident preparedness and response, coordinating detection, containment, eradication and recovery, while continuously strengthening incident and crisis-management plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure &amp;amp; Emerging Technology&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure ACT’s cloud and infrastructure through Zero-Trust-aligned controls, including identity and access management, segmentation and encryption, across a hybrid and multi-platform environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern emerging technology and AI security, extending security oversight to AI and data platforms, including model and data-exposure risks and AI-enabled threats, as ACT expands its use of AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure regulatory and compliance alignment, including GDPR, DORA and relevant sector obligations, advising the business on required adaptations and coordinating audits and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the security function and strengthen security culture across the Group, developing the team, raising security awareness, and acting as ACT’s primary authority and trusted advisor on cyber security to executives and business leaders, working alongside existing teams and capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;665&quot; data-end=&quot;786&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Expertise:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful in this role, we are looking for candidates with the following qualifications and attributes:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Information Security, Computer Science or a related field. A relevant Master’s degree is an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10–15 years of progressive experience in information security and cybersecurity, including at least 5 years in a senior security role, with ownership of enterprise security strategy, governance and risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad security leadership experience across incident response, cloud and infrastructure security, product/application security and regulatory compliance. Experience securing client-facing platforms or digital products is highly valuable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within trading, financial services, commodities or another data-intensive and regulated environment is highly advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of security frameworks and standards, including ISO/IEC 27001, NIST Cybersecurity Framework and CIS Controls, with practical experience implementing them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of data protection, regulatory and compliance requirements, including GDPR, DORA and standards such as SOC 2.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional certifications such as CISSP, CISM or CISA, or equivalent, are highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to translate complex security risks into clear business implications and advise technical teams, executives, business stakeholders and clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you meet these criteria and are ready to contribute your expertise to a dynamic and challenging environment, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), you&#39;ll be the deepest technical voice in the field for one product group, helping customers make technical decisions on GitLab&#39;s most important opportunities, roughly the top 10% by size or complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Solutions Architects (Account SAs) will bring you into prioritized opportunities. The Account SA owns the opportunity; you own your product group&#39;s success within it. You&#39;ll work directly with Product and Engineering, bringing customer needs and field insights into roadmap discussions. You&#39;ll also help the wider Solutions Architecture team build expertise through reusable assets, enablement, and coaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll specialize in one product group, not all four. In Security &amp;amp; Compliance, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Ultimate, application security, Dependency Firewall, software supply chain security, compliance, and artificial intelligence (AI) governance. In Platform, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Dedicated, self-managed deployments, bring your own model, and cloud and hybrid architecture. In Core DevSecOps, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Premium, continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD), source code management, Orbit, Artifact Central, and migrations. DevSecOps brings development, security, and operations together across software delivery. In AI &amp;amp; Competitive, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Duo Agent Platform, agentic workflows, AI-native development, competitive displacement including GitHub, and migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will be measured by technical win rate and bookings on SME-engaged opportunities, product-category commit attainment and consumption growth in your region, and Proof of Value (PoV) conversion rate, evaluation cycle time, and time from technical win to production use. We&#39;ll also measure how often Account SAs reuse your assets, their confidence in handling your product group without escalation, and the quality and impact of your feedback to Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical authority for your product group on prioritized opportunities, from discovery and architecture through trials and PoV evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical deep dives, workshops, and executive briefings that connect product capabilities to business outcomes and explain how GitLab differs from competing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve standardized PoV templates with clear, repeatable success criteria. Account SAs own the customer PoV; you&#39;ll contribute product-specific content and expertise while keeping the evaluation connected to the broader GitLab platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip account teams for product launches with Product Management and Product Marketing. Build demos and talk tracks, and turn early customer wins into reference stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for Account SAs and Post-Sales Solutions Architects (Post-Sales SAs) on complex product questions, integrations, and objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off PoV success criteria and architecture decisions to the Post-Sales SA with the account team when an opportunity closes. Stay involved until the customer&#39;s first production workload uses the product, and support complex accounts when Post-Sales SAs bring you in to drive adoption and consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured field feedback, competitive insights, and customer requirements to Product Management and Engineering with the wider SME team. Help manage early-access and design-partner programs, and represent GitLab through customer events, conferences, industry working groups, and published content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reference architectures, demo environments, competitive battlecards, PoV playbooks, and enablement content so account teams can handle more opportunities without your direct involvement. Mentor Account SAs and contribute to GitLab&#39;s global SME community of practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in technical pre-sales, solutions architecture, consulting, or software engineering, with deep, hands-on expertise in one domain: application security testing, supply chain security, and compliance; scalable cloud and hybrid platforms; large CI/CD environments and source code migrations; or production AI-assisted development, working prototypes, and competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical expertise in agentic and AI-assisted development workflows across planning, coding, testing, security, and delivery, applied in a customer-facing, pre-sales context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience winning technical decisions on large, complex enterprise opportunities through structured Proof of Concept (PoC) or PoV evaluations with defined success criteria and executive sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git, CI/CD, containers, Kubernetes, and at least one major cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead a whiteboard session with engineers and present the business case to executives in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, including the ability to turn complex topics into clear playbooks that others use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working asynchronously across time zones with Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: public speaking, published technical content, open source contributions, or relevant certifications in Kubernetes, cloud architecture, or security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you bring transferable experience in an adjacent domain, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building our SME organization within GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architecture team, and we&#39;re distributed and all-remote.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wil je samen bouwen aan leuke projecten?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Krijg je energie van het uitwerken van complexe vraagstukken en het adviseren van klanten in hun bedrijfsprocessen? Als senior Production consultant sleutel je in wisselende projectteams aan het ontwerp, de realisatie en implementatie van Microsoft Dynamics 365 voor klanten in de productie-industrie. Met jouw kennis zet je rock-solid oplossingen neer bij onze klanten, stuk voor stuk indrukwekkende spelers die jou een unieke inkijk geven in hun business (van shopfloor tot data analytics).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat breng je mee?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent een ondernemende teamspeler en een pro actieve consultant op alle niveaus, van eindgebruiker tot management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Denken in en vanuit processen, niet vanuit schermen/velden;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent nieuwsgierig en vraagt door, je wilt de vraag achter de vraag weten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je hebt een helicopterview;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je wil het naadje van de kous weten (en kunnen uitleggen) als het gaat om bedrijfsapplicaties en hoe deze bedrijfsprocessen van de klant kunnen ondersteunen en verbeteren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je integreert soepel in een team en gaat voor een goede samenwerking met klanten en collega’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent ambitieus en je wilt je graag verbinden aan een organisatie die gaat voor de lange termijn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oftewel: jij zoekt uitdaging om je te ontwikkelen en om je loopbaan verder vorm te geven.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Je beschikt over&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een afgeronde HBO- of WO opleiding, bij voorkeur in de richting van Engineering (Industrial of logistics), Supply Chain Management of een vergelijkbare opleiding;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimaal 5+ jaar ervaring als ERP-consultant of in een functie waarin je intensief hebt gewerkt met ERP binnen het productie domein;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ervaring met diverse grondvormen (ETO, MTO, MTS, ATO, CTO);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Ervaring met zowel discrete- als procesindustrie&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deze kennis en ervaring heb je bij voorkeur aangevuld met ervaring in Microsoft Dynamics 365 Supply Chain Management of een vergelijkbaar ERP systeem;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede kennis van de Nederlandse en Engelse taal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat bieden we jou?&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Werken bij HSO is uitdagend, we willen je daar graag een goede beloning voor teruggeven. Naast goede primaire voordelen bieden wij: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een competitief salaris, een jaarlijkse bonus op basis van bedrijfs-, team- en individuele prestaties;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobiliteitsvergoeding waarbij je of een auto kunt leasen of het bedrag toe kunt voegen aan je salaris. Daarbovenop krijg 100% betaald van de ov-kosten;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 vakantiedagen met de mogelijkheid om er 35 van te maken; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybride werken, vanuit huis, op kantoor (Rotterdam, Veenendaal) of zelfs tijdens je Workation; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EUR 65,- netto vitaliteitsbudget – we vinden het belangrijk dat we gezond blijven en een veilige werkplek hebben, zowel op kantoor als remote; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je kunt deelnemen aan het leasefietsplan; &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;En vooral een leven lang leren. Op dag één start jouw onboardingprogramma, daarnaast krijg je een persoonlijk studiebudget dat je kunt inzetten voor jouw professionele ontwikkeling en ontvang je ook een GoodHabitz account, een online trainingstool voor je persoonlijke ontwikkeling.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vrijheid, flexibiliteit en fun&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je werkt in een internationale omgeving met professionals met verschillende nationaliteiten. Een flexibele werkweek van 40, 36 of 32 uur behoort tot de mogelijkheden omdat wij van mening zijn dat jouw manier van werken bij jouw levensstijl moet passen. HSO heeft professionals in dienst die plezier hebben in hun werk en klaar staan voor elkaar. Om het plezier in ons werk nog groter te maken, organiseren we uiteraard teamuitjes en bedrijfsfeesten, maar ook wekelijkse zomerborrels op ons dakterras, allerlei sportactiviteiten en is er de mogelijkheid bij te dragen aan onze Maatschappelijk Verantwoord Ondernemen-werkzaamheden.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Over HSO  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is de eerste full-service Microsoft Partner in Nederland. Samen met ruim 2500 getalenteerde medewerkers in Europa, Azië en Noord-Amerika verlenen we ondersteuning op lokaal en internationaal niveau aan industriële bedrijven, retailers, financiële en zakelijke dienstverleners en overheidsinstellingen. &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt; HSO is voortdurend op zoek naar nieuw talent. We blijven onze wereldwijde community uitbreiden en scheppen er plezier in om samen te werken met prestatiegerichte mensen met een ondernemersgeest. Professionals die voortdurend willen leren en innoveren. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solliciteren &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enthousiast? Heb je vragen vooraf? &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neem dan contact op met Sander van den Bogaard op : -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-pasted=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SiTime&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SiTime Corporation is the precision timing company. Our semiconductor MEMS programmable solutions offer a rich feature set that enables customers to differentiate their products with higher performance, smaller size, lower power and better reliability. With more than 3 billion devices shipped, SiTime is changing the timing industry. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=KZboO_E5KYNf2nXu9snYUrujcxPVV14r8VUqaw-krQjviK4SVzg-T3gX0Yv8pdrIU2yKG5VITW08WA-AWCTQKQ==&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.sitime.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the team that is revolutionizing the timing industry with the best silicon Microelectromechanical Systems (MEMS) timing products in the world. As a Principal MEMS Development Engineer, you will use your technical and creative problem-solving skills to push forward MEMS technology and engineer resonators for SiTime’s next-generation timing products. It is not necessary to meet all job requirements to be a qualified candidate for the position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead definition and execution of challenging technical projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise management of challenges, impact, recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop new or improved resonators, MEMS technologies and/or products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design MEMS devices and characterize their electrical, mechanical, and thermal performance on wafer level and/or device level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with process team to drive continuous improvement in MEMS yields.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extend and enhance automated infrastructure for MEMS design, measurements, and data analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and analyze experiments to understand device physics, materials, and fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with local and overseas vendors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in cross-functional teams, including circuits, systems, and packaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working/supporting other projects as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications &amp;amp; Requirements: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ph.D. in ME, EE, Physics, or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 3 years of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled scientist with ability to design, conduct, and analyze experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem identification and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of mechanics, electrodynamics, thermodynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in fundamentals of MEMS devices physics and fabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with finite element simulation tools (COMSOL, ANSYS) and data processing tools (Matlab, Python).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal, organizational, written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for delivering exceptional results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired Characteristics &amp;amp; Attributes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 -10 years of industry experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intermediate to advanced knowledge of programing languages, circuits, metrology equipment and methods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Statistical analysis and tools such as R or JMP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge in MEMS microfabrication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation Range:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SiTime, we believe great work deserves great rewards. We offer a comprehensive and highly competitive compensation package designed to attract top talent.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;In addition to base salary, this role is eligible for a quarterly bonus tied to the achievement of innovation goals—reflecting our commitment to recognizing meaningful impact. We also offer equity grants, providing a meaningful opportunity to share in the company’s future growth and success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SiTime is an &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.sitime.com/images/EEO-is-the-law.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;We treat each person fairly and we do not tolerate discrimination or harassment against anyone on the basis of any protected characteristics, including race, color, religion, national or ethnic origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, age, disability, pregnancy, political affiliation, protected veteran status, protected genetic information, or marital status or other characteristics protected by law.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn More about SiTime:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Review the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sitime.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Get to Know SiTime&lt;/a&gt; section of our career page to explore our culture, values, and what makes us unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul type=&quot;disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.innovatorsontap.com/podcast/the-philosophy-of-innovation-w-rajesh-vashist&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Innovation on Top – Philosophies of Innovation with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fabricatedknowledge.com/p/an-interview-with-rajesh-vashist-3e0#details&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fabrication Knowledge – An Interview with Rajesh Vashist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/user/sitimecorp/videos&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;SiTime Corporation – YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Autonomous Drone Software Engineer to join a swarming programme. As an engineer on a lean, high-impact team, you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will not be siloed; this role spans the entire autonomy lifecycle, from developing autonomy capabilities to investigating real-world flight-test data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across the autonomy stack and partner integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with hardware engineers, product managers, and external partners to define system requirements and translate them into robust software architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement robust distributed state machines, leader election protocols, and fault-tolerant architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code while confidently managing complex concurrency and contention scenarios&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and run rigorous tests utilizing SITL/HITL simulation environments to validate code prior to physical deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in code reviews, architectural discussions, and technical documentation to elevate the team&#39;s engineering standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act decisively during flight-test investigations, applying strong engineering judgment to physical failure modes and release safety&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of professional engineering experience in robotics, embedded systems, or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep proficiency in modern C++, with practical experience designing, reasoning about, and debugging highly concurrent systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded systems experience working close to hardware on real-time or safety-critical platforms (e.g., avionics, automotive, robotics).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong architectural understanding of distributed systems, with the ability to deliberately evaluate and select consensus designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with robust release management, versioned artifacts, and pinned dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4, MAVLink, and related drone software ecosystems is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Engineer at Auterion, you will play a pivotal role in the successful development, integration and deployment of Auterion-powered drone systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will collaborate closely with the production, hardware engineering, and firmware/software teams, as well as operations, ensuring that every platform transitions smoothly from an airframe concept into a fully validated flying robot ready for deployment. You will serve as the primary technical interface for partners, work closely with them to understand their technical requirements, configure and adapt existing solutions, contribute to core software development, and ensure successful implementation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for an engineer who enjoys combining hands-on technical work with customer collaboration and system-level problem solving, bridging the gap between hardware, firmware, and real-world flight performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate in a highly hands-on environment with evolving system requirements, rapidly iterating across hardware and software integration challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage software releases and perform firmware flashing and configuration using PX4 or adjacent autopilot ecosystems, including sensor calibration, ESC tuning, and system bring-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide deep avionics and airframe expertise, including autopilot tuning, sensor and payload integration, power systems and airworthiness considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work independently to troubleshoot integration and flight-readiness issues while collaborating cross-functionally with hardware engineering, firmware/software teams, operations, and QC engineering to escalate complex challenges when required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary technical authority in customer engagements, translating mission requirements into concrete system architectures and demonstrable solutions built on AuterionOS and Skynode.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in flight testing activities to validate platform stability, safety, and mission performance, resolving technical issues often directly in the field during customer trials and demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical documentation and continuous improvement of engineering processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed customer and market requirements back into product and engineering teams to influence the roadmap of the Auterion stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Software, Electrical, Mechanical, Aerospace or Robotics Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in C/C++ and Python: you can read, debug and patch existing code and write small tools and scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable in Linux environments, including the command line, logs, Docker and basic networking (IP, TCP/UDP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on hardware-software integration: system bring-up, wiring and connectors, and embedded interfaces (UART, CAN, I2C, SPI) at a practical level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured troubleshooting: you can isolate whether a problem is software, hardware, configuration or RF, often under time pressure in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator: you can explain technical issues clearly to customers and operators, and report findings back to engineering in a way they can act on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers, including at test ranges and in field environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;EU citizenship (required for security clearance and customer requirements)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with PX4 or ArduPilot, MAVLink, QGroundControl or mission planning tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UAV flight testing and validation in operational environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with datalinks and radio systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous customer-facing or field engineering role, especially with defense or government customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German language skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extended social security package&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellpass membership&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verve has created a more efficient and privacy-focused way to buy and monetize advertising. Verve is an ecosystem of demand and supply technologies fusing data, media, and technology together to deliver results and growth to both advertisers and publishers–no matter the screen or location, no matter who, what, or where a customer is. With offices across the globe and with an eye on servicing forward-thinking advertising customers, Verve’s solutions are trusted by more than 90 of the United States’ top 100 advertisers, 4,000 publishers globally, and the world’s top demand-side platforms. Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/&quot;&gt;verve.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Der fehlende Wirkungsnachweis ist das größte Problem im stationären Handel für Werbungtreibende.&amp;nbsp;Obwohl Marken Millionen in Werbung am Point of Sale investieren, können sie nicht belegen, ob daraus&lt;br&gt;Käufe wurden.&amp;nbsp;Verve Retail Media (VRM) löst dieses Problem. Wir vermarkten und betreiben digitale Werbe-Screens in&amp;nbsp;mehreren tausend LEH-, Drogerie- und Convenience-Standorten und verbinden sie mit digitalen&lt;br&gt;Coupons, Retargeting im CTV und anderen Offsite-Kanälen. Marken buchen bei uns keine isolierten Werbeformate, sondern 360-Grad-Kampagnen, die zu Hause starten und bis zum Einkaufsregal reichen -eine Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VRM ist die eigenständige Retail Media Unit der börsennotierten Verve Group SE. Wir arbeiten wie ein&amp;nbsp;schnell skalierendes Startup mit AI-First-Strategie über alle Funktionen und mit Zugriff auf die&amp;nbsp;Infrastruktur eines internationalen AdTech-Unternehmens mit über einer Billionen ausgelieferter&amp;nbsp;Werbeimpressionen pro Jahr. Zur Verve Retail Media gehört seit kurzem der Couponing- und&amp;nbsp;Cashback-Spezialist acardo.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle in einem Satz&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Du trägst eine Hunter-Mentalität in dir und gewinnst neue Umsätze bei FMCG-Marken, indem du&amp;nbsp;integrierte Shopper Activation Kampagnen verkaufst: d.h. coupon-getriebene Conversion und messbarer&amp;nbsp;Sales Lift, idealerweise erweitert um Screen-Präsenz im Markt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was du verkaufst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein kombiniertes Produkt aus digitaler Sichtbarkeit im Markt Screens an Eingang, Fläche, Kasse), Aktivierung am Point of Sale (über Coupons) und Closed-Loop-Messung auf Basis realer Kassendaten (anstatt isolierter Werbeflächen oder losgelöster Coupons)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kampagnen, die drei Logiken beim Kunden verbinden: Markenreichweite, Abverkauf und Kategorie-Relevanz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;360Grad-Aktivierung, die über den Markt hinausgeht: (Re)Targeting im CTV und weiteren Offsite-Kanälen als Verlängerung der In-Store-Kampagne&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konkrete Beweispunkte aus Pilotprojekten: z.B. 9% Uplift auf Store-Ebene, 20% in ausgewählten Kategorien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An wen du verkaufst&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkt an FMCG-Marken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Ansprechpartner kommen meist aus Brand und Media (-Planung und -Einkauf) und verwalten &lt;span class=&quot;s4&quot;&gt;drei Budgettöpfe mit unterschiedlichen Zielen, Freigabelogiken und Erfolgsmetriken&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eigene Pipeline aufbauen, entwickeln, priorisieren und mit belastbarem Forecast führen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Neukunden und Stakeholder (horizontal und vertikal) gewinnen und Kunden zu wiederkehrenden Partnern entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Den kompletten Sales-Zyklus verantworten: Erstansprache, Qualifizierung, Bedarfsanalyse, Angebot, Verhandlung und Abschluss. Mit Abschluss erfolgt die Übergabe ans AdOps Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kundenziele in Media- und Aktivierungskonzepte übersetzen: Touchpoints, Reichweiten, Zielgruppen, Mechaniken Cashback, Gratis-Testen, Kategorie-Trigger), Messansatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales-Lift-Daten und Pilotergebnisse als Beweispunkte im Pitch einsetzen, um aus ersten Testbudgets hohe wiederkehrende Volumina zu machen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;VRM gegenüber konkurrierenden Retail-Media-Formaten klar differenzieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback aus dem Markt in Produkt, Pitchmaterial und Go-to-Market zurückspielen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So ist die Rolle aufgesetzt&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein Individual Contributor ohne Personalverantwortung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du berichtest direkt an die CSO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verkaufst eigenständig, aber nicht allein: Media Planning entwickelt das Kampagnen-Setup, Ad Operations steuert die Auslieferung, Data Science liefert den Wirkungsnachweis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dein Fokus ist kommerziell: Pipeline, Abschluss, Kundentiefe, Wiederbuchung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum diese Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du liebst es, Dinge von Grund auf mit aufzubauen. Denn bei uns steigst du nicht in eine fertige Vermarktungsmaschine mit festem Produktkatalog ein, sondern du baust eine neue Mediagattung im deutschen Markt mit auf. Die Deals, die du jetzt gewinnst, werden intern und extern zu Referenzen. Sie prägen, wie Marken und Agenturen In-Store Retail Media künftig bewerten und einkaufen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Echte Ownership: deine Pipeline, deine Kunden, dein Umsatz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direkter Zugang zu CSO und CEO bei strategischen Kunden&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein Produkt, das mehr kann als Reichweite verkaufen: Sichtbarkeit, Aktivierung und messbare Wirkung bis zum Kauf&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI-gestützte Tools und Workflows, die deine Produktivität vervielfachen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wenn du lieber Benchmarks setzt als bestehende Playbooks abarbeitest, ist das die richtige Rolle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Verve bietet allen Mitarbeitenden und Bewerber:innen gleiche Beschäftigungschancen und verbietet Diskriminierung und&amp;nbsp;Belästigung jeglicher Art, unabhängig von Herkunft, Geschlecht, Religion, Alter, sexueller Orientierung, Geschlechtsidentität,&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Behinderung oder anderen gesetzlich geschützten Merkmalen.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;Verve provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you are a California resident subject to the California Consumer Privacy Act, &lt;a href=&quot;https://verve.com/california-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;If you are located in the EU or UK visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot; href=&quot;https://verve.com/applicant-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt; to understand how Verve processes your personal information and how you can exercise your rights.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the VP &amp;amp; GM EU Center and work closely with Medical Affairs, Market Access, Patient Advocacy, Supply Chain and Finance, as well as global commercial teams, to drive strategic initiatives that support BridgeBio’s mission of delivering transformative medicines to patients with genetic diseases and genetically driven cancers. Your primary purpose will be to build and lead the commercial organisation in Germany, Austria and Switzerland, preparing and executing the launches in ADH1 and achondroplasia and building the foundation for future indications. You will lead the field force, including Disease Network Specialists who will move into Key Account Manager roles after launch, and drive the local adaptation of disease awareness and marketing materials, the local execution of customer service offerings, and forecasting and demand planning, with a focus on pre-launch readiness in 2027, followed by launch execution and growth. This role requires effective collaboration with cross-functional colleagues and external stakeholders to ensure high-quality execution and impact. The ideal candidate&amp;nbsp;combines deep expertise in rare disease commercial leadership and launch execution with strong communication skills, adaptability, and the ability to thrive in a fast-paced, hands-on environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Field force leadership: Build, lead and develop the commercial field team across Germany, Austria and Switzerland, including the move from pre-launch disease education to key account management after launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Launch readiness and execution: Own the commercial launch plans for ADH1 and achondroplasia in each country, and set up a model that can take on future indications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Local marketing adaptation: Adapt global disease awareness and marketing materials to local needs, languages and regulations, and take them through local review and approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer service offerings: Ensure flawless local execution of HCP service offerings, together with Medical Affairs and external vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forecasting and demand planning: Own the local forecast and demand plan, align it with Supply Chain and Finance, and track performance against plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional partnership: Work closely with Medical Affairs, Market Access and Patient Advocacy so that launch, access and field activities are coordinated in each country&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance and governance: Make sure all commercial activities comply with HWG, the Austrian Medicines Act (AMG), the Swiss Therapeutic Products Act (HMG) and the industry codes in each country, and that clear boundaries are kept with medical activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This is a field-based leadership role based in Germany, ideally in the Munich area, covering Germany, Austria and Switzerland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approximately 50% travel is anticipated for field visits, customer meetings, congresses and internal meetings, including regular visits to our Zug office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in life sciences, pharmacy, medicine or business. An advanced degree (MBA, PhD, PharmD) is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 12 years of commercial experience in pharma or biotech, including at least 5 years leading field teams, ideally in rare diseases, endocrinology or paediatrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of at least one successful launch in Germany, ideally a rare disease or orphan drug launch, with experience in Austria and/or Switzerland a strong plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Positive, inspiring and tenacious leader, experienced in biotech build-out environments, solution-driven and hands-on, with high integrity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of forecasting, demand planning and P&amp;amp;L management, and of how pricing and reimbursement (AMNOG, EKO, SL) shape the commercial plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using digital engagement channels and driving productivity with AI tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German, and fluent English to work effectively with international and US-based colleagues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 50% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market leading compensation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model - we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We provide career development through regular feedback, continuous education and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We celebrate strong performance with financial rewards, peer-to-peer recognition, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;For BridgeBio Full-Time U.S Based Roles:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Rewards&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Market-leading compensation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;401(k) with employer match&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Program (ESPP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;5&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:1080,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Pre-tax commuter benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(transit and parking)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
