&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data and AI Engineer (Market Lead), UKI&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data and AI Engineer (Market Lead), UKI&lt;/strong&gt; · Director level · London preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Director-level Market Lead to head our Data &amp;amp; AI practice in the UK &amp;amp; Ireland. This is a hybrid leadership role. You combine deep technical solutioning with real commercial skill, and you are credible both in an architecture debate and across the table from a CDO, CIO or CFO.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Our delivery model is shifting from large time-and-materials teams to small, AI-first pods working against a business outcome. As Market Lead, you will shape how we take that model to UKI clients: what we sell, how we price it, and how we staff and deliver it. You will lead a core team of 5–6 direct reports and a wider matrix of around 50-75 people across UKI, and you will help them build the skills this shift requires. We are developing these ways of working together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main focus and responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial and solutioning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive commercial success on complex Data &amp;amp; AI deals across UKI, from shaping the opportunity through to a signed deal. This includes structuring fixed-price and outcome-linked commercial models, and understanding delivery cost, margin and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with tech advisory and industry domain leads from pre-sale through delivery, so the commercial story, the architecture and the sector insight reinforce one another.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frame and test business-outcome hypotheses with executives, and define thin slices of delivery that prove value quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You stay close enough to delivery to know what is realistic, and you share accountability for outcomes on the deals you sell.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spearhead growth of the UKI Data &amp;amp; AI practice: build, lead, scale and mentor a high-performing team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with delivery and talent leads to match demand with capacity, so the right people and pods are available when deals land. Keep specialist skills sourced and bench waste low.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shift the practice&#39;s capability mix towards production AI engineering and agentic delivery, through hiring, reskilling and role-based onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Client engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage executive-level relationships with CDOs, CIOs, CISOs and other CXOs. Act as a sparring partner on AI strategy: challenge assumptions, size the opportunity, and help clients decide where agentic automation and AI can move the P&amp;amp;L.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage robust sales pipelines and lead strategic client workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on responsible AI, covering risk, governance and regulatory expectations in the UK and wider markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expected to lead and drive P&amp;amp;L with TCV of 50 -75 M GBP and ACV of 45-50 M GBP/&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expected experience and capabilities in driving all P&amp;amp;L criterias including sales, margin, utilization, bench management, training, learning, partnership based sales etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;deal candidate profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate is a true dual-threat practitioner, equally at home in a complex architecture discussion and in closing a large commercial deal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Criterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Significant senior experience in data and AI consulting, typically 15+ years, with a track record in leadership roles. You are neither a pure solution architect nor a pure sales profile.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial track record&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;History of selling multiple large-scale data and AI deals, ideally including recent GenAI or agentic engagements, and able to discuss deal shape, pricing structure, trade-offs and delivery and business value delivery in concrete terms.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical expertise&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong solutioning background in complex ecosystems: data platforms and data products, data governance, and AI systems in production, including agentic and LLM-based systems. You understand failure modes, evaluation, cost and risk, not just architecture diagrams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data/AI balance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Roughly 70/30, with demonstrable recent depth in AI (last 2–4 years), for example AI agents, AI advisory or AI foundations with large UK clients. Data depth is the foundation, but hand on AI credibility is required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tech stack&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong cloud proficiency in at least one major platform (GCP, AWS or Azure). Snowflake or Databricks experience is a strong plus. Familiarity with the AI tooling and model platforms available on those clouds is expected. Experience on NVIDIA and other modern tech stacks will be great addition&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial acumen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable with P&amp;amp;L, business cases and ROI conversations, and able to negotiate with CFO-level stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience leading and scaling teams of this size, in a matrix, through change.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/tbody&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location and travel&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;UK-wide remit. London-based candidates (or within about a two-hour commute) are preferred, with 1–2 days a week in the London office for collaboration and leadership visibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly once or twice travel to customer location in UKI.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft skills and cultural fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring drive and resilience, and you build momentum in a fast-changing environment&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence: exceptional communication, with real C-level exposure and comfort presenting and negotiating with CDOs and CXOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitation of strategic workshops and consultative client conversations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort leading through ambiguity while the delivery model and competency frameworks are still maturing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coaching mindset: you grow other leaders and raise AI fluency across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Thoughtwork&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;s&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we&#39;re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For 30+ years, we&#39;ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let&#39;s be extraordinary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;description content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking to expand our Go-To-Market team in RCTT (short for Retail, Consumer, Travel and Transportation) in Europe with a special focus on the Retail sector in the UK&amp;amp;I.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Specifically, we are looking for a leader who is experienced with selling and delivering digital transformations encompassing our core offerings of Customer Experience, Product Innovation, Enterprise Platform Modernization, Data Modernization, AI Readiness, Engineering Excellence and Digital Application and Maintenance Operations (DAMO).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be inheriting one large portfolio in the Retail space based on which you will grow the existing account, and acquire new accounts based on your network, your industry expertise and our marketing activities and in close collaboration with your account team, our industry and service line specialists and the RCTT market organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Client Principals, you are responsible for the entire sales cycle (lead generation through proposal, contract negotiation and closure) as well as client relationship management, account strategy and planning, joint delivery governance and project reviews.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This includes e.g.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Understand the industry context, the customer problem and define mutual value ● Develop and execute on key account plans and overall go-to-market&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Acquire and nurture senior client relationships on strategic accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Achieve established revenue and profitability targets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Work closely with the account leadership team (consisting e.g. of the account tech director and account delivery director)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Actively participate in the go-to-market plan creation/refinement for your account as well as for the industry vertical (RCTT), and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;● Report account activity, opportunity status and other details to the RCTT leadership (portfolio director)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-responsibilities&quot;&gt;Job responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-responsibilities content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Establish, build, and maintain long-term, value-based relationships with a growing number of senior client stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Farm and manage between one and three accounts at a time (including 1-2 prospect accounts).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Drive $20 million to $50 million in revenue per year from accounts to meet or exceed profitability targets.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the creation and execution of existing account strategies, and build “win-win” value propositions at the company and individual levels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop a range of IP and best practices around client and portfolio development in order to build the client base into a significant strategic asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Approach client executives as true business partners versus software delivery partners, expanding the company’s breadth and depth to its full potential.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Work on continuous margin improvement in sold and delivered margin.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;job-qualifications&quot;&gt;Job qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-qualifications content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;technical-skills&quot;&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;qualifications inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A deep understanding of the retail (and ideally also the consumer goods) industry, familiarity with the main industry trends and drivers as well as relevant players (e.g. eco-system partners).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong network in the industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Experience working in many different executive revenue-generating roles requiring strong business acumen.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success managing and developing sophisticated senior client relationships and strategic business partnerships across the C-suite.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to a clients’ business using a highly consultative and solution-oriented approach.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive thought leadership and innovation experience for clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence decisions by bringing in relevant industry trends and client stories on innovation and digital disruption.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in agile (custom) software development project delivery with the ability to understand the momentum of technical projects and the challenges a highly technical team will face in project execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;professional-skills&quot;&gt;Professional Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;skills inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A strategic thinker, with the ability to translate concepts and ideas into practical and tactical action and the skills to create value propositions for clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;A goal-oriented self-starter, with strong consultative instincts and skills who quickly and easily establishes rapport and credibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable seeking out and interfacing with external constituents, and has the personal and social attributes to create and then manage effective long-lasting relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Skilled at negotiation and working in an ecosystem with external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Must be able to craft visions and adopt progressive points of view regarding the future, and rally people around the agendas that drive change.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks strategically, but also is highly skilled at execution in a complex environment with multiple stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A leader who inspires and grows a team who understands what it means to “put the team over self” .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;The ability to lead and motivate account and software development teams with creativity,imagination, energy, and enthusiasm.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important things to know&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Projects are almost exclusively on customer site, so candidates should be flexible and open to travel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not quite ready to apply? Or maybe this isn’t the right role for you? That’s OK, you can stay in touch with our digital leaders by joining Perspectives, our network for business insights in technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is the policy of ThoughtWorks, Inc. to provide a work environment free of discrimination. The Company will take affirmative action to ensure applicants and ThoughtWorks employees are treated without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, ethnic origin, veteran status, family status, disability, sexual orientation, gender expression or gender identity. This also includes individuals who are perceived to have any of the aforementioned attributes. ThoughtWorks will adhere to all federal, state, and municipal laws and regulations governing employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;important-things&quot;&gt;Other things to know&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;important-things content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;inner-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There is no one-size-fits-all career path at Thoughtworks: however you want to develop your career is entirely up to you. But we also balance autonomy with the strength of our cultivation culture. This means your career is supported by interactive tools, numerous development programs and teammates who want to help you grow. We see value in helping each other be our best and that extends to empowering our employees in their career journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;responsible-ai-use&quot;&gt;Responsible Use of AI in Recruitment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;responsible-ai-use content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Thoughtworks, we use AI tools to support our recruitment team with administrative tasks such as drafting communications, scheduling interviews and writing job descriptions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Crucially, our AI tools do not screen, assess, rank or make hiring decisions. Every application is reviewed by our team and all selection decisions are made exclusively by our interviewers and hiring managers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to fairness and responsible AI. We actively manage our AI systems by testing, monitoring for biased outcomes and implementing mitigation measures. We hold our third-party vendors to these same high standards through a rigorous governance process. For additional information, please see our full &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Thoughtworks AI Policy for Recruitment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;about&quot;&gt;About Thoughtworks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;about content&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thoughtworks is a dynamic and inclusive community of bright and supportive colleagues who are revolutionizing tech. As a leading technology consultancy, we’re pushing boundaries through our purposeful and impactful work. For 30+ years, we’ve delivered extraordinary impact together with our clients by helping them solve complex business problems with technology as the differentiator. Bring your brilliant expertise and commitment for continuous learning to Thoughtworks. Together, let’s be extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;display: none;&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.thoughtworks.com/careers/ai-policy-for-recruitment&quot;&gt;See here our AI policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CoreWeave’s Global Tax Team’s mission is to mitigate risk, drive operational efficiencies, and add financial value by combining technical expertise with a proactive, collaborative approach to global taxation. We are seeking a Senior Manager, International Tax Operations, to join our team. This role will be crucial in managing international tax operations, including income tax compliance and provision. It is a unique opportunity to share and influence global tax strategies at a rapidly growing technology company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within our AI native Tax Department, this high-impact London-based role offers significant opportunities. You will play a part in influencing our global tax strategy and operations across EMEA and APAC. Reporting to the Director of Tax Operations, you will manage international tax matters in a fast-paced regulatory and business environment. You will partner with the Global Tax team (direct tax operations, advisory and controversy, indirect tax), Controllership and business operations counterparts, and external advisors to ensure compliance and deliver the company’s direct tax compliance and reporting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance and provision&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage non-US direct tax filings prepared by internal teams and external advisors, including matters related to Pillar 2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advising on local income tax compliance and other reporting obligation matters including DAC 6, anti-hybrid regulations, CbCr, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Controllership in the preparation of statutory financial statements, including the calculation of statutory tax provisions and advise on income tax reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhancing internal controls to ensure accurate accounting for income taxes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building up and liaising with external tax service providers and external auditors in the region on our co-sourcing engagement across tax and statutorily financial statements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-lead with Director of Tax Operations the build out of APAC provision and compliance processes in 2027, whilst remaining focused on the expansion of EMEA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with indirect tax team on various matters including entity expansion, and indirect tax impacts of intercompany transactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Treasury to support global cash management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and leverage AI tools to enhance and streamline income tax reporting and provision processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advisory Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support local management in the integration of M&amp;amp;A targets into CoreWeave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support and management of ex-US income tax controversy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look for tax opportunities via our co-sourcing relationships (i.e. non-US R&amp;amp;D credits, withholding tax relief, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of international and OECD legislative and statutory tax changes that may impact&amp;nbsp; CoreWeaveProvide guidance on international tax topics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ACA, CA, CTA, ACCA or comparable corporate tax and accounting knowledge&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of progressive corporate tax experience in public accounting and multinational companies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid technical tax knowledge across EMEA and APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in managing global projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, analytical, and communication skills with executive presence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical thinking and problem-solving abilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in building with new technology and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you’re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams – even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we’ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we’d love to talk.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love to understand the “why” behind business operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re curious about tax regulations and their business implications and expanding your knowledge of tax developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an expert in translating complex tax concepts into actionable business guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We’re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We’re not afraid of a little chaos, and we’re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and provides the opportunity to develop innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the growth opportunities within the organization are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Updated privacy notice - UK and EU Job Applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;m_-113912706363268805m_-2746164444908759431gmail-docs-internal-guid-131e4fb0-7fff-b4e9-ff50-e8cf32449b1b&quot;&gt;CoreWeave is The Essential Cloud for AI™. Built for pioneers by pioneers, CoreWeave delivers a platform of technology, tools, and teams that enables innovators to build and scale AI with confidence. Trusted by leading AI labs, startups, and global enterprises, CoreWeave combines superior infrastructure performance with deep technical expertise to accelerate breakthroughs and turn compute into capability. Founded in 2017, CoreWeave became a publicly traded company (Nasdaq: CRWV) in March 2025. Learn more at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coreweave.com&quot;&gt;www.coreweave.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We&#39;re proud to be a Living Wage accredited Employer.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Physical AI team at CoreWeave is building the compute foundation for the next era of AI. We focus on one of the highest-conviction bets in the company: enabling autonomous vehicle developers to train, simulate and validate intelligent driving systems at scale. Our team connects CoreWeave&#39;s specialised AI cloud with the software workflows that power autonomous driving development, from processing fleet and sensor data to running complex simulations and training advanced AI models. We operate where the demands of autonomy push conventional cloud architectures to their limits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Principal Architect for Autonomous Vehicles, you will have founding-team-level influence and own the overarching product and technical strategy for CoreWeave&#39;s autonomous vehicle offering. You will shape the roadmap across data processing, distributed training, simulation and validation, working alongside product, research, engineering and commercial stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This hands-on technical leadership role spans the full stack, from bare-metal GPU/CPU topologies, networking and storage through workload orchestration to application-facing APIs and autonomous driving software ecosystems, including NVIDIA&#39;s. You will define how fleet data, sensor simulation, synthetic data generation and closed-loop evaluation fit together into reproducible workflows, balancing simulation fidelity, throughput, reliability and cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner directly with automotive manufacturers, suppliers and autonomous vehicle developers to understand their requirements, identify capability gaps and translate platform capabilities into deployed solutions. You will guide strategic customer engagements, establish reference architectures and help turn technical advances into customer adoption and commercial growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of founding, leading or architecting autonomous vehicle platforms, simulation systems or AI infrastructure that reached production or commercial deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of autonomous driving workflows, including perception, prediction and planning, and how data, model training, simulation and evaluation support their development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building distributed systems under demanding throughput, latency, reliability and scale requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing GPU-based training or simulation platforms, with a strong understanding of compute, networking, storage and workload orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with fleet data pipelines, sensor simulation, scenario generation and closed-loop testing, including reproducibility and coverage of rare or difficult driving conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify where existing architectures limit customer outcomes, define practical alternatives and build alignment across engineering, research and product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to connect system architecture with product strategy and business development, working directly with technical leaders and enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wondering if you&#39;re a good fit?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in investing in our people, and value candidates who can bring their own diversified experiences to our teams even if you aren&#39;t a 100% skill or experience match. Here are a few qualities we&#39;ve found compatible with our team. If some of this describes you, we&#39;d love to talk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love taking complex autonomy and AI infrastructure challenges from initial architectural design through to commercially successful deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re curious about how advances in simulation, synthetic data and AI models can accelerate the development and validation of autonomous vehicles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy working directly with customers and bringing engineering, research and commercial teams together around a clear technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CoreWeave?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CoreWeave, we work hard, have fun, and move fast! We&#39;re in an exciting stage of hyper-growth that you will not want to miss out on. We&#39;re not afraid of a little chaos, and we&#39;re constantly learning. Our team cares deeply about how we build our product and how we work together, which is represented through our core values:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be Curious at Your Core&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act Like an Owner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empower Employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Best-in-Class Client Experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve More Together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We support and encourage an entrepreneurial outlook and independent thinking. We foster an environment that encourages collaboration and enables the development of innovative solutions to complex problems. As we get set for takeoff, the organisation&#39;s growth opportunities are constantly expanding. You will be surrounded by some of the best talent in the industry, who will want to learn from you, too. Come join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role is £146,000 to £195,000. The starting salary will be determined by job-related knowledge, skills, experience, and the market location. We strive for both market alignment and internal equity when determining compensation. In addition to base salary, our total rewards package includes a discretionary bonus, equity awards, and a comprehensive benefits program (all based on eligibility).&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To fulfill our obligation to protect client data, successful applicants offered employment with CoreWeave will be required to complete a basic criminal record check, conducted in compliance with GDPR. Employment offers are conditional upon receiving satisfactory check results.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to a competitive salary, we offer a variety of benefits to support your needs, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-level Dental Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Pension Contribution&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance at 4x Salary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical Illness Cover&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Programme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tuition Reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work culture focused on innovative disruption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits may vary by location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;CoreWeave is an equal opportunity employer, committed to fostering an inclusive and supportive workplace. All qualified applicants and candidates will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, disability, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, veteran status, or genetic information.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Agencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;CoreWeave does not accept speculative CVs. Any unsolicited CVs received will be treated as the property of CoreWeave and your Terms &amp;amp; Conditions associated with the use of CVs will be considered null and void.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited CVs sent by your company to us – that is to say, in any situation where we have not directly engaged your company in writing to supply candidates for a specific vacancy – will be considered by us to be a “free gift”, leaving us liable for no fees whatsoever should we choose to contact the candidate directly and engage the candidate’s services, and will in no way establish any prior claim by your company to representation of that candidate should the candidate’s details also be submitted by any other party.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Export Control Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position requires access to export controlled information. &amp;nbsp;To conform to U.S. Government export regulations applicable to that information, applicant must either be (A) a U.S. person, defined as a (i) U.S. citizen or national, (ii) U.S. lawful permanent resident (green card holder), (iii) refugee under 8 U.S.C. § 1157, or (iv) asylee under 8 U.S.C. § 1158, (B) eligible to access the export controlled information without a required export authorization, or (C) eligible and reasonably likely to obtain the required export authorization from the applicable U.S. government agency. &amp;nbsp;CoreWeave may, for legitimate business reasons, decline to pursue any export licensing process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Updated privacy notice - UK and EU Job Applications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting Relationships&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Primary Manager: &lt;/strong&gt;COO and Co-MD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Dotted Line: &lt;/strong&gt;CMO and Co-MD&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Direct Reports: &lt;/strong&gt;~10 people spanning Culinary, Product Innovation, Product Strategy, Product Operations, and Product Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Factor is a healthy, ready-to-heat meal delivery service that has built a category-defining business in the US and Canada. Now we&#39;re building &lt;strong&gt;Factor in Europe&lt;/strong&gt; — and although we have strong blueprints from North America, we have the opportunity to leverage the very rich multi-cultural environment in Europe to tailor both our physical and digital products to five different markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Director, Product&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the full product vision and execution for Factor Europe. You will lead a multi-layered team of ~10 people, sit on the Factor Europe leadership team, and maintain a close dotted-line relationship with our CMO to ensure product and marketing move as one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare kind of role: senior strategic ownership and real infrastructure, with the pace and ambition of an early-stage scale up. If you are a visionary builder who leads with curiosity, earns conviction through data, and holds your team to the same high standard you hold yourself — we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Lead and Develop a High-Performance Product Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Build, inspire, and manage a multi-disciplinary team — setting a clear vision, establishing the operating rhythms that allow the team to move fast, and investing in the people who will drive Factor Europe&#39;s next chapter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Own and Challenge the Product Vision&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Define a clear and compelling vision for what Factor&#39;s physical product must become in Europe — grounded in customer insight, commercially rigorous, and differentiated enough to win. Develop a deep, independent point of view on where the North American model translates and where European markets demand something different.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Push the team and the business to think beyond the current roadmap — challenging assumptions, interrogating trade-offs, and ensuring we are always working on the highest-leverage version of the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as the liaison to our global Digital Product team — representing Factor Europe&#39;s priorities in the feature roadmap and collaborating on shared global initiatives that benefit the wider business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Drive Customer Retention and Commercial Performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Own customer retention levers as your north star. Build a rigorous, evidence-based view of what drives it and rally the team around interventions that move the needle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Make product decisions with full awareness of their P&amp;amp;L implications. Take calculated risks, track outcomes honestly, and move quickly to learn and adjust when bets don&#39;t pay off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Build for Multiple European Markets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Lead our effort to find product-market fit across five distinct markets — understanding how consumer preferences vary by culture, and building a proposition that resonates locally while scaling efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Share learnings across geographies and partner with peers across the HelloFresh Group to continuously raise the bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Support new channel strategies, understanding and adapting products for different customer bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Align Product and Marketing Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Work closely with the brand &amp;amp; marketing team to ensure product roadmap and marketing strategies are fully synchronised — so what we build, how we talk about it, and how we sell it form one coherent proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Act as the product voice on the leadership team, articulating a compelling vision for where the product needs to go and why.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;A visionary leader who executes. &lt;/strong&gt;You set a compelling direction, bring your team with you, and roll up your sleeves to make it happen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Customer-obsessed and analytically rigorous. &lt;/strong&gt;Sharp instincts backed by disciplined discovery. Comfortable querying your own data and stress-testing assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded. &lt;/strong&gt;You understand how product decisions flow through to the P&amp;amp;L — and hold yourself accountable to outcomes, not just outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;A cross-functional influencer. &lt;/strong&gt;You build trust quickly, drive execution through others, and get the right priorities onto other teams&#39; roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Internationally curious. &lt;/strong&gt;You find the complexity of building for multiple European cultures energising, and you seek out the nuances that matter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;An exceptional communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You write and present with clarity and conviction — from strategy narratives to leadership updates to product briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Food and/or nutrition obsessed!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8–10+ years in Product, Strategy, or a closely related commercial leadership role; 3+ years managing multi-disciplinary teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Technical toolkit: &lt;/strong&gt;Advanced Excel/Google Sheets; AI proficiency and curiosity required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Strong preference for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in D2C subscription businesses — retention, lifecycle, and recurring revenue models.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Multi-market European experience and an understanding of how consumer preferences vary across the continent.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience in physical products or FMCG, especially food &amp;amp; beverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;○&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A track record of scaling a product in a new market and finding product-market fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy 20% off HelloFresh and 40% off Factor_ subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access the &quot;Benefits at Work&quot; platform for discounts on brands like Nike, Bol.com, and IKEA.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll receive a HelloFresh laptop, a €250 home office setup budget, and contribute to the Bedrijfspensioenfonds Levensmiddelen pension scheme (2025 rate 27.6%; employer pays 19.64%, employee pays 7.96%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Benefit from discounts on ClassPass and gym memberships via Bedrijfsfitness Nederland, free bootcamp classes (Amsterdam), and free subscriptions to Headspace and OpenUp.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get a 10% discount on additional health insurance at Zilveren Kruis in 2025.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work flexibly with our hybrid setup (50% office, 50% remote), plus a €2.40 daily remote work allowance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Receive 24 days of annual leave (pro-rated), plus one additional day per year of service (up to 30 days total).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full reimbursement for 2nd-class public transport to the office, plus €0.23 per km for car and bicycle travel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible employees can work from another country for up to 8 weeks per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow with our &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; mindset: participate in Pantry Staple trainings, access internal/external opportunities, and join our cross-market mentoring program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy fresh homemade lunches in the office (€3.00/day), weekly &lt;em&gt;vrij-mi-bo&lt;/em&gt; (Friday drinks), quarterly strategy sessions, and team events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ427R946&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the Data and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first-mover advantage in today&#39;s ultra-competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a creative, delivery-oriented Named Account Executive to join the Healthcare and Life Science to maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks in the Benelux Region. As an Account Executive, you know how to sell innovation and value to existing customers, identify new use cases and grow consumption and can guide deals forward to compress decision cycles. You love understanding a product in depth and are passionate about communicating its value to customers and partners. You will be offered huge potential for career progression with the pace of the team&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report to the Sales Director for Healthcare and Life Science, Benelux.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will co-develop a business plan, with your team and ecosystem partners, that accelerates customer success to exceed quarterly/annual consumption and booking goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead your team, customers and partners to identify impactful data and AI use cases whilst proving out their value on the Databricks Data Intelligence platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will implement the data and AI transformation goals of your customer through a combination of strategic partnerships, well scoped professional services, training and targeted Executive engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop an understanding of technical product details and roadmap to build trust with executives and technical champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exstensive experience selling complex solutions to Enterprise Customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience managing and leading complex, federated sales campaigns in major accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience working in Data, Cloud industries with some technical sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proof of exceeding sales quotas in high-growth Enterprise software companies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience driving consumption and commit-based engagement models and strategies working with professional services and training teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience co-selling and scaling your business with Cloud Vendors (AWS, Azure and Google Cloud teams) and Global Solution Integrators (GSI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of building effective champions, collaborative teams and partnerships to support execution of your account / territory plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of how to identify all key uses cases and buying centres in an opportunity to increase the impact of Databricks in an organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of following robust sales methodologies and process, e.g. account planning, MEDDPICC, Value Selling and accurate forecasting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or relevant work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and in Dutch are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REQ ID: FEQ227R147&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: Netherlands (Remote/Hybrid) - will require travel across Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruiter: Dina Hussain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Lead Solution Architect focused on Generative AI to support our &lt;strong&gt;EMEA Emerging Digital Natives and Startups &lt;/strong&gt;business unit — one of the fastest-moving, most technically ambitious patches in EMEA. Our customers are digital-native and cloud-native companies who build on the frontier: they adopt GenAI early, scale fast, and expect their technical partners to be as sharp as their own engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be the go-to expert our Account Teams and customers turn to when a GenAI or LLM use case needs to move from an ambitious idea to a production-grade reality across our high-growth accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly technical, customer-facing individual contributor role for someone who lives at the frontier of applied GenAI. You will shape architectures, prove out the hard problems, challenge and influence customer roadmaps, and raise the GenAI capability of the entire EMEA Emerging DNB field organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the deep technical authority on Generative AI, LLMs, and applied machine learning for the EMEA Emerging DNB business unit, supporting the most strategic and complex customer engagements across our digital-native and born-in-the-cloud accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our EMEA Emerging DNB Solutions Architects, Solutions Engineers, and Account teams to scope, design, and de-risk GenAI use cases — from retrieval-augmented generation and agentic systems to fine-tuning and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build hands-on proofs of concept and reference implementations that operationalise large-scale LLM and deep learning workloads on Databricks (Mosaic AI, MLflow, Model Serving, Vector Search, Unity Catalog governance), tuned to the fast iteration cycles Emerging DNB customers expect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead fine-tuning and model-customisation engagements on open LLMs (e.g., Llama-family models), including judge-based and label-efficient evaluation approaches for domains where quality and safety are paramount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a bridge to Product and Engineering — channel field and customer feedback into the roadmap and represent the roadmap back to the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and mentor the broader EMEA Emerging DNB Field Engineering team through workshops, reference architectures, and internal enablement, multiplying GenAI expertise across our ~70-person SA/SE organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Databricks externally as a technical thought leader — conference talks (e.g., Data + AI Summit), blogs, and customer executive briefings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the LLM landscape, including leading proprietary and open-source models and providers, with the ability to differentiate their capabilities, trade-offs, and suitability for different use cases, and to articulate a clear, informed point of view (POV) to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in the modern GenAI stack: LLM application patterns (RAG, agents, tool use), fine-tuning and model customization, prompt and evaluation engineering, and LLM guardrails/safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundations in machine learning and deep learning, including distributed training, GPU workloads, and the full MLOps lifecycle (tracking, registry, serving, monitoring).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Python and the ML ecosystem (PyTorch/Transformers, MLflow, Spark), and comfort building production-quality reference implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the Databricks platform — or the ability to ramp on it quickly — including Mosaic AI, Model Serving, Vector Search, and Unity Catalog. Cloud experience across AWS, Azure, or GCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and consultative skills: able to earn the trust of both hands-on engineers and senior technical executives, and to explain complex GenAI trade-offs clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of technical leadership and mentorship — someone who elevates the people around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort operating at the pace of digital-native and high-growth customers, where speed, iteration, and technical credibility win the deal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the United Kingdom and able to work across EMEA time zones, with willingness to travel to customer sites within the region as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background helping digital-native customers build data and ML solutions (e.g., prior experience at a data/ML platform or consulting vendor) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public technical presence: conference speaking, published talks, blogs, or open-source contributions in the ML/GenAI space.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain depth in a regulated or high-stakes industry (healthcare/life sciences, financial services) where model quality, evaluation, and safety are critical.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with Product and Engineering teams to influence roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work on the hardest and most exciting GenAI problems our EMEA Emerging DNB customers have — companies building the future in real time — with the platform and the people to actually solve them, not just advise. You&#39;ll shape how one of EMEA&#39;s highest-growth business units adopts Generative AI, influence the direction of the product, and build a public profile as a recognised expert in the field. This is the role for a builder and a teacher, who wants their expertise to have outsized impact.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;gmail_default&quot; style=&quot;font-size: small;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Mozilla?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla Corporation is the non-profit-backed technology company that has shaped the internet for the better over the last 25 years. We make pioneering brands like Firefox, the privacy-minded web browser. Now, with more than 225 million people around the world using our products each month, we’re shaping the next 25 years of technology and helping to reclaim an internet built for people, not companies. Our work focuses on diverse areas including AI, social media, security and more. And we’re doing this while never losing our focus on our core mission – to make the internet better for people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Mozilla Corporation is wholly owned by the non-profit 501(c) Mozilla Foundation. This means we aren’t beholden to any shareholders — only to our mission. Along with thousands of volunteer contributors and collaborators all over the world, Mozillians design, build and distribute &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;open-source&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; software that enables people to enjoy the internet on their terms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design, build and implement security and hardening features for enterprise users:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Design, implement, test, and ship cutting-edge security features that strengthen Firefox’s security posture.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advance Firefox’s security architecture across multiple operating systems: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contribute to and drive cutting-edge improvements to Firefox’s core security posture, by building privilege isolation and moving trust boundaries &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;or Strengthen Firefox’s security architecture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Improve Firefox’s core security mechanisms including cryptographic protocols, WebPKI, and security-sensitive web APIs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to our security initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Work across teams to investigate security issues, identify root causes, and deliver robust, maintainable fixes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve browser reliability and performance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Diagnose and resolve issues affecting stability, correctness, performance, and memory usage in a complex, multithreaded environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems programming experience and security knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; 3+ years of experience in low-level software engineering, strong proficiency in C and/or C++, and a solid understanding of security fundamentals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging and problem-solving skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Experience diagnosing and resolving issues in multithreaded, cross-platform native applications, including memory and performance challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Web platform and modern systems experience: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript) and interest or experience in Rust; ability to work effectively within large, complex, multi-language codebases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Effective collaboration and communication:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; Experience working with distributed teams and communicating technical ideas clearly in writing and conversation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous performance-based bonus plans to all eligible employees - we share in our success as one team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generous retirement contributions with 100% immediate vesting (regardless of whether you contribute)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly all-company wellness days where everyone takes a pause together&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Country specific holidays plus a day off for your birthday&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;One-time home office stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Annual professional development budget&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Quarterly well-being stipend&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Considerable paid parental leave&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Employee referral bonus program&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Other benefits (life/AD&amp;amp;D, disability, EAP, etc. - varies by country)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mozilla&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla exists to build the Internet as a public resource accessible to all because we believe that open and free is better than closed and controlled. When you work at Mozilla, you give yourself a chance to make a difference in the lives of Web users everywhere. And you give us a chance to make a difference in your life every single day. Join us to work on the Web as the platform and help create more opportunity and innovation for everyone online.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commitment to diversity, equity, inclusion, and belonging&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mozilla understands that valuing diverse creative practices and forms of knowledge are crucial to and enrich the company’s core mission.&amp;nbsp; We encourage applications from everyone, including members of all equity-seeking communities, such as (but certainly not limited to) women, racialized and Indigenous persons, persons with disabilities, persons of all sexual orientation&lt;span style=&quot;color: #003366;&quot;&gt;s, &lt;/span&gt;gender identities, and expressions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that qualified individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodations to participate in the job application or interview process, to perform essential job functions, and to receive other benefits and privileges of employment, as appropriate. Please contact us at &lt;a class=&quot;external-link&quot; ---------- to request accommodation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate on the basis of race (including hairstyle and texture), religion (including religious grooming and dress practices), gender, gender identity, gender expression, color, national origin, pregnancy, ancestry, domestic partner status, disability, sexual orientation, age, genetic predisposition, medical condition, marital status, citizenship status, military or veteran status, or any other basis covered by applicable laws.&amp;nbsp; Mozilla will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics or any other unlawful behavior, conduct, or purpose.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Group: D&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Req ID: R3247&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Ranges:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Remote Netherlands&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€66.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€88.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You will help the Firefox DOM Core team improve the health of the Session History area. You will write tests to improve the coverage; you will fix tests and/or problems to improve the Gecko correctness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write Web-Platform tests to improve the coverage, and Gecko mochitests as needed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Fix the problems and pass the tests to improve the Gecko correctness&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Work through code review with the relevant Gecko module owners and iterate to landing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Definition of done&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Improved Session History test coverage and code correctness in Gecko, measured by passed test cases, allowing the team’s senior engineers to focus on security, performance and strategic projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Substantial experience in a browser-engine codebase or in automating for a browser-engine, ideally Firefox/Gecko.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Solid Javascript and applying that language skill to write automated tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in and experience developing software in C++.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Strong debugging skills in a mature larget codebase.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Comfort working in the open: public bugs, code review, and upstream landing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Prior contributions to Gecko or another major browser engine.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with web standards and Web Platform Tests.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mavericks Wanted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;When was the last time you achieved the impossible? If that thought feels overwhelming, you might want to pause here, but if it sparks excitement...read on&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In 2015, we pioneered a “moneyball for biotech” approach, pooling projects and promising early-stage research from academia together under one financial umbrella to reduce risk and unleash innovation. This model allows science and small teams of experts to lead the way. We build bridges to groundbreaking advancements in rare&amp;nbsp;disease, and&amp;nbsp;develop life-changing medicines for patients with unmet needs as fast as humanly possible. &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Together we define white space, push boundaries, and empower people to solve problems. If you&#39;re someone who defies convention, join us and work alongside some of the most respected minds in the industry. Together, we&#39;ll&amp;nbsp;ask&amp;nbsp;&quot;why not?&quot; and help reengineer the future of biopharma. At BridgeBio, we value curiosity and experimentation—including the ethical &amp;amp; thoughtful use of AI to improve clarity, speed, and quality of work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Manager, Commercial Sourcing and Contracts will report directly to the Head of International Supply Chain. This role will be responsible for supporting the development and execution of sourcing strategies, managing the end-to-end contracting lifecycle for commercial goods and services. You will partner closely with cross-functional stakeholders (Supply Chain, Legal, Finance, CMC and Quality) to manage supplier relationships and ensure contractual compliance across Contract Manufacturing Organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing Strategy &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and implementation of sourcing strategies for Contract Manufacturing Organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFP processes, supplier evaluations, and negotiations to secure optimal cost, quality, and service outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct market analysis and benchmarking to support the identification of sourcing opportunities and mitigate supply risk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive supplier consolidation, dual-sourcing, or diversification strategies where appropriate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft, negotiate, and finalize commercial contracts, master service agreements (MSAs), and supply agreements in collaboration with the relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a contract repository/tracker ensuring visibility of key terms, renewal dates, and obligations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage contract amendments, renewals, and terminations in line with business needs and risk exposure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supplier Relationship Management&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as primary Commercial Supply Chain point of contact for Contract Manufacturing Organizations, managing performance reviews and escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor supplier performance against SLAs/KPIs and drive corrective action plans where needed with relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support supplier risk assessments (financial, operational, compliance) in coordination with Quality and Supply Chain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp; &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hybrid role based in the Netherlands, with approximately 10–15% travel anticipated to visit Contract Manufacturing Organizations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Who You Are&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in a related field, such as Supply Chain, Logistics, or Business Administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of supply chain experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life sciences industry experience; experience with commercial products is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience negotiating and managing commercial contracts with Contract Manufacturing Organizations in a regulated environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build and sustain trusted relationships, both internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and cross-functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical mindset with the ability to translate contract terms into sourcing decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented, organized, and comfortable managing multiple contracts/projects simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English, both written and spoken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Rewarding Those Who Make the Mission Possible&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Market-leading compensation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work model – we value your flexibility in how you work, but encourage time in the office to strengthen our culture, collaboration, and sense of community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career development through regular feedback, continuous education, and professional development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognition for strong performance through financial rewards, peer-to-peer feedback, and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a global company, our comprehensive benefits may vary based on location.&amp;nbsp; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We have high expectations for our team members. We make sure those working hard for patients are rewarded and cared for in return.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
