&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Commvault&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault (NASDAQ: CVLT) is the gold standard in cyber resilience. The company empowers customers to uncover, take action, and rapidly recover from cyberattacks – keeping data safe and businesses resilient. The company’s unique AI-powered platform combines best-in-class data protection, exceptional data security, advanced data intelligence, and lightning-fast recovery across any workload or cloud at the lowest TCO. For over 25 years, more than 100,000 organizations and a vast partner ecosystem have relied on Commvault to reduce risks, improve governance, and do more with data.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Commvault, we help some of the world’s most complex organisations strengthen their cyber resilience and protect what matters most: their data, operations and ability to recover.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are expanding our Enterprise Sales team in Germany and are looking an Enterprise Account Executive to cover &lt;strong&gt;Germany Central&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not an account-maintenance role. We are looking for proven enterprise sellers who know their market, have built trusted relationships with senior customers and partners, and consistently turn market access into qualified pipeline, strategic opportunities and profitable growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver quarterly and annual revenue targets across a defined portfolio of large enterprise customers and high-value prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic territory and account plans focused on net-new logo acquisition, competitive displacement and sustainable account expansion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally create and progress qualified pipeline through executive engagement, targeted prospecting, customer referrals, partners and technology alliances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles involving CIOs, CISOs, infrastructure leaders, procurement, partners and executive sponsors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business cases that connect cyber resilience and data protection outcomes with financial value, risk reduction and operational priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate an integrated account team across Sales Engineering, Channel, Marketing, Customer Success, Professional Services and executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate opportunity management, qualification and forecasting throughout the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build long-term customer relationships based on credibility, business value and consistent delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Successful Candidates Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;demonstrable track record of achieving or exceeding quota&lt;/strong&gt; in enterprise software, SaaS, cybersecurity, data management, cloud infrastructure or a closely related market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience closing &lt;strong&gt;complex six- and seven-figure enterprise transactions&lt;/strong&gt; with long sales cycles and multiple decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evidence of winning &lt;strong&gt;net-new enterprise customers&lt;/strong&gt;, not only expanding inherited accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An &lt;strong&gt;established and active network&lt;/strong&gt; across enterprise customers, C-level decision-makers, channel partners and technology alliances within the relevant German territory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of the German enterprise technology market, including customer priorities, competitive dynamics, procurement structures and partner ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to independently create access, shape opportunities and maintain momentum without relying on continuous management intervention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business-value selling, negotiation and executive communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disciplined use of CRM, qualification methodology, account planning and forecasting processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative leadership style combined with personal accountability, resilience and a strong desire to win.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Territory and Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The role is field-based and should ideally be located within &lt;strong&gt;Germany Central&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with convenient access to major rail, road and air connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular customer and partner engagement across the assigned territory is an essential part of the role. Candidates should therefore be comfortable travelling based on customer and business requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Define a Winning Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For us, a winning mindset is about:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating opportunities rather than waiting for them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership from initial access through successful close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combining ambition with disciplined execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being transparent about risks, pipeline quality and forecast confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobilising the wider team while remaining personally accountable for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning quickly, responding constructively to setbacks and maintaining momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Winning in a way that strengthens customer trust, partner relationships and the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you have consistently built enterprise pipeline, developed trusted executive relationships and converted complex customer challenges into significant business outcomes, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-SK1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-REMOTE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;jd-info au-target&quot; data-ph-at-id=&quot;jobdescription-text&quot; data-ph-id=&quot;ph-page-element-page5-4e8TMw&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault is an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. We are always committed to equal employment opportunity regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or Veteran status and we will not discriminate against on the basis of such characteristics or any other status protected by the laws or regulations in the locations where we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commvault’s goal is to make interviewing inclusive and accessible to all candidates and employees. If you have a disability or special need that requires accommodation to participate in the interview process or apply for a position at Commvault, please email &lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span ----- any inquiries not related to an accommodation please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.commvault.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Commvault&#39;s Privacy Policy &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Join us as a working student and help build an internal data platform for analyzing scientific publications in robotics and AI research. The platform brings together openly available information about publications and turns it into a clear, reliable picture of how the research field is developing.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Your work will give our team a solid data foundation for understanding research trends, emerging topics, and where new momentum is building. You will design and develop software tools that collect, validate, store and visualize this information, and you will see your work used by colleagues in their daily work.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build and maintain an internal research data platform&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement and maintain an internal application for collecting, processing, validating, storing and visualizing publication data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop components for automated data acquisition from open sources such as scholarly APIs, repositories and websites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement backend services and data pipelines for reliable processing and integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to frontend components for accessing, managing and exploring the data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development practices to build and extend the platform efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure data quality and automation&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement automated and AI-supported validation, cleaning and quality assurance for the collected data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the analysis of publication content, for example through text extraction or classification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep the data consistent, traceable and usable across the whole system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Visualize and report&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop dashboards and visualizations that make research trends and KPIs easy to explore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve usability and functionality of the application together with its users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to continuously enhance the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in Computer Science, Data Science, Software Engineering, Statistics, Robotics or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good knowledge of Python and web technologies (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of SQL and databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with APIs, web scraping and workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI-based software development, such as working with AI coding assistants and integrating AI models into applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git and Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with high attention to detail and data quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structured, independent working style and good communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in robotics and AI as a research field, and the ability to read and understand scientific publications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the robotics and AI research ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with scholarly data sources or publication management tools such as JabRef&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Experience with text processing or LLM-based data extraction&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building dashboards or data visualizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemValue___c0djd&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots SE&lt;/strong&gt; is an international high-tech company based in Munich, Germany with a production site in Kaufbeuren and more than &lt;strong&gt;3500&lt;/strong&gt; employees worldwide. Our mission is to bridge the gap between artificial intelligence and robotics by developing systems that combine state-of-the-art force-moment-sensing and world-leading image-processing technology. This unique combination of technologies allows us to provide user-friendly and affordable robotic solutions that enable intelligent precision assembly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is made possible by our employees, who bring out the best in each and every day with creativity and enthusiasm. Become part of this team and shape the future of robotics with us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud of our diversity and welcome your application regardless of gender and sexual identity, nationality, ethnicity, religion, age, or disability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Anthropic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic’s mission is to create reliable, interpretable, and steerable AI systems. We want AI to be safe and beneficial for our users and for society as a whole. Our team is a quickly growing group of committed researchers, engineers, policy experts, and business leaders working together to build beneficial AI systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Enterprise Account Executive at Anthropic, you’ll drive adoption of safe, frontier AI by securing strategic deals with top enterprises, unlocking new value streams throughout their business. You’ll leverage your consultative sales expertise to propel revenue growth while becoming a trusted partner to customers, helping them embed and deploy AI while uncovering its full range of capabilities. In collaboration with GTM, product, and marketing teams, you’ll continuously refine our value proposition, sales methodology, and market positioning to ensure differentiated value across the landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have a passion for developing new market segments, pinpointing high-potential opportunities, and executing strategies to capture them. By driving deployment of Anthropic&#39;s emerging products, you will help enterprises obtain new capabilities while also advancing the ethical development of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Win new business and drive revenue for Anthropic. Find your way to the right people at prospective customers, educate them about LLMs, and help them succeed with Anthropic. You’ll own the full sales cycle, from first outbound to launch&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design and execute innovative sales strategies to meet and exceed revenue quotas. Analyze market landscapes, trends, and dynamics to translate high-level plans into targeted sales activities, partnerships, and campaigns&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Spearhead market expansion by pinpointing new customer segments and use cases. Collaborate cross-functionally to differentiate our offerings and sustain a competitive edge&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Inform product roadmaps and features by gathering customer feedback and conveying market needs. Provide insights that strengthen our value proposition and enhance the customer experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Continuously refine the sales methodology by incorporating learnings into playbooks, templates, and best practices. Identify process improvements that optimize sales productivity and consistency&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You may be a good fit if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5+ years of enterprise sales experience driving adoption of emerging technologies with a consultative, solutions-oriented sales approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of managing complex sales cycles and securing strategic deals by understanding multifaceted technical requirements and crafting tailored solutions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate dynamic stakeholder ecosystems, building consensus and providing innovative solutions to disparate groups&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Extensive experience negotiating highly complex, customized commercial agreements with multiple stakeholders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven experience exceeding revenue targets in fast-paced organizations by effectively managing an evolving pipeline and sales process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to present confidently and build connections across all customer levels, from ICs to C-level executives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A knack for bringing order to chaos and an enthusiastic “roll up your sleeves&#39;&#39; mentality. You are a true team player&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strategic, analytical approach to assessing markets combined with creative, tactical execution to capture opportunities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A passion for and/or experience with advanced AI systems. You feel strongly about ensuring frontier AI systems are developed safely&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The annual compensation range for this role is listed below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For sales roles, the range provided is the role’s On Target Earnings (&quot;OTE&quot;) range, meaning that the range includes both the sales commissions/sales bonuses target and annual base salary for the role.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual Salary:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€205.000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€255.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s degree or an equivalent combination of education, training, and/or experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required field of study:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;A field relevant to the role as demonstrated through coursework, training, or professional experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum years of experience: &lt;/strong&gt;Years of experience required will correlate with the internal job level requirements for the position&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location-based hybrid policy:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently, we expect all staff to be in one of our offices at least 25% of the time. However, some roles may require more time in our offices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Visa sponsorship:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We do sponsor visas! However, we aren&#39;t able to successfully sponsor visas for every role and every candidate. But if we make you an offer, we will make every reasonable effort to get you a visa, and we retain an immigration lawyer to help with this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We encourage you to apply even if you do not believe you meet every single qualification.&lt;/strong&gt; Not all strong candidates will meet every single qualification as listed.&amp;nbsp; Research shows that people who identify as being from underrepresented groups are more prone to experiencing imposter syndrome and doubting the strength of their candidacy, so we urge you not to exclude yourself prematurely and to submit an application if you&#39;re interested in this work. We think AI systems like the ones we&#39;re building have enormous social and ethical implications. We think this makes representation even more important, and we strive to include a range of diverse perspectives on our team.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Your safety matters to us.&lt;/strong&gt; To protect yourself from potential scams, remember that Anthropic recruiters only contact you ----- addresses. In some cases, we may partner with vetted recruiting agencies who will identify themselves as working on behalf of Anthropic. Be cautious of emails from other domains. Legitimate Anthropic recruiters will never ask for money, fees, or banking information before your first day. If you&#39;re ever unsure about a communication, don&#39;t click any links—visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u data-stringify-type=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://anthropic.com/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;anthropic.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;directly for confirmed position openings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we&#39;re different&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe that the highest-impact AI research will be big science. At Anthropic we work as a single cohesive team on just a few large-scale research efforts. And we value impact — advancing our long-term goals of steerable, trustworthy AI — rather than work on smaller and more specific puzzles. We view AI research as an empirical science, which has as much in common with physics and biology as with traditional efforts in computer science. We&#39;re an extremely collaborative group, and we host frequent research discussions to ensure that we are pursuing the highest-impact work at any given time. As such, we greatly value communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The easiest way to understand our research directions is to read our recent research. This research continues many of the directions our team worked on prior to Anthropic, including: GPT-3, Circuit-Based Interpretability, Multimodal Neurons, Scaling Laws, AI &amp;amp; Compute, Concrete Problems in AI Safety, and Learning from Human Preferences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come work with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anthropic is a public benefit corporation headquartered in San Francisco. We offer competitive compensation and benefits, optional equity donation matching, generous vacation and parental leave, flexible working hours, and a lovely office space in which to collaborate with colleagues. &lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Guidance on Candidates&#39; AI Usage:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Learn about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.anthropic.com/candidate-ai-guidance&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;our policy&lt;/a&gt; for using AI in our application process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Orcrist is building a next generation data intelligence platform using cutting-edge technologies. We&#39;re handling petabyte-scale data with sub-second queries. Our product is a Kubernetes‑based platform delivered as B2B SaaS or as a self‑hosted on‑prem solution, including air‑gapped deployments. We enable customers across defense, law enforcement, and enterprise to turn mission-critical data into actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director of Product you own Orcrist’s entire product portfolio - Orcrist’s OIP and Civitas’ Sentinel, and lead the product organisation. You decide what Orcrist builds and in which order: what becomes platform and what stays customer-specific, which customer problem is solved next, and how we measure that it has been solved. Our promise is demonstrable the effectiveness of our software, and making that promise deliverable is the core of this role. You work directly with Engineers, our Government Development-Team and our customers and report to the COO of Orcrist.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own product strategy&lt;/strong&gt; and the portfolio roadmap across all product lines – including the decision about what becomes shared platform and what remains customer-specific engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and lead the product organisation&lt;/strong&gt;: hire and develop Product Managers for the product lines and align them on common standards for discovery, prioritisation and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make &lt;strong&gt;product effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;customer activity &amp;amp; usage&lt;/strong&gt; a measurable product goal: define metrics, measurement logic and the subsequent tasks that are triggered by that.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own discovery&lt;/strong&gt; with our Government Development team and our customers, and &lt;strong&gt;translate their requirements into product decisions&lt;/strong&gt; rather than collecting feature requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Decide prioritisation&lt;/strong&gt; across competing customer, tender and platform demands, and defend those decisions to customers, the team and the management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plan deliverable releases&lt;/strong&gt; together with Engineering and QA, holding the balance between speed, quality and platform capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess market&lt;/strong&gt;, competitive and technology developments in the defence and simulation space and feed them into product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of product management experience with complex technical products, preferably in the Analytics or SAAS-space, including several years leading Product Managers or a product organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering products from discovery through to customer rollout – with nameable outcomes, not just roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with B2B or B2G products in long, formal procurement cycles and with demanding enterprise or public sector customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience holding platform decisions against customer-specific exceptions – and explaining the commercial consequence of both paths.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to decide with incomplete information, take ownership, and work in an environment without mature processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in German and English across various hierarchy levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to customers (approx. 10-20%).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Authorization to work in Germany&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in defence, GovTech, data fusion; own military or law enforcement background an advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data analytics platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with on-premise, offline or air-gapped products and their consequences for product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building a product organisation in a startup or scale-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote-first, Germany-wide: &lt;/strong&gt;Work from wherever you do your best work, with regular team gatherings in Berlin and other off-site locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility by default: &lt;/strong&gt;Flexible working hours help you make work fit your life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your setup, your way: &lt;/strong&gt;Get a personal home-office equipment budget to create a workspace that works for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 days of vacation: &lt;/strong&gt;Take the time you need to recharge and come back with fresh energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep growing: &lt;/strong&gt;We invest in your personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get rewarded for impact: &lt;/strong&gt;Performance bonuses are tied to agreed objectives and key results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A warm welcome: &lt;/strong&gt;Every new team member gets a welcome goodie bag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good people, good times: &lt;/strong&gt;From summer and Christmas parties to regular team gatherings, we make time to celebrate together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A mission that matters: &lt;/strong&gt;Work on challenges with tangible impact on public safety and national security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Parloa&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa’s mission is to make every customer conversation feel effortless for both customers and the companies serving them. As agentic AI accelerates, Parloans are shaping the foundation of a new era in customer experience, one where customer support is no longer transactions, but meaningful exchanges. It is not just a vision; Parloa has powered over ONE BILLION interactions between global enterprise brands and their customers, with companies like Booking.com, HealthEquity, Allianz, SAP, BarmeniaGothaer, and TUI already deploying Parloa at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Manager, Forward Deployed Engineering &lt;/strong&gt;at Parloa, you’ll be on the front lines of enterprise AI adoption — leading a high-impact team of FDEs that delivers our most strategic enterprise deployments. Your mission is to ensure our consistent deployment excellence: predictable delivery, strong engineering quality, and fast unblocking in complex enterprise environments — while staying technically credible yourself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;FDEs are our in-field engineers. They build what doesn’t exist yet, adapt architecture to enterprise realities, and engineer integrations across systems and APIs to make deployments successful. As a Manager, you make that work repeatable and reliable across multiple customer projects — through strong delivery leadership, clear priorities, and hands-on technical guidance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Areas of ownership:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and develop the team:&lt;/strong&gt; hire, coach, and grow a team of FDEs; set clear expectations; run 1:1s, feedback cycles, and performance development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own capacity planning and staffing:&lt;/strong&gt; allocate engineers across parallel strategic projects, manage load and utilization, and anticipate delivery bottlenecks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive project delivery management:&lt;/strong&gt; own engineering delivery across deployments — milestones, dependencies, risk management, escalation paths, and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish time tracking and delivery visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; implement lightweight tracking and reporting that creates trusted insight into effort, progress, and capacity (without bureaucracy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide technical leadership and escalation support:&lt;/strong&gt; guide architecture and implementation choices, review designs/code when needed, and unblock high-severity issues in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create scalable field engineering practices:&lt;/strong&gt; build reusable patterns, playbooks, and standards that improve reliability, maintainability, and speed across deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the product via field learnings: &lt;/strong&gt;translate recurring customer needs into clear productization proposals and partner with Product/Core Engineering to reduce one-offs over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with customer engineering and enterprise stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; collaborate directly with customer teams (architecture, security, platform) to deliver outcomes and build long-term technical trust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typescript, NodeJS, OpenAI, Microsoft Azure, Kubernetes, Docker, Terraform, MongoDB, MySQL, Redis, Kafka, MCP&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience level:&lt;/strong&gt; 8+ years in software engineering, systems integration, DevOps, or data engineering roles with meaningful production responsibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; proven ability to lead and develop engineers (e.g., formal management, team lead responsibility, coaching, hiring, performance growth).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise delivery track record:&lt;/strong&gt; demonstrated success delivering complex technical projects in large enterprise environments with multiple stakeholders and constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical breadth and depth:&lt;/strong&gt; strong capabilities across backend engineering, APIs, cloud platforms, Kubernetes, infrastructure-as-code, and databases — able to review designs and guide production decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on effectiveness:&lt;/strong&gt; able to personally own and drive smaller technical workstreams end-to-end and to jump into debugging/implementation when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; strong planning, prioritization, capacity thinking, and risk management; creates delivery clarity without unnecessary process overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-facing communication:&lt;/strong&gt; confident and credible with customer engineering teams and senior technical stakeholders; clear written and verbal communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong plus: experience building or integrating AI/LLM-powered systems (agent workflows, orchestration, evaluation, vector DBs, guardrails), ideally in forward-deployed or solutions engineering environments.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Recruiting Process:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent Acquisition → Hiring Manager → Technical Interview(s) → Bar Raiser&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Parloa?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re at the beginning of a new era in customer experience, one where AI doesn’t just respond, but understands, reasons, and takes action. We’re building agentic AI that enterprises trust with their most important customer moments: complex questions, high volumes, real stakes. When millions of people reach out to a brand, those interactions aren’t just support tickets; they’re defining experiences. We’re here to raise the standard: making every conversation seamless, intelligent, and genuinely helpful. If you care about shaping how businesses and customers connect at scale and want your work to matter in real, everyday moments, this is where you do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Parloa, ownership isn’t a buzzword; it means being accountable for outcomes, not just tasks. We operate in a category that’s evolving fast, where the bar is high, and the problems are complex. We hire people who think in solutions, communicate with clarity, and follow through. People who are comfortable making decisions, taking responsibility, and raising the standard for themselves and those around them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve grown beyond the earliest startup phase, but we’ve kept the intensity: fast execution, direct feedback, and a strong expectation to contribute meaningfully from day one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;display: table; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;&quot; src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/P4d-iyx7RQM&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is committed to upholding the highest data protection standards for our clients&#39; and employees&#39; data. All our employees are instrumental in ensuring the utmost care, GDPR, and ISO compliance, including ISO 27001, in handling sensitive information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Parloa is an e-verify employer in the USA. &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/about-e-verify/what-is-e-verify&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Please click here to learn more&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
