&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Engineered Arts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engineered Arts is the leading manufacturer of full-size humanoid robots used for entertainment, education and communication. With 20 years of hardware and software development, our robots have been sold in over 30 countries worldwide with customers such as NASA, PwC, Meta and many more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Ameca robot is well known as &#39;the face of AI&#39; and a social media viral success, taking advantage of the generative AI craze. Along with our ultra-realistic Mesmer range of animated figures, our robots continue to surprise and excite visitors at museums, theme parks, visitor attractions and trade shows, as well as aid leading universities with AI and robotics research. Our robots are poised to break into the future mega-expansion service robot segment, with applications such as front of house, receptions, check-in desks, information points and PoS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a team of dedicated engineers and creatives striving to develop the very best experiences for our customers. Our internal motto is &#39;Be Wow&#39; — everything we do is fun, entertaining or surprising to encounter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a seasoned sales professional ready to own and shape the revenue strategy for mid-market and enterprise customers across the UK and globally? As an Account Executive, you&#39;ll take full ownership of the sales process—from strategic prospecting through to close—while bringing the credibility and consultative depth to engage senior stakeholders at complex, high-value accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a quota-carrying role with real influence. You&#39;ll not only convert qualified opportunities into signed deals, but also help define how we go to market, mentor SDRs, and build the kind of long-term customer relationships that drive repeat business and global word-of-mouth. If you thrive on selling something genuinely unlike anything else on the market, this is your opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do and How You&#39;ll Have an Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and drive the full sales cycle from strategic discovery through negotiation and close on high-value, complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute account plans across a portfolio of mid-market and enterprise targets in the UK and internationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with SDRs to convert qualified leads into proposals, while independently generating pipeline from target verticals and robot applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive-level conversations and present tailored, consultative solutions to senior decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver compelling live and virtual product demonstrations that translate cutting-edge robotics into clear business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain rigorous pipeline management and forecasting accuracy in CRM with high data hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a trusted advisor to prospects and customers, navigating complex buying committees and addressing technical and commercial objections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with marketing, product, operations, and support teams to ensure seamless customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Engineered Arts at global trade shows, conferences, and customer site visits—becoming a credible voice in the humanoid robotics space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide market intelligence and feedback to inform product roadmap and go-to-market strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a full-cycle B2B sales role, with a strong track record of closing complex, high-value deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success selling physical technology products, hardware, or emerging technology solutions to mid-market and enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to navigate long-cycle, multi-stakeholder enterprise deals while managing shorter transactional opportunities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and the ability to build credibility quickly with C-suite and senior decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, consultative selling, negotiation, and relationship-building skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience managing and accurately forecasting a substantial pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with CRM tools (e.g. Salesforce, HubSpot) and a disciplined approach to data hygiene&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-moving, innovative environment where the product category is still being defined&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love This Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a company where creative ambition meets engineering excellence—and where no two deals are ever the same&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make a measurable, global impact—see your work installed and experienced in museums, theme parks, universities and boardrooms around the world&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy competitive compensation, uncapped earning potential, and flexible work arrangements that support work–life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a pioneering team at the forefront of one of the most exciting technology categories on the planet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect, we believe that innovation thrives in an environment that houses diversity of excellence, experience and thought. We respect each person as their own fingerprint; unique with no one alike. We foster an environment of inclusion without regard to race, religion, age, sexual orientation, or gender identity. As such, we strongly encourage applications from Indigenous peoples, racialized people, people with disabilities, people from gender and sexually diverse communities, and/or people with intersectional identities.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By applying to this role, you acknowledge that your application information — including your resume, contact details, and any materials you submit — may be shared with our client (the hiring organization) for the purpose of evaluating your candidacy. We act as a recruiting partner on behalf of this client. Your information will be used solely in connection with this opportunity and handled in accordance with applicable privacy laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect we take privacy very seriously. For more information about our use and handling of personal data from job applicants, please read our Candidate Privacy Policy. For more information of our general privacy practices, please see AppDirect Privacy Notice: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.appdirect.com/about/privacy-notice&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;https://www.appdirect.com/about/privacy-notice&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At AppDirect, AI tools may assist our recruitment team with administrative automations — always under human oversight. AI tools do not make hiring decisions or solely automated decisions about your candidacy — all decisions are made by our people. By submitting your application, you acknowledge that your information may be processed in this way. You may request access or deletion at any time by contacting -----<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Glean:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Glean is the Work AI platform that helps everyone work smarter with AI. What began as the industry’s most advanced enterprise search has evolved into a full-scale Work AI ecosystem, powering intelligent Search, an AI Assistant, and scalable AI agents on one secure, open platform. With over 100 enterprise SaaS connectors, flexible LLM choice, and robust APIs, Glean gives organizations the infrastructure to govern, scale, and customize AI across their entire business - without vendor lock-in or costly implementation cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At its core, Glean is redefining how enterprises find, use, and act on knowledge. Its Enterprise Graph and Personal Knowledge Graph map the relationships between people, content, and activity, delivering deeply personalized, context-aware responses for every employee. This foundation powers Glean’s agentic capabilities - AI agents that automate real work across teams by accessing the industry’s broadest range of data: enterprise and world, structured and unstructured, historical and real-time. The result: measurable business impact through faster onboarding, hours of productivity gained each week, and smarter, safer decisions at every level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Recognized by Fast Company as one of the World’s Most Innovative Companies (Top 10, 2025), by CNBC’s Disruptor 50, Bloomberg’s AI Startups to Watch (2026), Forbes AI 50, and Gartner’s Tech Innovators in Agentic AI, Glean continues to accelerate its global impact. With customers across 50+ industries and 1,000+ employees in more than 25 countries, we’re helping the world’s largest organizations make every employee AI-fluent, and turning the superintelligent enterprise from concept into reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you’re excited to shape how the world works, you’ll help build systems used daily across Microsoft Teams, Zoom, ServiceNow, Zendesk, GitHub, and many more. You&#39;ll be deeply embedded where people get things done. You&#39;ll ship agentic capabilities on an open, extensible stack, with the craft and care required for enterprise trust, as we bring Work AI to every employee, in every company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Glean is seeking a Strategic Account Executive to drive new business and growth within our largest enterprise prospects by developing tailored strategies to break into and expand major accounts. This role demands sophisticated account research, executive-level messaging, and champion-building to address customer pain points and priority business outcomes. You will have the opportunity to build a territory in the UKI market and play a key role in shaping Glean’s presence among industry-leading organizations and advancing our mission to transform work with AI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Source and close net-new logos within a given territory in your book of business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Have the ability to navigate complex organisational structures and identify executive sponsors and champions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Research and understand the business objectives of your customers and have the ability to run a value-driven sales cycle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with internal partners to move deals forward and ensure customer success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Consistently over-deliver ARR revenue targets and drive success through a metric-based approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and execute sales strategies and tactics to generate pipeline, drive sales opportunities and deliver repeatable and predictable bookings&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide timely and insightful input back to other corporate functions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create ROI and business justification reports based on a data-driven approach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Run tight POCs based on business success criteria&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;10+ years of closing experience in Sales, with a track record of being a top performer in SaaS sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to learn, pitch and demonstrate a highly technical product, and adapt in a fast-growing and changing environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Have clear examples of closing complex deals and selling into complex organisations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Effectively use a repeatable method for uncovering greenfield opportunities and building out a new territory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Previous experience building relationships and selling face-to-face to C-level executives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of best-in-class software and a technical understanding of integrations, APIs, infrastructure management, security and analytics&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience selling technical SaaS and cloud-based software solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Previous experience working with multiple teammates, including SEs, BDRs, PMs, Executives and Engineers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is hybrid (1 day a week in our London office)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, level, job-related knowledge, skills and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for variable compensation, equity and benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We are a diverse bunch of people and we want to continue to attract and retain a diverse range of people into our organization. We’re committed to building an inclusive and diverse company. We do not discriminate based on gender, ethnicity, sexual orientation, religion, civil or family status, age, disability or race.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First Mindset at Glean:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Glean, AI fluency is core to how we work and we&#39;re committed to ensuring every new hire feels confident integrating AI into their everyday work. &lt;strong&gt;As part of the interview process, you&#39;ll complete a brief AI-focused exercise or discussion so we can understand how you think about, design, and use AI to drive impact in your role. &lt;/strong&gt;Feel free to reference any tools, platforms, or workflows you use today — prior Glean experience isn&#39;t required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Data Privacy Notice for Job Candidates and Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Depending on your location, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), or other privacy laws may regulate the way we manage the data of job applicants. Our full notice outlining how data will be processed as part of the application procedure for applicable locations is available in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/privacy&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you are agreeing to our use and processing of your data as required. US applicants and their applications are subject to arbitration of disputes as outlined in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/arbitrationagreement&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Arbitration Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;By clicking “Submit Application,” I confirm that I have read the Global Data Privacy Notice and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/arbitrationagreement&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Arbitration Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and I agree to the terms.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Glean:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Glean is the Work AI platform that helps everyone work smarter with AI. What began as the industry’s most advanced enterprise search has evolved into a full-scale Work AI ecosystem, powering intelligent Search, an AI Assistant, and scalable AI agents on one secure, open platform. With over 100 enterprise SaaS connectors, flexible LLM choice, and robust APIs, Glean gives organizations the infrastructure to govern, scale, and customize AI across their entire business - without vendor lock-in or costly implementation cycles.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At its core, Glean is redefining how enterprises find, use, and act on knowledge. Its Enterprise Graph and Personal Knowledge Graph map the relationships between people, content, and activity, delivering deeply personalized, context-aware responses for every employee. This foundation powers Glean’s agentic capabilities - AI agents that automate real work across teams by accessing the industry’s broadest range of data: enterprise and world, structured and unstructured, historical and real-time. The result: measurable business impact through faster onboarding, hours of productivity gained each week, and smarter, safer decisions at every level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Recognized by Fast Company as one of the World’s Most Innovative Companies (Top 10, 2025), by CNBC’s Disruptor 50, Bloomberg’s AI Startups to Watch (2026), Forbes AI 50, and Gartner’s Tech Innovators in Agentic AI, Glean continues to accelerate its global impact. With customers across 50+ industries and 1,000+ employees in more than 25 countries, we’re helping the world’s largest organizations make every employee AI-fluent, and turning the superintelligent enterprise from concept into reality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you’re excited to shape how the world works, you’ll help build systems used daily across Microsoft Teams, Zoom, ServiceNow, Zendesk, GitHub, and many more. You&#39;ll be deeply embedded where people get things done. You&#39;ll ship agentic capabilities on an open, extensible stack, with the craft and care required for enterprise trust, as we bring Work AI to every employee, in every company.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The Solution Engineer role sits within the GTM organisation within the UK&amp;amp;I region, making you a trusted technical advisor to the local sales team, our partners, and our customers. You will work on many exciting projects with some of the most future-forward organizations, helping to guide the beginning of their Generative AI journeys.&amp;nbsp;This role has a strong technical skillset and not a classic SE profile.&amp;nbsp;At Glean, our Solution Engineers work with our customers to help them connect Glean to their most important decision-making platforms. These platforms include Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, Jira, Confluence, Slack, GitHub, Zendesk, and everything in between! As an SE, you will work closely with our local Account Executives (AEs) and will be responsible for the technical success and delivery of our sales opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Performing interactive demonstrations of the Glean platform to prospective customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Educating the technical teams of our prospective customers on the architecture of the Glean platform. Specifically, articulating the “how” of how our solution works in the context of the customer landscape.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Scoping and executing sponsored pilot and Proof of Value (PoV) exercises to ensure the technical requirements and business objectives that the Glean solution provides are validated.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Educating and training our customers and partners on our product to ensure that they are set up for success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Presenting at company-sponsored events such as Google Cloud Next and AWS re: invent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Liaising with Glean product managers and engineers to investigate issues, raise feature requests, and understand our future roadmap.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You will have a bachelor&#39;s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field (or equivalent work experience).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At least 5+ years of experience in enterprise software pre-sales and have used value-based discovery frameworks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You possess excellent analytical and problem-solving skills with the ability to handle complex technical challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are able to explain complex technical concepts in layman’s terms to help educate and train our customers, prospects, and partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You are comfortable presenting, both virtually and in person.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with cloud infrastructure (IaaS) platforms such as GCP, AWS, and Azure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with identity services and Single Sign-On (SSO) providers such as Azure/Entra ID, Okta, and protocols such as SAML, SCIM, and OIDC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with APIs, including sending and receiving data from API endpoints, and how to troubleshoot issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with security concepts and tools, e.g. Firewalls, VPNs, SSL/TLS, DLP, WAFs, and proxies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This role is London based&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Compensation offered will be determined by factors such as location, level, job-related knowledge, skills, and experience. Certain roles may be eligible for variable compensation, equity, and benefits.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We offer a comprehensive benefits package including competitive compensation, Medical, and Dental coverage, generous time-off policy, and the opportunity to contribute to your pension plan to support your long-term goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re committed to building and sustaining a diverse, inclusive workplace. We strive to attract and retain people with a wide range of backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we do not discriminate on the basis of gender, ethnicity, sexual orientation, religion, civil or family status, age, disability, or race.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-First Mindset at Glean:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Glean, AI fluency is core to how we work and we&#39;re committed to ensuring every new hire feels confident integrating AI into their everyday work. &lt;strong&gt;As part of the interview process, you&#39;ll complete a brief AI-focused exercise or discussion so we can understand how you think about, design, and use AI to drive impact in your role. &lt;/strong&gt;Feel free to reference any tools, platforms, or workflows you use today — prior Glean experience isn&#39;t required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global Data Privacy Notice for Job Candidates and Applicants:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Depending on your location, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA), or other privacy laws may regulate the way we manage the data of job applicants. Our full notice outlining how data will be processed as part of the application procedure for applicable locations is available in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/privacy&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. By submitting your application, you are agreeing to our use and processing of your data as required. US applicants and their applications are subject to arbitration of disputes as outlined in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/arbitrationagreement&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Arbitration Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;By clicking “Submit Application,” I confirm that I have read the Global Data Privacy Notice and the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glean.com/arbitrationagreement&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applicant Arbitration Agreement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, and I agree to the terms.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;We started a movement in which everyone can win – shoppers, retailers, society and every person on our team. To play fair, trust people and reward them for doing the right thing. We see and feel the impact of our work as more and more people gain financial freedom and retailers grow across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2014 in Sydney, Australia, Afterpay has over 24 million active customers globally and more than 250,000 of the best retailers around the world including&amp;nbsp; DSW, Finish Line, Levi’s, Primark, and M&amp;amp;S,and many others.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Afterpay, and now Clearpay in the UK, are helping people spend responsibly! We empower customers to access the things they want and need, while still allowing them to maintain financial wellness and control, by splitting payments in four, for both online and in-store purchases. Clearpay is deeply committed to delivering positive outcomes for customers. Now under the Block ecosystem, we are focused on supporting our community of shoppers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We trust in the next generation and share a vision of a more accessible and sustainable world in which people are rewarded for doing the right thing. Join a movement in which everyone can win.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Head of Mid Market and Enterprise Sales, you will join a successful dynamic team. We are looking for a passionate, and committed outbound Account Executive to engage and sell Clearpay to Mid Market merchants across the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outbound prospect via email and phone to generate new opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the entire sales funnel&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate conversations with senior executives and business owners at target accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a strong pipeline of opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify the metrics and key value propositions that will drive mutually beneficial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clearly demonstrate our USP&#39;s over and above our competitors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate and close long term contracts that benefit both Clearpay and our partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable to your target and demonstrate control of your opportunities through pipeline management and CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use defined sales methodology to progress opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with internal stakeholders from sales leadership to marketing through to finance to define contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full cycle sales and closing experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of delivering or exceeding targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can demonstrate success in a 360 sales role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience of selling at senior executive level and above&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of working with e-commerce, payments, fintech or retail verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A level of formal sales and negotiation training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity about people, business, and can inspire this passion in others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in seeking out and implementing feedback, and dedication to the improvement of your craft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tenacity and an ability to adapt to new situations quickly and think on your feet&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills that help you connect with customers by email and phone to establish trust and credibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to drive deals independently in a fast-paced, dynamic environment Business development experience (e.g. hunting and cold calling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative and team player mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior Salesforce experience or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Application Guidelines&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates may submit up to 9 active applications within a 60-day period. Reapplications to the same role are accepted 90 days after a previous application has been reviewed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI in Our Hiring Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use automated AI tools to evaluate job applications for efficiency and consistency. These tools comply with local regulations, including bias audits, and we handle all personal data in accordance with state and local privacy laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Contact us &lt;a href=&quot;https://privacy.block.xyz/privacyportal/form&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;with hiring practice or data usage questions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Every benefit we offer is designed with one goal: empowering you to do the best work of your career while building the life you want. Remote work, medical insurance, flexible time off, retirement savings plans, and modern family planning are just some of our offering.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://block.xyz/employee-benefits&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://block.xyz/documents/benefits.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Check out our other benefits at Block.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Block, Inc. (NYSE: XYZ) builds technology to increase access to the global economy. Each of our brands unlocks different aspects of the economy for more people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Square&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;makes commerce and financial services accessible to sellers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Cash App&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is the easy way to spend, send, and store money.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Afterpay&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is transforming the way customers manage their spending over time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;TIDAL&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a music platform that empowers artists to thrive as entrepreneurs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Bitkey&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a simple self-custody wallet built for bitcoin.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Proto&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;is a suite of bitcoin mining products and services. Together, we’re helping build a financial system that is open to everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://block.xyz/en/legal/applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Professional Services organization at Miro is focused on ensuring our Enterprise customers achieve exceptional outcomes through the Innovation Workspace. Our team of strategic advisors, implementation experts, and forward deployed consultants work side-by-side with customers to transform how they collaborate, build, and innovate—powered by agentic AI and Miro&#39;s world-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Forward Deployed Consultant, Manufacturing, you will apply AI solutions to transform and automate the core operating processes of leading industrial enterprises. You will engage directly with C-level executives, help them identify high-impact opportunities, build and test enterprise-grade AI solutions on their own data and systems, and drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of strategy, operations, and technology. You will be paired with an Account Executive against named accounts—hunting for problems worth solving, then proving they can be solved. Generalist FDCs lead client discussions across industries; as the Manufacturing Specialist, you are the dedicated depth they bring in when a pursuit turns on industrial expertise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Agenda:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior executives—COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, Chief Digital Officer, VP Manufacturing, VP Quality—to define an AI transformation agenda Miro can attach to&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the initial CxO conversation that creates awareness of what AI makes possible for the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities before committing to a Validation Sprint: sponsor authority, commitment, and the account&#39;s potential to become a multi-year, seven-figure relationship&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Validation Sprints:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-author the Sprint charter with the AE: the business problem, its value, our approach, exit criteria, and the partnership proposal that follows success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the Sprint end to end—immerse, prioritise, build, read out—developing and testing the solution on the customer&#39;s real data and systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take manufacturing processes apart and rebuild them on AI-first principles across five workflows: new product development and gate review, quality and continuous improvement, portfolio and program management, operations and launch readiness, and process development and transformation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build using Miro&#39;s AI Workflows, Prototypes, and Goals, Roadmaps &amp;amp; Delivery capabilities, extended through Miro&#39;s API, WebSDK, and MCP integrations into ERP, PLM, MES, and quality systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value and Conversion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn Sprint outcomes into a business value story, ROI model, and KPI baseline—grounded in metrics the customer already runs on: gate cycle time, requirement coverage at gate, defect recurrence, cost of poor quality, capacity utilisation, on-time launch rate, ramp-to-full-rate time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support executive leadership in delivering the Value Story read-out to the sponsor&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-own with the AE the conversion of Sprint outcomes into the partnership proposal and commercial approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the scope of Professional Services involvement post-sale and hand over cleanly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Package what you learn and radiate it—internally to Sales, Marketing, and Product, and externally through thought leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years in &lt;strong&gt;top-tier consulting, forward deployed engineering, solution consulting, or enterprise transformation&lt;/strong&gt;, weighted toward manufacturing and industrial environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;manufacturing operating processes&lt;/strong&gt;: NPI and stage-gate/APQP, engineering change management, quality systems (FMEA, 8D, PPAP), S&amp;amp;OP and production planning, lean and continuous improvement, maintenance and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with the &lt;strong&gt;industrial enterprise stack&lt;/strong&gt;—ERP (SAP or equivalent), PLM (Teamcenter, Windchill, 3DEXPERIENCE), MES, quality management systems—and where the data lives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Credibility with &lt;strong&gt;COO, Chief Supply Chain Officer, VP Operations, VP Quality&lt;/strong&gt;, and Plant General Manager stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional &lt;strong&gt;GenAI&lt;/strong&gt; skills: Miro, Cursor, Claude Code and Cowork, ChatGPT, Google and Microsoft suites, &lt;strong&gt;MCP&lt;/strong&gt; integrations, prompt and context engineering. You can &lt;strong&gt;build working solutions yourself&lt;/strong&gt; and orchestrate an AI Engineer when the build demands it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build a &lt;strong&gt;before/after value story&lt;/strong&gt; with financial and ROI analysis that survives finance scrutiny&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A &lt;strong&gt;business-problem-first&lt;/strong&gt; rather than product-first mindset, and the curiosity to take any process apart&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in both the boardroom and the plant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter who operates independently and under ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to &lt;strong&gt;travel&lt;/strong&gt; to customer sites up to 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We want you to feel supported, connected, and ready to grow. Our global benefits package generally includes equity, a wellbeing benefit, a WFH equipment allowance, and an annual Learning &amp;amp; Development stipend. Join a diverse team where you can do your best work. Full benefits may differ per location. If you would like to learn more about location-specific benefits, please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/app/board/uXjVG8Fi8Yc=/?moveToWidget=3458764661021134968&amp;amp;cot=10&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;Global Miro benefits board&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: #f9f6f0;&quot;&gt;#LI-JM2&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Miro&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Miro is a visual workspace for innovation that enables distributed teams of any size to build the next big thing. The platform&#39;s infinite canvas enables teams to lead engaging workshops and meetings, design products, brainstorm ideas, and more. Miro, co-headquartered in San Francisco and Amsterdam, serves more than 100M users and 250,000 companies collaborate in the Innovation Workspace. Miro was founded in 2011 and currently has more than 1,600 employees in 13 hubs around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;We are a team of dreamers. We look for individuals who dream big, work hard, and above all stay humble. Collaboration is at the heart of what we do and through our work together we hope to create a supportive, welcoming, and innovative environment. We strive to play as a team to win the world and create a better version of ourselves every day. If this sounds like something that excites you, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out more about life at Miro:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Youtube:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://www.youtube.com/@lifeatmiro&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Blog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;https://miro.com/careers/life-at-miro/all/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Instagram: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&quot;&gt;https://www.instagram.com/mirohq/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Miro, we strive to create and foster an environment of belonging and collaboration across cultural differences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Miro’s mission — &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Empower teams to create the next big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; — is how we think about our product, people, and culture. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe that creating big things requires diverse and inclusive teams. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Diversity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites all talent with different demography, identities and styles &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;to step in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;, and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; invites them to step &lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;closer together. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Every day, we are working to build a more diverse Miro, cultivate a sense of belonging for future and current Mironeers around the world, and foster an environment where everyone can collaborate and embrace differences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Miro handles and uses personal data of job applicants in line with its &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; found &lt;a href=&quot;https://miro.com/legal/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;PlayStation Studios is the game development division of Sony PlayStation and is responsible for developing some of the most recognisable and ambitious console games and franchises on PlayStation, including The Last of Us, Horizon, Spider-Man, God of War, Helldivers and Gran Turismo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with some of the best game studios in the world, and use data to help them make their games even better. We provide end-to-end analytics services for PlayStation Studios and use data to help them in the game development lifecycle. We are looking for talented people to join us in pushing the boundaries of game analytics for PlayStation games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers a flexible hybrid working arrangement, with most time spent working remotely unless you prefer to come into the office. We attend the office for key moments that matter, such as important team meetings, collaboration sessions and business activities where in-person engagement is beneficial.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Role Overview:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Data Engineer, you’ll work in our cross-disciplinary Data Platform team to ingest and process high-volume data.&amp;nbsp; You’ll work closely with our Game Analytics analysts and analytics engineers, who use this data to gain valuable insights both during game development and post-launch.&amp;nbsp; As a lead, you’ll scale our platform and help us define its technical direction, expand its reach, and help define and build the future of analytics for PlayStation games.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own parts of our pipeline, and drive improvements to achieve our technical and business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build supporting services for our pipeline, for example working on integrations with in-game maps and video tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate our data collection platform and our BI tools to enable studio self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Devops team, our analytics engineers, and stakeholders across the studio business group.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on improving data quality, lineage and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our existing tooling, improving quality and documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a technical expert and share than knowledge with your colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building and owning Data Pipelines for high-throughput streaming and batch data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are adept at writing code in Go or write Python with a willingness to learn Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in building robust, scalable, and resilient services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can demonstrate measurable impact that you have made in your current and previous roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy solving data problems, and can take responsibility for quality, investigations and remediation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud data services.&amp;nbsp; We use AWS data and analytics services, such as Amazon S3, Redshift, Kinesis, Data Firehose, Athena and AWS Glue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has made use of AI during the development cycle, including use of Claude Code, Codex or other harnesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with near real-time data processing, querying and visualisation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Omni Analytics, or a similar BI tool (Looker, Tableau etc).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHub and GitHub Actions experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Head of EMEA Operations will be responsible for leading all Operations activities across the EMEA region for Sony Interactive Entertainment, ensuring PlayStation products are planned, assembled, fulfilled, and delivered to customers with a consistently high level of service, efficiency, and operational control.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This senior leadership role will oversee Logistics, Transportation Control Tower Management, Warehousing 3PL Management, Sales Operations Order Fulfilment, Assembly and Fulfilment Planning across both B2B and D2C channels including PlayStation Direct.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working across a complex regional network, this role will lead cross-functional and multi-functional teams to ensure EMEA Operations is resilient, commercially aligned, customer-focused, and capable of supporting the continued growth of the PlayStation business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end EMEA Operations function, ensuring all logistics, warehousing, order management, assembly, and fulfilment planning activities are delivered to a high standard across B2B and D2C.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide leadership across regional Operations teams, setting direction, building capability, and ensuring clear accountability across all functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee Transportation Control Tower Management, ensuring inbound, outbound, and regional transport activities are coordinated effectively and deliver against cost, service, capacity, and customer commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Warehousing 3PL Management across the region, ensuring partners deliver efficient, agile, resilient, and cost-effective operations that support retail, distributor, eCommerce, and PlayStation Direct requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee Sales Operations and Order Management, ensuring customer orders are managed accurately, efficiently, and in line with commercial priorities and service expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Assembly and Fulfilment Planning activities, ensuring product availability, build readiness, localisation, channel allocation, and fulfilment execution are aligned to demand and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Commercial, Planning, Finance, D2C, Customer Service, Global Operations, Procurement, and external service partners to ensure operational plans support business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive continuous improvement across service, cost, operational resilience, partner performance, process quality, and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the Operations Excellence &amp;amp; Transformation teams to develop and define the strategic approach for the functions and the region including the creation of the MRP roadmap, regularly review KPI’s and focus metrics for the functions within your remit, ensuring the teams are communicating and providing clear updates and taking actions on any areas where there has been deviation from plan as well as where they are making improvements. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Regional Operations Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional and multi-functional Operations teams across EMEA (including supporting MEATICS and ANZ).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set regional strategy, priorities, governance, and performance expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Operations is aligned to commercial plans, customer requirements, product launches, promotional activity, and channel growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-performing culture focused on service excellence, accountability, collaboration, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Logistics &amp;amp; Transportation Control Tower&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee regional transportation performance across inbound, outbound, and customer delivery flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Transportation Control Tower provides strong visibility, issue management, escalation, and performance control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage transport partners against service, cost, capacity, and On Time In Full expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen resilience across routes, providers, processes, and peak planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Warehousing 3PL Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional warehouse operations through strategic 3PL partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure warehouse partners meet agreed service levels, productivity targets, cost expectations, and operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support B2B and D2C fulfilment requirements, including launches, peak periods, returns, value-added services, and customer-specific needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive improvement in warehouse efficiency, agility, scalability, and operational quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sales Operations &amp;amp; Order Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee order management processes across B2B and D2C channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure customer orders are processed accurately, prioritised appropriately, and fulfilled in line with business commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Commercial, Customer Service, Finance, and Planning teams to resolve order, allocation, availability, and fulfilment issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve order flow, service visibility, exception management, and customer communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively collaborate and communicate transparently with the commercial and SP&amp;amp;A teams, the finance team, IT teams, and other business functions to ensure best practice development and alignment whilst supporting the wider business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Assembly &amp;amp; Fulfilment Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead regional assembly and fulfilment planning activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure product localisation, build planning, channel readiness, and fulfilment execution are aligned to forecast, demand, and customer needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance B2B and D2C priorities across available supply, capacity, and operational constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks early and coordinate cross-functional actions to protect service and availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years’ experience in Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Fulfilment, Sales Operations, Planning, or a related regional leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience leading complex, multi-functional operations teams across regional or global environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of B2B and D2C operations, including order management, warehousing, transportation, fulfilment, and customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing 3PL warehousing partners, transportation providers, control tower operations, and regional logistics networks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership capability, with the ability to set direction, build teams, influence stakeholders, and deliver through complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and financial acumen, with experience managing cost, service, capacity, budgets, and partner performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills across Commercial, Planning, Finance, Customer Service, D2C, Procurement, Global Operations, and external partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a track record of driving operational improvement and service excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site bar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cycle garage and showers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
