&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About Zinier&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;80% of the workers across the globe are Deskless. These are the people who keep our lights on and gas flowing, build roads and bridges, run our manufacturing factories, ensure that we get healthcare service, and provide us with reliable phone and internet connectivity. As entrepreneurs, have we considered solving their problems and making them more productive?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zinier is a company on a mission to empower frontline workers - and the people supporting them - to achieve greater things for themselves and the world around them. With the majority of workers worldwide being deskless, Zinier recognizes the need for Technology Equity to improve the lives and productivity of these workers who keep the world up and running.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have global team headquartered in Silicon Valley, with a hybrid workforce across the United States, Canada, Europe, Latin America, Singapore, and Bangalore, India, with leading investors that include Accel, ICONIQ Capital, Founders Fund, Newfund Capital, NGP Capital, Tiger Global Management, and Qualcomm Ventures LLC.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a Solution Architect with a proven track record of transforming complex technical requirements into well-structured, customer-centric solutions, we’d love to meet you. Experience in Field Service Management is a must, particularly in defining system specifications and identifying opportunities to optimize solutions. You should also bring experience working on business transformation programs where product-based solutions must be adapted and scaled to fit dynamic environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who thrive in agile, collaborative, global teams and who enjoy working with best-in-class technology to deliver meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with lead solution architects to gather and analyze business and technical requirements, define solution scope, and document processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate workshops, customer meetings, and design sessions to align stakeholders on solution design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product, development, and cross-functional teams to design scalable, customer-aligned solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain technical implementation documentation (e.g., Low-Level Designs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate, configure, and customize product features while ensuring integration and implementation best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot technical issues, propose solutions, and provide post-implementation support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute insights to continuously improve Zinier’s product roadmap and delivery methodology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6–12 years of SaaS experience in professional services or client-facing roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Field Service Management (required).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in high-growth startups with evolving product roadmaps (preferred).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem-solving skills for addressing product gaps and business challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering solutions in an Agile environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with project management tools such as JIRA, Confluence, or equivalents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical knowledge of enterprise applications, workflows, integrations, and databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data models, JavaScript, and JSON.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication skills in English, with the ability to engage with stakeholders across diverse levels and backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail, reliability, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernization, connecting strategy directly to execution. Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. VML, part of WPP, supports WPP Enterprise Solutions by helping brands activate transformation through creativity and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Senior Project Manager and Release Manager needed to join our Delivery Team on a contractual basis.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Senior Project Manager, with a technical background, who has experience managing technical teams and releases across complex client environments. You encourage strong relationships with your team and have the ability the talk, at a technical level, with developers and senior technical team members (e.g., technical architects, solution architects etc). You follow best practices in development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development standards and coding reviews through having a good understanding of branching strategies, development principals and CI/CD.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please bear in mind that this is a contractual role.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Release and technical reporting regarding project/account technical deliverables, architecture and release pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify technical risks and issues &amp;amp; provide mitigation options to achieve resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeably communicate with stakeholders (internal/external) including chairing technical meetings as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and co-ordinate Internal technical specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and inspire the team to achieve individual and team objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the technical team(s) complete what is expected of them successfully and suggest improvements to processes as required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support to Junior Technical Project Managers within your account or across WTC&amp;amp;T giving them regular constructive feedback to help with their development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, plan, organise and manage the build of new infrastructure environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-ordinate high quality technical solutions, on time, via effective time management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with emerging industry practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively run complex projects using Agile or Waterfall methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee releases across pre-production and production environments, demonstrating an understanding of dependencies between client systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement technical governance according to the client’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build customer confidence by understanding their needs &amp;amp; delivering first class solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and manage client expectations, addressing issues in a respectful and timely manner and ensuring the organisation maintains a positive image and provides a high-quality service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage 3rd party product vendors, environments, and client technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Management experience, and ecommerce experience ideally within a retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to read log files, draw conclusions and direct further technical investigation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with eCommerce frameworks and hosting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of cloud/on prem. Infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Azure and AWS DevOps Tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining, managing and delivering to customer expectations within strict deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full knowledge of the project lifecycle and experience of various project development methodologies (including Agile, Incremental and Waterfall)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with complex technical environments and legacy systems integration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing 3rd parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong time management &amp;amp; organisational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation skills and an ability to handle sensitive issues with tact and diplomacy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant Project Management qualifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient with Microsoft Office Packages, especially MS Excel and MS PowerPoint&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;If you have some of this, even better&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS degree with a major in information management, marketing, communications, business or other closely-related areas is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A developer background or programming qualification is advantageous but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of Jenkins or other release pipeline tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of code management tools such as git, bit bucket, svn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A basic understanding of Terraform - at a level you can engage with technical teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Permanent only&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We offer a great benefits package including a discretionary bonus scheme, training opportunities, competitive pension, medical insurance, life assurance, social events, opportunities to buy and sell holidays, family friendly policies, discounts with hundreds of retailers and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;At&amp;nbsp; WPP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt; Enterprise Solutions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions designs, builds, and operates the growth systems that competitive businesses rely on. In a world where Al is reshaping how companies drive growth, we lead clients in business transformation and marketing modernisation, connecting strategy directly to execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our 12,000 experts in engineering and platforms, commerce, consulting, content transformation, CRM, and CX, work within a unified global operating unit across 40+ markets. WPP Enterprise Solutions works alongside best-in-class partners including Adobe, AWS, Braze, Google, Microsoft, Salesforce, and Shopify, as well as innovators in AI, to deliver growth solutions tailored to the needs of our clients’ businesses. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We have received distinction as a leader in Commerce Services and CX Strategy Consulting by the Forrester Wave™&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;To find out more&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://enterprisesolutions.wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;enterprisesolutions.wpp.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; and follow us on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/wpp-enterprise-solutions&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-EMEA #LI-HYBRID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. With exceptional talent, trusted data and intelligence and world-class partnerships – all united by our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open – we help clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to WPP (VML/WPP Enterprise Solutions). Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our maritime family of systems is AI-enabled and built for reliable performance in the harshest seas, delivering NATO a fully integrated hardware–software capability for scalable ISR and strike operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As the Lead Software Engineer, you will be responsible for leading complex multi-domain software developments for deployment on our growing fleet of autonomous vessels and ground systems. Interfacing with design teams across the UK and Europe, you will be the single coordination and point of contact for all things Maritime Software. This includes directing the roadmap of existing products, leading new developments and interfacing to 3rd party subcontractors and suppliers. You will need to scale between front-end GUIs, middleware, embedded systems, firmware and deep simulation technologies, working at the forefront of modern technology to increase levels of automation and push frontiers when required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Lead technical coordination and leadership across multiple product developments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Apply best-practice design and implementation for emergent technology software solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Manage and improve software engineering processes and practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Deliver high-level conceptual designs for new software products at both the application and embedded levels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Conduct make-vs-buy tradeoff studies and negotiate with suppliers and subcontractors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Interface with Systems and Electrical teams to advise on hosting platforms from PCs to embedded systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Support and participate in regular field testing and demonstrations with defence partners.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proven experience in leading complex integration and development programmes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Solid Software Engineering principles and best-practices, alongside knowledge of software standards (civilian/automotive/defence).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Knowledge of multi-stage Validation &amp;amp; Verification techniques and simulation techniques/targets (from software-regression to Hardware-in-Loop platforms).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Understanding of communication pathways (Ethernet/Fieldbus), real-time control techniques/limitations, and appreciation of Application (Linux), Embedded, and Firmware platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent problem-solving ability in high-pressure, resource-constrained environments and strong collaborative communication skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Eligibility for UK Security Clearance and ability to travel to South West England when required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;A newly created role to help Databricks create new product categories. As Databricks accelerates its most strategic products, we are investing ahead of the curve in the partner ecosystem that helps our customers adopt them, and we are building a new specialisation function to lead that effort. You will pioneer it across EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to: Director, Partner Field Engineering (EMEA).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior Product Specialist Partner Solutions Architect, you own how our leading System Integrator partners develop deep, market-leading expertise in Databricks&#39; priority products:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OLTP/Postgres (Lakebase):&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks&#39; fully managed, Postgres-compatible operational (OLTP) database for intelligent applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product AI (Genie):&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks&#39; natural-language analytics experience, letting anyone ask questions of governed data conversationally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Router &amp;amp; Governance (Unity Gateway):&lt;/strong&gt; Databricks&#39; governed gateway for securely managing, monitoring and routing access to AI and large language model endpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Migrations &amp;amp; Modernisation:&lt;/strong&gt; moving legacy data warehouses and platforms onto the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn-key Solutions:&lt;/strong&gt; Cybersecurity (Lakewatch) and CDP (CustomerLake) with more to come&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your mandate is to take our leading partners to the highest tier of Centre-of-Excellence product specialisation on these products, and to turn them into independent, market-leading extensions of the Databricks field. Working hand in hand with our EMEA Product Specialist team, you will carry both the deep technical narrative and the business-value and go-to-market narrative that get these products positioned, adopted and scaled through the partner channel. This is a builder&#39;s role: you will design the blueprint for a partner product-specialist function that Databricks scales globally, starting in EMEA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are trying to achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks&#39; priority products are seeing strong momentum across EMEA. Lakebase is one of the fastest-growing additions to our platform, Unity Gateway is newly generally available, and AI/BI + Genie are changing how customers work with their data. As adoption accelerates, our partners are central to helping customers realise value quickly and at scale. Deepening partner expertise in these products is one of the most powerful levers we have to accelerate customer time-to-value, and this role exists to build that capability deliberately and ahead of demand, so our partners lead the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What the role owns&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the partner specialist community (the day-to-day).&lt;/strong&gt; Select, enable and certify leading EMEA partners to the highest tier of product specialisation, running the enablement engine end to end: partner selection, technical upskilling to expert depth, certification and first joint customer wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnering with our Product Specialist team.&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the partner-side counterpart to Databricks&#39; EMEA Product Specialists, bringing the latest product expertise to partners, connecting partner enablement to live customer opportunities, and channelling partner and customer adoption insight back to our product organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling specialist capacity through partners.&lt;/strong&gt; Grow models where specialised partners bring product-specialist capacity to joint customers, so expertise scales across the ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Launch-partner motions.&lt;/strong&gt; Position specialised partners as launch partners for major product releases, signalling ecosystem trust and accelerating go-to-market at each milestone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thought leadership and the business-value narrative.&lt;/strong&gt; Author the &quot;better-together&quot; technical and commercial story for these products in the partner channel: reference architectures, positioning, partner offers and value framing that let partners sell and deliver independently. Be a visible voice for partner product specialisation, internally and externally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building the function.&lt;/strong&gt; Define the operating model, the specialisation and certification criteria, the partner selection bar and the cadence, and create the template Databricks adopts to scale this function worldwide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate customer adoption and time-to-value on Databricks&#39; priority products by putting genuine product depth into the partner channel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grow partner-led momentum behind our fastest-growing products, building partner capability ahead of the demand curve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate leading EMEA System Integrators to full independence on the priority products, so they operate as market leaders and true extensions of the Databricks field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a repeatable, globally scalable partner product-specialist function, proven in EMEA and exported across Databricks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive hands-on experience with the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform, with genuine depth in at least two of the priority products above and the ability to get to depth quickly on the rest. This is a senior role for an established Databricks expert.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build partner or field capability at scale: enablement, certification and community-building that turns others into independent experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business-value and go-to-market instinct: able to translate technical depth into commercial positioning and partner-led market impact, and to engage partner and customer organisations at senior-executive level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated thought leadership: authoring technical and business content (reference architectures, solution guides, positioning, playbooks) and presenting complex products credibly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 5 years of technical pre-sales or sales-methodology experience in a consumption business model, and experience designing and delivering end-to-end data, warehousing and AI architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding experience in a core language (Python, SQL, Java or Scala) and hands-on experience building data applications or AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The maturity to build a new function from the ground up: defining the operating model, standards and cadence, and managing multiple changing priorities across a partner ecosystem and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt; System Integrator or consulting background; experience with transactional databases (e.g. PostgreSQL) and application development; experience with LLM gateways, AI governance or AI security; experience running partner specialisation, certification or champion programmes; additional European languages.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role requires up to 40% travel across EMEA, to partner sites, Databricks offices and key industry events.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;SLSQ328R126&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role presents a unique opportunity to expand Databricks’ presence within a set list of customers across top consumer and distribution companies in the UK and Ireland.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the Enterprise Sales Leader, the Enterprise Account Executive is an experienced sales professional focused on driving adoption of Databricks to unlock new value streams and expand Enterprise accounts. Passionate about solving business challenges, you excel at initiating and advancing conversations to value delivery using a defined methodology and playbook.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Skilled at selling innovation, you guide deals to accelerate decision-making, articulate product value to customers and partners, and collaborate with cross-functional teams to grow existing accounts across a diverse territory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work with cross-functional teams to build out Databricks solutions for customers within consumer and distribution industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess your accounts and develop a strategy to identify and engage all buying centers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use a solution-based approach to selling and creating value for enterprise growth accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable switching between technical stakeholder and business buyer personas, in order to connect the customers challenges to business value through the entire sales cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and secure tech wins to grow consumption while managing longer, complex sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track all customer details including projects, purchase time frames, next steps, and forecasting in Salesforce and supporting softwares&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Map the whitespace opportunity across your defined territory, and use methodology to identify the most viable use cases in each account to maximise Databricks’ impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate and work with internal and external partner teams to maximise the impact on your ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build value with all engagements to promote successful negotiations to close point&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be customer-focused by delivering technical and business results using the Databricks Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What we look for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong closing experience and evidence of exceeding sales quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales experience within cloud data and AI software, ideally linked to open source technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving consistent high activity to generate, develop &amp;amp; accelerate pipeline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sales methodologies and playbooks (e.g. ICP, territory and account tiering, MEDDPICC, Powerbase and value selling)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate and be successful in a fast-growing organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving successful adoption of usage-based consumption services (SaaS) and co-selling with AWS, Azure and Google Cloud teams&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Methods for co-developing business cases and gaining support from C-level Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s Degree or equivalent experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Grafana Labs is the company behind Grafana Cloud, the fully managed observability platform trusted by more than 10,000 organizations to ensure reliability, resolve incidents faster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager, Grafana Frontend&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Grafana is an open-source observability product and a platform that teams and plugin developers build on. The Frontend group shapes its user experience (from dashboards and visualisation to navigation, search and sharing) and the foundations that support engineering teams and community contributors across the Grafana ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Senior Engineering Manager, you’ll lead the Frontend Platform and Navigation squads, owning their performance, delivery and customer outcomes. Frontend Platform enables teams to build reliable, high-quality experiences; Navigation helps users find and organise resources and move confidently through Grafana.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;You’ll develop senior engineers, partner with Product and Design, and improve how teams work, including through AI and automation. We use Cloud-first rollout and experimentation to learn quickly, bringing relevant improvements to OSS and Enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI Notice: We invest heavily in developer productivity. You can use modern AI coding assistants as part of your daily workflow (your choice of tools, within security guidelines), backed by a company-funded usage budget so you can iterate quickly without unnecessary friction. We encourage pragmatic AI-assisted development: faster prototyping, test generation, refactors, documentation, and incident follow-ups—always with strong code review and quality standards. You&#39;ll also have access to the latest frontier models from OpenAI, Anthropic, and Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be accountable for the performance of &lt;strong&gt;two&lt;/strong&gt; distributed engineering squads: set clear expectations, delegate effectively, coach and develop each team member, give timely feedback, address performance gaps and build a culture of trust and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own hiring and team planning across both squads, aligning team capacity and skills with product priorities and longer-term needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery with your squads: engage directly with customers, community members and internal users, combine their feedback with research and usage evidence, and use those insights to shape roadmaps and priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design and engineering leaders to set priorities, resolve dependencies and make trade-offs between customer needs, long-term investments and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own delivery across both squads from discovery through rollout and measurement: set milestones, surface risks early and intervene when commitments are at risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI regularly in your management work to synthesise research and feedback, inform roadmap and resourcing decisions, and streamline coordination, reporting and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve how the squads plan, make decisions and deliver. Lead the adoption of AI and automation across engineering and operational workflows, evaluating their impact on delivery speed, quality and time spent on repetitive work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction with senior engineers for the frontend foundations owned by your squads, including developer experience, accessibility, architecture, tooling, reliability and multitenant capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set engineering direction for navigation, search and resource organisation, including where AI-assisted discovery can help users find what they need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and uphold engineering standards for quality, security and operability, including how teams evaluate and validate AI-assisted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead improvements across Grafana and R&amp;amp;D that increase engineering productivity and improve business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the engineering management on-call rota, coordinate responses and drive improvements that reduce recurring disruption. Regularly use Grafana’s AI capabilities for observability, incident investigation and management, bringing that experience into product feedback and roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes You a Great Fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience managing senior engineers, building healthy teams and developing technical leaders. You give clear feedback and address performance gaps directly and fairly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical foundation in modern web or frontend systems, enabling you to evaluate technical trade-offs and shape architectural and engineering-quality decisions with senior engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of turning ambiguous, cross-team problems into clear priorities and measurable results, managing delivery risks and operational demands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong product and customer judgement, with the ability to connect engineering investments to user, developer and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written communication and the ability to work effectively in a remote, globally distributed organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An appreciation for open-source development and the judgement to balance Cloud-first delivery with the needs of customers, community members and internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI and automation in your own leadership work, and leading teams to adopt them effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with React, TypeScript or comparable large-scale frontend ecosystems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a developer platform team, including support for plugins or extensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with navigation, search, information architecture or resource-management products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering multitenant SaaS or major platform migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working on a widely adopted open-source product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Germany, the Base compensation range for this role is EUR &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;124,571&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;- EUR &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;149,485&lt;/span&gt;. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed in the interview process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;*Compensation ranges are country specific. If you are applying for this role from a different location than listed above, your recruiter will discuss your specific market’s defined pay range &amp;amp; benefits at the beginning of the process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Thrive at Grafana Labs:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;100% Remote, Global Culture -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;As a remote-only company, we bring together talent from around the world, united by a culture of collaboration and shared purpose.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scaling Organization&lt;/strong&gt; – Tackle meaningful work in a high-growth, ever-evolving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Transparent Communication&lt;/strong&gt; – Expect open decision-making and regular company-wide updates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation-Driven&lt;/strong&gt; – Autonomy and support to ship great work and try new things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Open Source Roots&lt;/strong&gt; – Built on community-driven values that shape how we work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empowered Teams&lt;/strong&gt; – High trust, low ego culture that values outcomes over optics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Growth Pathways&lt;/strong&gt; – Defined opportunities to grow and develop your career.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Approachable Leadership&lt;/strong&gt; – Transparent execs who are involved, visible, and human.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate People&lt;/strong&gt; – Join a team of smart, supportive folks who care deeply about what they do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In-Person onboarding &lt;/strong&gt;- We want you to thrive from day 1 with your fellow new ‘Grafanistas’ to learn all about what we do and how we do it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balance is Key&lt;/strong&gt; - We operate a global annual leave policy of 30 days per annum. 3 days of your annual leave entitlement are reserved for Grafana Shutdown Days to allow the team to really disconnect. &lt;em&gt;*We will comply with local legislation where applicable.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Grafana Labs is an equal opportunities employer. We welcome applications from everyone regardless of race, colour, nationality, origin, caste, sex, gender reassignment identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, religion or belief, disability, veteran status, genetic information, pregnancy, maternity, marital, family or carer status, or any other characteristic which is protected by local law. We believe that equality and diversity build a strong organisation, and we work hard to ensure that is the foundation of our organisation as we grow.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Grafana Labs may utilize AI tools in its recruitment process to assist in matching information provided in CVs to job postings. The recruitment team will continue to review inbound CVs manually to identify alignment with current openings.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;For information about how your personal data is used once you’ve applied to a job, check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://grafana.com/legal/applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;privacy policy&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Subject Matter Expert (SME), you&#39;ll be the deepest technical voice in the field for one product group, helping customers make technical decisions on GitLab&#39;s most important opportunities, roughly the top 10% by size or complexity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Account Solutions Architects (Account SAs) will bring you into prioritized opportunities. The Account SA owns the opportunity; you own your product group&#39;s success within it. You&#39;ll work directly with Product and Engineering, bringing customer needs and field insights into roadmap discussions. You&#39;ll also help the wider Solutions Architecture team build expertise through reusable assets, enablement, and coaching.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll specialize in one product group, not all four. In Security &amp;amp; Compliance, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Ultimate, application security, Dependency Firewall, software supply chain security, compliance, and artificial intelligence (AI) governance. In Platform, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Dedicated, self-managed deployments, bring your own model, and cloud and hybrid architecture. In Core DevSecOps, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Premium, continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD), source code management, Orbit, Artifact Central, and migrations. DevSecOps brings development, security, and operations together across software delivery. In AI &amp;amp; Competitive, you&#39;ll focus on GitLab Duo Agent Platform, agentic workflows, AI-native development, competitive displacement including GitHub, and migrations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your success will be measured by technical win rate and bookings on SME-engaged opportunities, product-category commit attainment and consumption growth in your region, and Proof of Value (PoV) conversion rate, evaluation cycle time, and time from technical win to production use. We&#39;ll also measure how often Account SAs reuse your assets, their confidence in handling your product group without escalation, and the quality and impact of your feedback to Product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the technical authority for your product group on prioritized opportunities, from discovery and architecture through trials and PoV evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical deep dives, workshops, and executive briefings that connect product capabilities to business outcomes and explain how GitLab differs from competing solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and improve standardized PoV templates with clear, repeatable success criteria. Account SAs own the customer PoV; you&#39;ll contribute product-specific content and expertise while keeping the evaluation connected to the broader GitLab platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Equip account teams for product launches with Product Management and Product Marketing. Build demos and talk tracks, and turn early customer wins into reference stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the escalation point for Account SAs and Post-Sales Solutions Architects (Post-Sales SAs) on complex product questions, integrations, and objections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hand off PoV success criteria and architecture decisions to the Post-Sales SA with the account team when an opportunity closes. Stay involved until the customer&#39;s first production workload uses the product, and support complex accounts when Post-Sales SAs bring you in to drive adoption and consumption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring structured field feedback, competitive insights, and customer requirements to Product Management and Engineering with the wider SME team. Help manage early-access and design-partner programs, and represent GitLab through customer events, conferences, industry working groups, and published content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reference architectures, demo environments, competitive battlecards, PoV playbooks, and enablement content so account teams can handle more opportunities without your direct involvement. Mentor Account SAs and contribute to GitLab&#39;s global SME community of practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Substantial experience in technical pre-sales, solutions architecture, consulting, or software engineering, with deep, hands-on expertise in one domain: application security testing, supply chain security, and compliance; scalable cloud and hybrid platforms; large CI/CD environments and source code migrations; or production AI-assisted development, working prototypes, and competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical expertise in agentic and AI-assisted development workflows across planning, coding, testing, security, and delivery, applied in a customer-facing, pre-sales context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience winning technical decisions on large, complex enterprise opportunities through structured Proof of Concept (PoC) or PoV evaluations with defined success criteria and executive sign-off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git, CI/CD, containers, Kubernetes, and at least one major cloud provider.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to lead a whiteboard session with engineers and present the business case to executives in the same meeting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written communication, including the ability to turn complex topics into clear playbooks that others use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working asynchronously across time zones with Sales, Product, and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional: public speaking, published technical content, open source contributions, or relevant certifications in Kubernetes, cloud architecture, or security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you bring transferable experience in an adjacent domain, we encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re building our SME organization within GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architecture team, and we&#39;re distributed and all-remote.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GumGum is The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising. We’re an advertising technology company delivering results by matching brands with people in the right mindset in the moments that matter. Our platform is powered by the Mindset Graph™, our AI-driven data engine that processes billions of real-time contextual, creative, environmental, and historical signals to match every ad with the most receptive audience. The result is advertising that drives meaningful outcomes for advertisers and publishers, and is more relevant for consumers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We were founded in 2008 and are headquartered in Santa Monica, California, operating in over 19 markets across North America, Europe, Japan, and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our principles guide our work every day and are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer-Obsessed:&lt;/strong&gt; We’re focused on advertising solutions that solve needs and drive success for clients and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it Happen:&lt;/strong&gt; We have a bias for action and take ownership to deliver results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Always Innovate:&lt;/strong&gt; We push boundaries with creativity and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster Belonging:&lt;/strong&gt; We ensure colleagues feel included, supported, and empowered to thrive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be a part of The Mindset Company™ transforming advertising, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.gumgum.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.gumgum.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Düsseldorf, the Group Digital Director, Germany is an experienced player/coach who leads a local sales team of two while remaining personally active in the market to drive revenue targets across the Düsseldorf agency ecosystem. Serving as the key regional leader, this role leverages senior holding-company relationships across major media agencies to open doors, negotiate trading deals, and secure agency development opportunities. Operating in close alignment with the Hamburg team and broader EU stakeholders, the Director establishes strategic patch goals, accurate financial forecasting, and seller development while representing GumGum at industry events.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Achieve&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and exceed the Düsseldorf revenue target while leading and coaching a team of two sellers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a player/coach in-market, maintaining senior holding-company relationships, joining key pitches, and unblocking deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate, renew, and grow Düsseldorf agency trading deals and commercial agreements to ensure profitability and scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute annual/quarterly planning, set sales strategies, manage pipeline coverage, and deliver accurate financial forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, motivate, and develop the Düsseldorf sales team through regular operating cadences and performance reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Hamburg sales leadership and wider EU teams to drive national agency development and product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent GumGum at German industry events and collaborate cross-functionally with AdOps, Client Success, and Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience in digital media, ad tech, or advertising sales, with significant time in the German market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Native or near-native German fluency and professional fluency in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Established, trusted relationships across the Düsseldorf agency ecosystem (especially holding companies and key independents).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven sales management experience, with a track record of developing sellers and leading distributed or split-location teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of programmatic buying, ad serving, and the German digital ad landscape (knowledge of attention/contextual solutions is a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience negotiating agency trading deals and holding firm on commercial terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills and proficiency with PowerPoint, Excel, and CRM tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn about our benefits &amp;amp; perks package at &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/benefits&quot;&gt;gumgum.com/benefits&lt;/a&gt;. If you&#39;d like additional information, your recruiter can share more specifics during the hiring process!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Note: GumGum fosters a flexible work environment, offering GumGummers the ability to work either in-office or remotely/from home. However, for occasional in-person collaboration, we kindly ask that this position be located within a &#39;commutable&#39; distance to our office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Awards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 &amp;amp; 2026 Digiday Media Awards Europe Best Contextual Targeting Offering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 AdExchanger Awards AI Innovators, Technology &amp;amp; Service Provider, Finalist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2025 MARKETECH APAC Marketing Technology Awards Silver Winner for Best Contextual Advertising Tech Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always learning and evolving as a company, and we continue to take thoughtful steps to support our people and strengthen our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Follow Us on Social&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Instagram: @gumgum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&quot;&gt;https://www.linkedin.com/company/gumgum/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;YouTube: @GumGumInc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TikTok: @itsgumgum&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beware of recruitment scams.&lt;/strong&gt; GumGum recruits only for active roles on our careers page, accepts applications through Greenhouse, and communicates only via LinkedIn or ----- / ----- email addresses. We never use chat apps, ask you to register on other recruiting sites, or request financial information, payments or purchases. &lt;a href=&quot;https://gumgum.com/contact&quot;&gt;Verify suspicious outreach&lt;/a&gt; before sharing personal information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Seyond?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seyond™ is a global leader in high fidelity LiDAR solutions, powering the future of mobility across ADAS, ITS, Robotics, Stationary and Off-Road industries. Seyond delivers a dynamic portfolio of robust, high resolution LiDAR sensors, perception software, and the Seyond ITS Management Platform (SIMPL). Founded in Silicon Valley with a global footprint, Seyond is dedicated to the highest quality engineering and manufacturing, and unwavering commitment to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Seyond ITS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drawing on deep expertise in precision sensing and edge intelligence, Seyond offers a robust portfolio of LiDAR sensors, perception software, and transportation analytics solutions designed to improve roadway safety, traffic operations, and multimodal mobility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This portfolio includes the SIMPL™ ITS Management Platform, Seyond’s LiDAR-based detection solution for smart intersections and highways. SIMPL operates as a distinct business unit with dedicated pricing and go-to-market authority across two verticals: urban intersection management and interurban highway, tunnel, and tolling detection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Director, ITS, Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote, Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Seyond ITS — SIMPL, our LiDAR-based smart intersection and highway detection platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type: &lt;/strong&gt;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Seyond SIMPL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SIMPL is scaling its international footprint across Europe, APAC, and emerging markets, and is building out dedicated regional sales leadership to match the growth already underway in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Sales Director, ITS, Europe to build and lead SIMPL’s sales function across Europe — a role modeled on the regional sales leadership Seyond has already established in the Americas. You will sit above SIMPL’s country-level sales representatives across Europe, giving the region a single accountable sales leader for the first time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role. We need someone who has personally carried and exceeded a sales quota — not a candidate whose background is purely sales operations or account management — and who can also recruit, coach, and manage a small, distributed team of regional reps as the European organization scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead SIMPL’s European sales organization, recruiting, onboarding, and coaching country and regional sales representatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally own and close strategic opportunities while the regional team is being built out, transitioning toward a team-quota model as the organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute go-to-market strategy across both SIMPL verticals: urban intersection management and inter-urban highway/tunnel/tolling detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow relationships with European distributors, system integrators, and OEM partners, alongside direct engagement with end-user agencies and pilot customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the European sales pipeline and forecast in HubSpot, maintaining accurate deal ownership, stage progression, and close-date discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SIMPL at European trade shows, industry events, and customer meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SIMPL’s European engineering team on technical qualification and solution scoping for major opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Head of Global ITS Business and BU leadership on regional pricing, deal structuring, and strategic account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear rep-level KPIs that balance new-business generation with existing-account growth, supported by weekly activity tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B sales experience, ideally in ITS, smart infrastructure, industrial IoT/sensors, or another technical, tender-driven market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven personal quota-carrying track record as an individual contributor — a genuine “hunter,” not primarily an account manager or sales-ops leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or leading a distributed regional sales team, ideally spanning multiple European countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing both channel relationships (distributors, OEMs, system integrators) and direct end-user/agency sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating public-sector or government tender processes is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; German or another major European language is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An existing network in European traffic management, tolling, or highway agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling LiDAR, radar, or other sensor-based detection technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HubSpot or a comparable CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive base and incentive package, benchmarked to Director-level sales leadership roles in the European technology/industrial sector. Final compensation band to be confirmed following market benchmarking. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;section id=&quot;Rolleneinführung&quot; class=&quot;section&quot; data-anchorname=&quot;Rolleneinführung&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-[var(--max-w-content)] mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rte&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;Gestalte mit uns, wie Technologie Unternehmen verändert – und deine Karriere gleich mit.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;HSO gehört seit über 21 Jahren zum Microsoft Inner Circle – der exklusiven Top 1 % aller Partner weltweit – und wurde 26-mal als Microsoft Partner of the Year ausgezeichnet. Mit über 30 Jahren Erfahrung, 2.800 Mitarbeitenden aus 43 Nationen und 33 Standorten weltweit verbinden wir technologische Exzellenz mit tiefem Branchenverständnis.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;rgb(0, 0, 0)&quot;&gt;Wir gestalten die digitale Zukunft des internationalen Mittelstands und von Großunternehmen. Als treibende Kraft für digitale Transformation implementieren wir komplexe, globale &lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;Microsoft Dynamics 365&amp;nbsp;Multiworkload-Architekturen&lt;/strong&gt; (Finance, Supply Chain, Manufacturing, CE). Dabei gehen wir neue Wege: Wir verknüpfen klassische Projektmethodik mit den modernsten &lt;strong data-ogsc=&quot;&quot;&gt;KI- und AI-Werkzeugen&lt;/strong&gt;, um Projekte schneller, transparenter und effizienter zum Erfolg zu führen.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS DICH ERWARTET:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Beratung und Lösungsfindung&lt;/strong&gt;: Als Solution Architect Professional Services ist deine Hauptaufgabe, Unternehmen mit Projektgeschäft oder Dienstleistern dabei zu unterstützen, die richtigen IT-Lösungen für ihre spezifischen Geschäftsanforderungen zu finden. In der Rolle des Solution Architects bist du ein wesentlicher Teil des Projekt-Governance-Teams und übernimmst, zusammen mit dem PM und dem Industrie-Lead, die Verantwortung für Scope, Architectur, Budget sowie Qualität in unseren Projekten. Du arbeitest eng mit den Kunden zusammen, um ihre Geschäftsprozesse zu verstehen und zu analysieren. Auf Grundlage dieser Informationen entwickelst du maßgeschneiderte Lösungen und Konzepte, die größtenteils auf Microsoft Dynamics 365 basieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Driven Consulting:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Du nutzt aktiv modernste KI-Tools (z. B. Microsoft Copilot, generative KI für die Dokumentation und KI-gestützte Agenten)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implementierung und Führung:&lt;/strong&gt; Nachdem du die passende Lösung unter Berücksichtigung des Best-Practice-Ansatz mit dem Projekt-Team konzipiert hast, bist du für die fachliche Implementierung und Integration von Microsoft Dynamics 365 in die bestehende IT-Infrastruktur des Kunden verantwortlich. Du steuerst und führst dabei das HSO-Projekt-Team sowie den Kunden, um das Projekt erfolgreich und in guter Qualität umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technisches Know-how:&lt;/strong&gt; Du bist auf dem neuesten Stand der Entwicklungen in Microsoft Dynamics 365 und insbesondere im Rahmen der Abwicklung von Projektgeschäften und Dienstleistern. Dies erfordert kontinuierliche Weiterbildung und die Fähigkeit, technisches Wissen in geschäftliche Lösungen umzusetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tools und Methoden@HSO: &lt;/strong&gt;Du wendest unsere ausgezeichnete Projektmethodik HSO Excellerate™ in klassischer oder agiler Ausprägung an und nutzt Microsoft Dynamics 365 Unified Operations sowie weitere moderne Produkte wie die Microsoft Power Platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;Qualifikationen&quot; class=&quot;section&quot; data-anchorname=&quot;Qualifikationen&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-[var(--max-w-content)] mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rte&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS DICH AUSZEICHNET:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein abgeschlossenes Studium in einem MINT-Studiengang, BWL, Supply-Chain-Management und relevante Erfahrung der Prozesse im Projektgeschäft und/oder Dienstleistungsgeschäft sowie die Abwicklung dieser Prozesse im Bereich Dynamics 365&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Projekterfahrung in der Beratung von Geschäftsanwendungen als Inhouse-Consultant und/oder für ein Beratungshaus mit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Branchenkenntnisse aus dem Bereich Dienstleistungen/Professional Services oder aus dem Bereich Anlagenbau/Engineer-to-Order&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Führungs-, Kommunikations- und Präsentationsfähigkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine hohe Leidenschaft für modernste KI-Tools (z. B. Microsoft Copilot, generative KI und KI-gestützte Agenten)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch– und gute Englischkenntnisse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Projektbezogene Reisebereitschaft&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;Vorteile &amp;amp; über HSO&quot; class=&quot;section&quot; data-anchorname=&quot;Vorteile &amp;amp; über HSO&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;container mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;max-w-[var(--max-w-content)] mx-auto&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;rte&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WAS WIR BIETEN:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result Orientation: &lt;/strong&gt;Du arbeitest bei einem der global größten und erfolgreichsten Microsoft-Partner im Bereich Microsoft Dynamics 365 und treibst damit die digitale Transformation voran&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Self Determination: &lt;/strong&gt;Bei uns steht die Kommunikation auf Augenhöhe im Mittelpunkt - mit deinen Ideen und Erfahrungen kannst du dich bei uns einbringen, eigenständig agieren und damit den Unternehmenserfolg aktiv mitgestalten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; Da Menschen bei HSO den Unterschied machen, kannst du dich auf eine unterstützende, vertrauensvolle und wertschätzende Arbeitsatmosphäre freuen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Wir werden dich mit Trainingsangeboten durch unsere hauseigene HSO Academy und externe Schulungspartner in Kombination mit einem individuellen Karrierepfad fördern&lt;/li&gt;
